Bluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/d36db094e7a028a6b653e5dd848e6e61106ecddf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:09:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:09:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v5.0.4\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed Grafana not finding the InfluxDB running next to it in Docker: the provisioned data source pointed at `iob_influxdb_<instance>`, while the container was named `iob_influxdb_<instance>_flux_data` because the compose file gave it a name of its own. Inside the shared network only the container name resolves, so the data source could not connect. The influx service uses the default name of the instance now - the name the data source and `testConnection()` both expect\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed the port of that data source: it used the port published on the host, although Grafana reaches InfluxDB inside the docker network, where the container port 8086 applies. The data source broke as soon as the port was changed in the settings\n* (@GermanBluefox) Fixed the Grafana container never being started when Grafana is enabled and InfluxDB is not: the plugin waits for the readiness signal of the adapter before it starts any container of the instance, and that signal was only sent when both were switched on. That state is reachable by switching InfluxDB off afterwards - the Grafana checkbox is hidden then, but its stored value stays\n* (@GermanBluefox) The \"automatic image update\" setting of Grafana had no effect: the compose file never passed it on to the plugin\n* (@GermanBluefox) **Existing installations with InfluxDB in Docker have to remove the old container once**, because it is renamed by the first fix: `docker rm -f iob_influxdb_<instance>_flux_data`. It still holds the published port, so the correctly named container cannot start next to it. The data is not affected - it lives in the volumes, which keep their names","tree":{"sha":"5d56655e41d8058b169087d72f36f10d13bab0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/5d56655e41d8058b169087d72f36f10d13bab0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/d36db094e7a028a6b653e5dd848e6e61106ecddf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/d36db094e7a028a6b653e5dd848e6e61106ecddf","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKGQzNmRiMDk0ZTdhMDI4YTZiNjUzZTVkZDg0OGU2ZTYxMTA2ZWNkZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75","sha":"0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75"}],"sha":"d36db094e7a028a6b653e5dd848e6e61106ecddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/d36db094e7a028a6b653e5dd848e6e61106ecddf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:08:22Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T14:08:22Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Removed unused overrides","tree":{"sha":"49afeac6e896f640a6a1eb7a80030494b085cada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/49afeac6e896f640a6a1eb7a80030494b085cada"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKDBjY2NjZGMyYTUxNDFiZDAyNTUxMDk0MWEzNzZmOThhYjRlYjBlNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad","sha":"7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad"}],"sha":"0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/0ccccdc2a5141bd025510941a376f98ab4eb0e75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:56:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:56:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"fix: make the Grafana container reach the InfluxDB next to it\n\nThe provisioned Grafana data source pointed at `iob_influxdb_<instance>`, but\nthe compose file gave the influx service a `container_name` of its own, so the\nplugin named the container `iob_influxdb_<instance>_flux_data`. Inside the\nshared network only the container name resolves - the data source could not\nconnect, and Grafana stayed empty. `flux_data` is also the name of the volume\nnext to it, which is where the copy/paste came from.\n\nThe influx service uses the default name of the instance now\n(`container_name: true`). That is the name the data source already expects, and\nalso the one the container gets that `testConnection()` starts on its own when\nno manager is running - before this, those two paths created two different\ncontainers competing for the published port.\n\nThe port of the data source was wrong for the same reason: it used the port\npublished on the host, although the connection runs inside the docker network,\nwhere the container port 8086 applies. It broke as soon as the port was changed\nin the settings.\n\nSecond, the readiness signal for the docker plugin was only sent when InfluxDB\n*and* Grafana were switched on. The grafana service is labeled with\n`iobWaitForReady`, which makes the plugin hold back every container of the\ninstance until that signal - so with Grafana alone, nothing was ever started\nand nothing said why. The state is reachable: the admin dialog hides the\nGrafana checkbox once InfluxDB is switched off, but the stored value stays.\n\nFinally the \"automatic image update\" of Grafana did nothing, because the\ncompose file never passed the setting to the plugin.\n\nExisting installations have to remove the old container once, see the changelog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Am1j7gv1rJjnfkex6bYNrE","tree":{"sha":"2aaa36335f93fa3cb7c7a387d380762a6eaac1df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/2aaa36335f93fa3cb7c7a387d380762a6eaac1df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKDdkNWEyZDYwMDE4ZjcwZTJiYzYxMzZjY2FjZjE5Mjc1YTJjMjYxYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c","sha":"99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c"}],"sha":"7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/7d5a2d60018f70e2bc6136ccacf19275a2c261ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:14:55Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:14:55Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v5.0.3\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Errors are logged with more detail: error code, `cause` and a driver-specific error name (`HttpError`, `ServiceNotAvailableError`) are shown now, and a nested error without a message no longer degrades to `{}` (same implementation as in the SQL adapter)\n* (@GermanBluefox) A switched-off or unreachable InfluxDB no longer floods the log (and syslog): a connection error is now recognized by its error code - Node reports a failed TCP connect as an `AggregateError` with an empty message, which no check could match before - so the points are buffered and a reconnect is scheduled instead of retrying every single point. The repeated error is logged once and afterwards only once an hour\n* (@GermanBluefox) `getHostsAvailable()` reports the real state again: it returned a hardcoded `1` since the TypeScript port, so every \"host not available\" check in the adapter was dead code. After a connection error the host is now taken out of rotation for a short backoff and values are buffered instead of being written - and logged - point by point\n* (@GermanBluefox) A failing buffer flush inside the interval timer no longer produces an unhandled promise rejection, which terminates the adapter process on current Node.js versions\n* (@GermanBluefox) `storeState` answers with an error again if a value cannot be stored (`null`, `NaN`, or a non-numeric value for a `Number` datapoint) instead of reporting `success: true` and silently discarding it; on the state-change path such a value is still logged only once per datapoint\n* (@GermanBluefox) The warning about an `undefined` state value is logged only once per datapoint as well","tree":{"sha":"77e9010881115315214332edf8dfa7648a94c96f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/77e9010881115315214332edf8dfa7648a94c96f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKDk5ZTIyNDZlNzU1NmE5MGE1ZGZhY2NmYmQ1YWM4ZGMwZTM2ZDI3M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8","sha":"b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8"}],"sha":"99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/99e2246e7556a90a5dfaccfbd5ac8dc0e36d273c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:12:11Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T15:12:11Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Resolve the open dependabot security alerts with npm overrides\n\nAll nine alerts are transitive dev dependencies - none of them is part of the\npublished package - but dependabot could not fix them on its own: the only\nupdate path npm found would have downgraded @iobroker/testing from 5.3.0 to\n2.2.0, so those update jobs have been failing for weeks.\n\nPinned via overrides (resolved versions in brackets):\n- js-yaml@4 -> ^4.3.1 (4.3.2, via @iobroker/eslint-config); the selector keeps\n  the unrelated js-yaml 5.x in the tree untouched\n- brace-expansion@1/2/5 -> ^1.1.16 / ^2.1.2 / ^5.0.7 (1.1.18, 2.1.4, 5.0.9)\n- protobufjs -> ^7.6.5 (7.6.6)\n- adm-zip -> ^0.6.0 (via @iobroker/adapter-dev -> deepl-node)\n- serialize-javascript -> ^7.0.5 (7.1.0, via mocha)\n- esbuild@0.11 -> ^0.25.0 (0.25.12, via @alcalzone/esbuild-register)\n\nThe last one is the only non-trivial jump: esbuild-register uses nothing but\ntransformSync(), which is unchanged, and it is only used for adapters whose\nmain file is TypeScript - this one runs from build/main.js. Verified that it\nloads and transforms against esbuild 0.25.12.\n\nBuild, lint and the offline tests are unchanged; the lockfile no longer\ncontains any of the vulnerable versions. src-admin already resolves to patched\nversions on its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017ieUDXZRokLVjqaHVBvta2","tree":{"sha":"ebf5825980f3f16f7a4936112e5f74992d439d6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/ebf5825980f3f16f7a4936112e5f74992d439d6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKGIwY2JmY2E5OThiZjdlZDVhZjE1YzU1NzI3OGQwOWYyZjY3ZmU4Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/79e118e4635f6d71000dfd82c50ee2f63947494a","sha":"79e118e4635f6d71000dfd82c50ee2f63947494a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/79e118e4635f6d71000dfd82c50ee2f63947494a"}],"sha":"b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/b0cbfca998bf7ed5af15c557278d09f2f67fe8f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/79e118e4635f6d71000dfd82c50ee2f63947494a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:56:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:56:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Add a regression test for count + removeBorderValues (#261)\n\n#261 reports that getHistory with aggregate \"none\", count: 1,\nreturnNewestEntries and removeBorderValues answers with an empty result. The\nissue was never reproduced (the debug log in it actually shows a successful\n\"Send: 1 of: 1\"), and the response path has been rewritten since - the\naggregation now comes from @iobroker/aggregate.\n\nThe test drives exactly that path with the options the adapter builds for\naggregate \"none\" and shows that a value inside the range survives, that the\nnewest one is kept when more values than requested are found, that values\nexactly on the borders are kept, and that values outside the range are not\nreturned when removeBorderValues is set - the last one is the invariant PR #438\nwould have broken by restoring the \"closest\" removed value instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017ieUDXZRokLVjqaHVBvta2","tree":{"sha":"ee4db07e9ae65ef822e555f9b1183a55a95cb23c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/ee4db07e9ae65ef822e555f9b1183a55a95cb23c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/79e118e4635f6d71000dfd82c50ee2f63947494a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"