ther_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/7a96e3d5ae44516116dea62f39244a2804d80da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:44:23Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:44:23Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Adopt the open maintenance PRs of the ioBroker bot\n\n- #468: auto-merge of dependabot PRs now runs through\n  iobroker-bot-orga/action-automerge-dependabot with the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN;\n  the old workflow (ahmadnassri/action-dependabot-auto-merge, needed a personal\n  AUTO_MERGE_TOKEN) is retired as .OLD - same layout as in ioBroker.sql.\n- #480: cooldown of 7 days for normal npm updates (security updates are not\n  delayed; cooldown is not supported for github-actions).\n- #501: ignore major updates of @types/node - src-admin pins it, and the\n  supported node.js version follows the engines field, not dependabot.\n\n#484 (node >= 20), #491 (node >= 22 plus the workflow matrix) and #496\n(js-controller >= 6.0.11) are already in the repository since v5.0.0, so there\nis nothing left to take over from them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/sessio