","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/eb640f541132a9049196703a15ed3d5dbafa19bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:57:10Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"krobipd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:57:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Reduce log spam for unstorable values (null, NaN, type mismatch) (#518)\n\nPreviously, pushHelper threw an error for every null, NaN, or\ntype-mismatched value, which was caught and logged as a warning by the\ncaller — on every single state change. Adapters like dysonairpurifier\n(null every 60s), alexa2 (string every 2s), or hm-rpc (null) flood the\nlog with hundreds of identical warnings per minute.\n\nNow the adapter logs an info message once per datapoint and silently\nskips subsequent occurrences. The functional behavior is unchanged:\nvalues that InfluxDB cannot store are still not written.\n\nCloses #355\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude (Anthropic) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72f8a6fd15db56b3e57f5b7647d57dd6b463eca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/72f8a6fd15db56b3e57f5b7647d57dd6b463eca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/eb640f541132a9049196703a15ed3d5dbafa19bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 72f8a6fd15db56b3e57f5b7647d57dd6b463eca9\nparent f56df5425e6986b1bc41ebf872e4d456e4ea9621\nauthor krobipd <krobi@power-dreams.com> 1787839030 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787839030 +0200\n\nReduce log spam for unstorable values (null, NaN, type mismatch) (#518)\n\nPreviously, pushHelper threw an error for every null, NaN, or\ntype-mismatched value, which was caught and logged as a warning by the\ncaller — on every single state change. Adapters like dysonairpurifier\n(null every 60s), alexa2 (string every 2s), or hm-rpc (null) flood the\nlog with hundreds of identical warnings per minute.\n\nNow the adapter logs an info message once per datapoint and silently\nskips subsequent occurrences. The functional behavior is unchanged:\nvalues that InfluxDB cannot store are still not written.\n\nCloses #355\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude (Anthropic) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkEI2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAndMQAHWe2jlO7dVd5EspvDfDDhYn\nKxz7hjPT7rQ1+mH2/Nwg0o9vwL6Ce5HbBuyf3IusN+duvLLEtY/WAkzAkuj28JLC\nivF6SDlccJeEDZqsQURCFM6NF/K2IiPjXLLELhA+25iW+TvGLm+WE0Qi24nnCLay\nIVfCivQynh6QmACp8bCB/tQthE+4YEOTGSnL8iM7cdeHzesMny8fmmUEQK6cK6Xs\nEdOU/rqsqNFXnQX/LFV51PjjEPcm89SViR7khxJHsqKi2kRq4QPSBLWIc5Qk9bNv\nbVzk0rbhwWYFPgCbltMiiX4Uhws31tsW+0Iysim1catMLY8wiM6AbIHrHwnoCfoh\nJD2kHc9qcxPCzH+IlXuCvtbC7tKHBaEi3StStiez2PD4/waxAoedmUpvNlov5qDt\nW/trOemNqaRMubPn/m7zP32iDdurVjXI54+gu3EItDrhAgt5y5s+2qGR/GYq3YR2\ngi9lcWtfcPwjpLVMTHzVYszgTrYJHQwFAwe4g71T24p1oPBcGKiDnR5Inmcazlrn\nTFr3ET0LX11Z3JVra+BU5c0IjdK/jRVZ//Mst2oQXkGC/Z3op3iGO+wZIr3t9aag\nn3PizHPzSuvDd4qTjOuErwcivwpB2ffiNk0NVXs9jRqKKiO0NkngOFOrdE4JOtvq\nKcKX4LG/Kd6upvKnTUDJ\n=u6oF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T13:57:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/follo