72aad536068d873bdfed6a4407c706","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/f922ec60a772aad536068d873bdfed6a4407c706"}],"sha":"c25e886730a7393bf114340fae2c947b29f658c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/c25e886730a7393bf114340fae2c947b29f658c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/f922ec60a772aad536068d873bdfed6a4407c706/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:20:25Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T18:20:25Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"chore: release v5.0.1\n\n* (@GermanBluefox) Completely refactored the code to TypeScript and ES6\n* (@GermanBluefox) Added possibility to start docker containers directly from the adapter\n* (mcm1957) Adapter requires admin >= 7.7.2 now\n* (arteck) Fixed the connection handling for InfluxDB 1.x: the health check (ping) and the automatic reconnect were never started\n* (arteck) Fixed the loss of buffered values if the writing was running while new values arrived or if the write failed\n* (arteck) Values are no longer written twice if they are written directly (buffer size 0 or conflicting points)\n* (arteck) State IDs and database names are now escaped in the queries\n* (arteck) The password/token is no longer written into the log by the connection test\n* (arteck) The settings \"request timeout\" and \"validate SSL\" are now used for InfluxDB 1.x too\n* (arteck) Fixed the cache file name if more than one instance runs in the compact mode\n* (arteck) Fixed the aggregation for `percentile: 100`/`quantile: 1` and the last value of `integralTotal`\n* (bluefox) Fixed empty charts for the aggregation `onchange` (\"raw\" in e-charts): it was run through the interval aggregation and returned only `null` values\n* (@GermanBluefox) Minimal node.js version is 22","tree":{"sha":"6727c2beee41041b779775a2dfab7ca5ed2a9152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/6727c2beee41041b779775a2dfab7ca5ed2a9152"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/f922ec60a772aad536068d873bdfed6a4407c706","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_e