ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/006704588287dd49614590f55fac880766f62558/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T13:08:24Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T13:08:24Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Follow-up to #505: remove stray file, harden retention read and escaping\n\n* Removed src/lib/testCompare.ts: it was an identical copy of the test helper\n  test/lib/testCompare.ts, was compiled into build/lib/testCompare.js and\n  shipped with the npm package\n* getRetentionPolicyForDB (2.x) no longer throws for buckets without a\n  retention rule (infinite retention), which logged an error on every connect\n  and made the new \"skip the PATCH\" check useless for such buckets\n* An invalid timestamp is no longer replaced by the current time: writing a\n  point with \"now\" instead of its real time would corrupt the time series, so\n  it is now rejected like null/non finite values\n* Moved the escape helpers into lib/Database.ts and used them for the database\n  name in the 1.x retention queries and in the 2.x metadata check too\n* Used the flux escaping (not the InfluxQL one) for the 2.x delete predicate\n* Replaced the \"smart optimization\" changelog entry by the actual fixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eff80d3084138d4c64908fbd27917ce514e1eb86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/eff80d3084138d4c64908fbd27917ce514e1eb86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/006704588287dd49614590f55fac880766f62558","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/006704588287dd49614590f55fac880766f62558","node_id":"C_kwDOAts889oAKDAwNjcwNDU4ODI4N2RkNDk2MTQ1OTBmNTVmYWM4ODA3NjZmNjI1NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commit/aef54be361c616414ce43182da2311161eaa6418","sha":"aef54be361c616414ce43182da2311161eaa6418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/aef54be361c616414ce43182da2311161eaa6418"}],"sha":"006704588287dd49614590f55fac880766f62558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/006704588287dd49614590f55fac880766f62558"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6681528?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arteck","id":6681528,"login":"arteck","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2ODE1Mjg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arteck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/commits/aef54be361c616414ce43182da2311161eaa6418/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T13:01:29Z","email":"6681528+arteck@users.noreply.github.com","name":"arteck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T13:01:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix 1.x connect finalization, buffer flush race and query escaping (#505)\n\n* Finalize the connection for InfluxDB 1.x too (ping/health check, start values, \"Connected!\" were 2.x only)\n* Snapshot and reset the series buffer before the write, so points arriving during the flush and points re-added after a failed write are no longer discarded\n* Do not buffer a point that was already written directly (double write)\n* Escape state ids and bucket names in InfluxQL/Flux queries\n* Do not log the full test message (contained password/token in clear text)\n* Honor requestTimeout and validateSSL for InfluxDB 1.x\n* Per-instance cache file (compact mode)\n* Reset error counter for a point after a successful write\n* aggregate: interpolate the last totalIntegral point onto options.end, fix NaN for percentile 100 / quantile 1\n* Skip the 2.x retention PATCH if the retention is already as desired","tree":{"sha":"b669baa2de26dc04cbae2dae161e222d003d1021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/trees/b669baa2de26dc04cbae2dae161e222d003d1021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.influxdb/git/commits/aef54be361c616414ce43182da2311161eaa6418","verification":{"payload":"tree b669baa2de26dc04cbae2dae161e222d003d1021\nparent eb48623369330e7d3601332cb6422f42eb8bfed3\nauthor arteck <6681528+arteck@users.noreply.github.com> 1786798889 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786798889 +0300\n\nFix 1.x connect finalization, buffer flush race and query escaping (#505)\n\n* Finalize the connection for InfluxDB 1.x too (ping/health check, start values, \"Connected!\" were 2.x only)\n* Snapshot and reset the series buffer before the write, so points arriving during the flush and points re-added after a failed write are no longer discarded\n* Do not buffer a point that was already written directly (double write)\n* Escape state ids and bucket names in InfluxQL/Flux queries\n* Do not log the full test message (contained password/token in clear text)\n* Honor requestTimeout and validateSSL for InfluxDB 1.x\n* Per-instance cache file (compact mode)\n* Reset error counter for a point after a successful write\n* aggregate: interpolate the last totalIntegral point onto options.end, fix NaN for percentile 100 / quantile 1\n* Skip the 2.x retention PATCH if the retention is already as desired","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgGMpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPhMQADvX3d/fMRbNPprjXTyBOea8\nqFYCpCb/qn2BrCMTsG2LokApy3X+Fr3f2Xs8wH423CP5VtrMpbu/htOtUBN6814w\nCIRXeLjBU2yLc5bXNHcvJgcc8rsyQu/neEo/j7shj5dwuAD/LBJsq7IK6hhBz48f\np9TkJXtHbx9guD3QWZPPsOwLELCsXr0W56a1IFweTjxaUdrYBGSk0rgjDZYKYzGx\nQ5XXIPyAOMCK1UJTKgIwalbESnzUTcIGIpFx3Vs922NLer+hLYrpWHCUHN9ISd/F\n5U+3dppQ+UVikfZkGwkAKGVcZJ47II3LDUMfZfeBNeiPgbfRomynr8BpXMQUMuQj\n6gVcs4NUKhg0uaAD5jgvtKie/wSALGfes1xRIXquN