cases (client-facing tone).\n- scripts/: weekly-sync automation\n  - weekly-sync.py: detects new repos, enriches via Claude Code headless\n    (uses Claude Max subscription, no API cost), regenerates README.md +\n    index.html, commits + pushes\n  - classify.py: GICS classifier with keyword heuristics\n  - enriched.json: source-of-truth dataset (865 repos, all with descriptions)\n  - launchd/us.dotku.weekly-sync.plist: Sunday 05:00 schedule\n  - --upgrade-ollama flag for one-time existing-description upgrades\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f46f5c943ba0fd0e4c8795546a59810fddbd3558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotku/dotku.github.io/git/trees/f46f5c943ba0fd0e4c8795546a59810fddbd3558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotku/dotku.github.io/git/commits/31423b9e929feccacddf2fddd78c9f2bf13542c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1519232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dotku","id":1519232,"login":"dotku","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTkyMzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dotku","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dotku/dotku.github.io/commit/31423b9e929feccacddf2fddd78c9f2bf13542c1","node_id":"C_kw