url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/ec4969873c6bdd014200f0c0c144cd35010899fb","node_id":"C_kwDOAxRrTtoAKGVjNDk2OTg3M2M2YmRkMDE0MjAwZjBjMGMxNDRjZDM1MDEwODk5ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318","sha":"9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b","sha":"1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b"}],"sha":"ec4969873c6bdd014200f0c0c144cd35010899fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/ec4969873c6bdd014200f0c0c144cd35010899fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:22:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:22:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Retry a getUpdates 409 quickly before falling back to the slow restart\n\nv5.x used the classic node-telegram-bot-api library, which treated a 409\nConflict as just another polling error and kept the loop running,\nretrying almost immediately - so a brief conflict right after a restart\n(Telegram briefly still considering the previous connection alive) was\nnever visible. v6.0.0''s library classifies 409 as fatal, tearing the\nwhole long-poll loop down and only restarting after a fixed 30s delay,\nturning that same brief, self-resolving race into a very visible,\nrepeating error.\n\nRetry the first few 409s quickly (matching the old resilience) and only\nfall back to the slower, clearly-logged restart - with a hint of what to\ncheck - once the conflict has actually persisted across several attempts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ECxB3CXtwBF1CdHpgpD5KG","tree":{"sha":"bbf35d988118cdd29ba5dc0b9f74b4dbcf61a448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/trees/bbf35d988118cdd29ba5dc0b9f74b4dbcf61a448"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/commits/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b","verification":{"payload":"tree bbf35d988118cdd29ba5dc0b9f74b4dbcf61a448\nparent 9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789039366 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789039366 +0000\n\nRetry a getUpdates 409 quickly before falling back to the slow restart\n\nv5.x used the classic node-telegram-bot-api library, which treated a 409\nConflict as just another polling error and kept the loop running,\nretrying almost immediately - so a brief conflict right after a restart\n(Telegram briefly still considering the previous connection alive) was\nnever visible. v6.0.0''s library classifies 409 as fatal, tearing the\nwhole long-poll loop down and only restarting after a fixed 30s delay,\nturning that same brief, self-resolving race into a very visible,\nrepeating error.\n\nRetry the first few 409s quickly (matching the old resilience) and only\nfall back to the slower, clearly-logged restart - with a hint of what to\ncheck - once the conflict has actually persisted across several attempts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ECxB3CXtwBF1CdHpgpD5KG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK3ME9o9\nqZ4UusVFtdprGqB7O/UDU7feIWulHbiwaM8ZnYESSyquFWAhKNVIend01ZKwyrMcu/ulvgLWsOLf\naws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T11:22:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b","node_id":"C_kwDOAxRrTtoAKDFhYTc1MjYxMDUxMWM4MDc0NDBmYTdmZDFjNzYzMjQxYTE1ZTE4MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9","sha":"9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9"}],"sha":"1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/1aa752610511c807440fa7fd1c763241a15e182b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commits/9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:09:55Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T11:10:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Break polling-restart lock-step on repeated 409 conflicts\n\nA getUpdates 409 (another poller using the same token) always retried\nafter a fixed 30s delay. Two competing pollers on the same fixed cadence\ncan stay perfectly synchronized and keep conflicting indefinitely instead\nof one of them eventually winning a clear window. Add jitter to the\nrestart delay and log an actionable message identifying likely causes\n(leftover process, multihost duplicate, another tool using the token).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ECxB3CXtwBF1CdHpgpD5KG","tree":{"sha":"9d36948de5fbe1e0da11ad7a4a1aa494fc6bbc78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/trees/9d36948de5fbe1e0da11ad7a4a1aa494fc6bbc78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/commits/9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d36948de5fbe1e0da11ad7a4a1aa494fc6bbc78\nparent 9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789038595 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789038602 +0000\n\nBreak polling-restart lock-step on repeated 409 conflicts\n\nA getUpdates 409 (another poller using the same token) always retried\nafter a fixed 30s delay. Two competing pollers on the same fixed cadence\ncan stay perfectly synchronized and keep conflicting indefinitely instead\nof one of them eventually winning a clear window. Add jitter to the\nrestart delay and log an actionable message identifying likely causes\n(leftover process, multihost duplicate, another tool using the token).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ECxB3CXtwBF1CdHpgpD5KG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGzHJ3XO\niosdml3onq7hEgGnvkBI+Mru0Ib132Obj+NdREJaveiPRCrFLcBVL6Bijx68PPHrnwT6UtiumZxp\nSwg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T11:10:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/9f671f693b12d2c96f3a557e0da9dfdbc651bed9","node_id":"C_kwDOAxRrTtoAKDlmNjcxZjY5M2IxMmQyYzk2ZjNhNTU3ZTBkYTlkZmRiYzY1MWJlZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/commit/9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318","sha":"9d530ebe2bd5bf834f202b0b2362669acfcb2318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/io