n (#1371)\n- (@GermanBluefox) A `text2command`/`assistant` instance stored in the long form (`system.adapter.text2command.0`, written by the config UI before v1.12.6) is migrated to the short form on startup, so the config dialog shows the selected instance again (#1365)\n- (@GermanBluefox) Added the states `communicate.requestLocationLive` (live location is still being shared), `communicate.requestLocationHeading` and `communicate.requestLocationAccuracy` for received (live) locations","tree":{"sha":"5b9feab6fc6e82da53c9a919e163a7883c3ec8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/trees/5b9feab6fc6e82da53c9a919e163a7883c3ec8f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.telegram/git/commits/24d001444d03005c7c42316d462ac7ae2f60f831","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.te