yTax/single-spa-canopy/commits/096cdcebb169ccfcfd3b51725ba742e36d673976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:11:03Z","email":"rhys.childs@canopytax.com","name":"rhys-childs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T23:11:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump Yarn to 4.14.1 + add 7-day minimum release age gate (#53)\n\nYarn 4.9.2 rejects npmMinimalAgeGate as an unrecognized setting, so the\ngate requires the version bump to land at all.\n\nLeaves enableScripts unset so it takes Yarn 4''s default of false; the\n3->4 migration writes it as true, which re-enables dependency install\nscripts. Also drops the migration''s approvedGitRepositories: [\"**\"],\nwhich would match every git URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d425835951415e1357f3126013fbc33bf9400b6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/single-spa-canopy/git/trees/d425835951415e1357f3126013fbc33bf9400b6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CanopyTax/single-spa-canopy/git/commits/096cdcebb169ccfcfd3b51725ba742e36d673976","verification":{"payload":"tree d425835951415e1357f3126013fbc33bf9400b6b\nparent e1ec2bd3c9f83b26dd19a86f5738e1a35c4b375c\nauthor rhys-childs <rhys.childs@canopytax.com> 1785885063 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785885063 -0600\n\nBump Yarn to 4.14.1 + add 7-day minimum release age gate (#53)\n\nYarn 4.9.2 rejects npmMinimalAgeGate as an unrecognized setting, so the\ngate requires the version bump to land at all.\n\nLeaves enableScripts unset so it takes Yarn 4''s default of false; the\n3->4 migration writes it as true, which re-enables dependency install\nscripts. Also drops the migration''s approvedGitRepositories: [\"**\"],\nwhich would match every git URL.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcnGHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAonIQAJqVy5QrMasnL6r9pzlp3tg4\noi8R9Nco6qJGQ+qcbRLzNU0ElxkjS9NAx