s/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/d3533fd01727367af56e18cc77aa2fc629e56e34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/d3533fd01727367af56e18cc77aa2fc629e56e34","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGQzNTMzZmQwMTcyNzM2N2FmNTZlMThjYzc3YWEyZmM2MjllNTZlMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a","sha":"a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50","sha":"432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50"}],"sha":"d3533fd01727367af56e18cc77aa2fc629e56e34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/d3533fd01727367af56e18cc77aa2fc629e56e34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:42:51Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:42:51Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"✨ feat(logging): Log the 401, 403 and 404 of Struts pages with their status\n\nStruts renders its 401/403/404 pages with HTTP 200, so those requests never\ncarried status_code in the log: only REST errors and Struts 500s did, which\nleft most of MARLO''s 4xx traffic out of the logging standard.\n\n- ErrorStatusLogInterceptor (new) registers a PreResultListener, which\n  receives the result code right before the result runs, whether an\n  action, an interceptor that stopped the chain or the Shiro exception\n  mapping produced it. 401 and 404 log at INFO; 403 at WARN with a session\n  user, at INFO without one. A code the action has no result for (the json\n  package maps no 401/403) is logged without a status, since Struts then\n  fails the request and the client never receives it.\n- It runs first in all 36 stacks and in the 10 json actions that declare\n  their own; homeJson''s two login lookups and the Spring-owned api package\n  are left out on purpose.\n- UnhandledExceptionAction drops the status (and the user name it\n  published) for a ClientAbortException, through the new\n  LogContext.removeStatusCode(), so a page cut off mid-render does not keep\n  its 404.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS,\n2405 + 1048 files), Checkstyle at zero delta, the hygiene check, and 354\ntests with -am, 21 of them new: unit tests, a Struts 6.8 test with real\ninvocations, and a coverage test that every action in every struts*.xml\nruns the interceptor exactly once. Mutations of the listener, the result\ncheck and a duplicated stack were each caught. An independent review\npassed; its three findings are fixed here. Browser tests on a local\ninstance: 401, 404, the json 403 without status, 404 and 403 (WARN) with\na session user, and no status carried to the next request on the thread.","tree":{"sha":"f2b3568913a2f5393d091375356d71193a268be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/f2b3568913a2f5393d091375356d71193a268be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDQzMmM0NDJlZmEyNWZiOThlM2UzODU4YTdiYzI0YzM0MTg5ZTNmNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/4b8f6853e782314cd4b883dd668a1123afb95dd7","sha":"4b8f6853e782314cd4b883dd668a1123afb95dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/4b8f6853e782314cd4b883dd668a1123afb95dd7"}],"sha":"432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/432c442efa25fb98e3e3858a7bc24c34189e3f50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/4b8f6853e782314cd4b883dd668a1123afb95dd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:38:57Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:41:15Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"📝 docs(marlo-verify): Share the verification skill and document its null-list rule\n\nmarlo-verify lived only in one developer''s ~/.claude/skills, although\nCLAUDE.md lists it among MARLO''s own skills. It now ships in\n.claude/skills/marlo-verify with its five scripts, and SKILL.md points\nat the repository paths. The existing !.claude/ rule in .gitignore\nalready keeps these files tracked.\n\nSKILL.md documents the NULL-LIST hygiene rule: a method returning a\nList, Set or Collection that contains `return null;` fails the gate when\nthe change touches it, and untouched ones in the same file are counted\nas REVIEW. It ignores returns inside lambdas and anonymous classes,\ncounts the ones inside switch arms, and ignores braces or `return null`\nin comments, string literals and text blocks. Run over the whole\nrepository it reports the 480 methods an independent analysis found,\nand gets all thirteen synthetic cases right.","tree":{"sha":"d0436895fc3332bab22f645102eac9dbdbea199f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/d0436895fc3332bab22f645102eac9dbdbea199f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/4b8f6853e782314cd4b883dd668a1123afb95dd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"ht