/1745ba33ccd8b4a353fc1cb6892d3e0b2a2896af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(audit): Map modifiedBy on the 14 auditable entities whose tables have the column\n\nAuditColumnHibernateListener sets modifiedBy on every update of a\nMarloAuditableEntity. These 14 mappings omitted the property, so each\nupdate logged \"Field ''modifiedBy'' not found\" and modified_by was never\nwritten. Their modified_by columns exist, are nullable, reference users\nand come from the 2024 migrations. ProjectInnovationReferenceUrl and\nProjectInnovationReferenceComplementarySolution are left out: their\ngetModifiedBy() is a stub that returns a user with id 3.\n\nVerified on the local server: no mapping errors at startup, no\n\"Field ''modifiedBy'' not found\" on innovation saves, and the partnership\nupdate wrote modified_by.","tree":{"sha":"21aa0f219530c2527a3dfb700c330da590ce4920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/21aa0f219530c2527a3dfb700c330da590ce4920"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/1745ba33ccd8b4a353fc1cb6892d3e0b2a2896af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/1745ba33ccd8b4a353fc1cb6892d3e0b2a2896af","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDE3NDViYTMzY2NkOGI0YTM1M2ZjMWNiNjg5MmQzZTBiMmEyODk2YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc","sha":"646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc"}],"sha":"1745ba33ccd8b4a353fc1cb6892d3e0b2a2896af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1745ba33ccd8b4a353fc1cb6892d3e0b2a2896af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(dao): Return empty lists from five more DAOs used by innovations, OICRs and deliverables\n\nProjectInnovationBundle, ProjectInnovationComplementarySolution,\nToolFunctionCategory, StudyType and CgiarCrossCuttingMarker returned\nnull when the query found no rows. saveBundles iterated the result, so\nan innovation with no stored bundles logged a NullPointerException and\nskipped saving its bundles. Their callers were reviewed: none reads\nnull as \"not found\".\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS), Checkstyle at zero delta, and an innovation 1614 save with no\n\"Error saving innovation bundles\".","tree":{"sha":"f6ef15ee7ea410be825569405797f97026fc07f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/f6ef15ee7ea410be825569405797f97026fc07f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDY0NmRiMTBlYjMwMWUwOTUxM2MzNmFkNjA4NmUyOTZkNjNlMzRiYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875","sha":"2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875"}],"sha":"646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/646db10eb301e09513c36ad6086e296d63e34bbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:52:47Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(innovations): Stop the innovation save wiping actors and duplicating the alliance lever\n\nsaveActors deletes every stored actor before saving the form. A debug\nprintln read getActor().getId() right after an empty row (\"-1\") set the\nactor to null, so the NullPointerException stopped the loop and the\ninnovation was left with no actors. Empty rows and null elements are now\nskipped, as ProjectInnovationValidator already treats them as missing.\n\nsaveAllianceLevers inserted a second copy of lever 3 on every save. The\nnext save deleted the copy, which also deleted lever 3 in the following\nphases, and replication inserted it again: 345 innovation/phase pairs\nheld lever 3 twice in the local copy. The extra save is removed; an\ninnovation drops its copy the next time it is saved.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS) and Checkstyle at zero delta, and on the local server:\ninnovation 1614 kept actors 2, 4, 8 and dropped two empty rows;\ninnovation 1560 went from two lever rows to one per phase.","tree":{"sha":"4053c5a098399b74a18fb5b0eea024dff96a51fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/4053c5a098399b74a18fb5b0eea024dff96a51fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDJjYjk4NmUxNjljMzRjNWQ3ZjZjNjRkMDZmNWRlOGJmODQ4YWI4NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae","sha":"83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae"}],"sha":"2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2cb986e169c34c5d7f6c64d06f5de8bf848ab875"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"♻️ refactor(innovations): Translate the Spanish comments, remove the Struts 6 debug logs and keep the partnership delete exception\n\n- Translates the 19 Spanish comment lines in ProjectInnovationAction.\n- Removes the four \"Debug logging for Struts 6\" blocks in saveActors,\n  saveCrpOutcomes, saveGeographicScope and saveRegions: they logged\n  every saved element at INFO and only read data.\n- The partnership delete failure passed e.getMessage() as an argument\n  with no placeholder, so slf4j dropped it; it now logs the exception\n  with its stack trace.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS) and Checkstyle at 34 -> 31 violations against HEAD.","tree":{"sha":"736257e1a91ff000d7b8934fde1f225648918710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/736257e1a91ff000d7b8934fde1f225648918710"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDgzZTcwYmVlZWVmZWRiODY1NzczNmIyYWM1NGY2NzM5NzUxODBlYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc","sha":"a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc"}],"sha":"83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/83e70beeeefedb8657736b2ac54f673975180eae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:59:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(deliverables): Stop the dissemination lookups throwing for deliverables without a dissemination in the actual phase\n\nBaseAction.loadDissemination() filtered the disseminations of the actual\nphase but checked the size of the unfiltered list, so a deliverable\ndisseminated only in other phases hit get(0) on an empty list. isI()\nalso called replaceAll() on a dissemination URL before its null check.\nisA, isF and isI caught both and answered null, but logged a stack\ntrace for every row of the deliverable and publication lists.\n\nloadDissemination() now checks the filtered list and guards a null\ndeliverable, null elements and a null phase; isI() checks the URL for\nnull first. Callers still answer null.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS), Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD, and on the local\nserver: the deliverable list of project 102088 and deliverable 27288\nno longer log any \"has no dissemination\" trace.","tree":{"sha":"a788ddefe655fe33fa7456d1221391cabdef7f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/a788ddefe655fe33fa7456d1221391cabdef7f36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGE5MjhmM2RjZjdkMjNlMDVmYmM0MzFiMGViZjI2ZDBkYmQ0M2RlY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b","sha":"d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b"}],"sha":"a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a928f3dcf7d23e05fbc431b0ebf26d0dbd43decc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:38:43Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:38:43Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(innovations): Stop empty catalogs and a missing phaseID from breaking innovations, OICRs and deliverables\n\nThe innovation page failed in AICCRA_FSRP with an unhandled NPE because\nSrfIdoMySQLDAO.findAll() returned null when srf_idos had no active rows.\nNo migration seeds srf_idos or srf_sub_idos, so a database built from\nmigrations hits it.\n\n- 49 DAO methods used by innovations, OICRs and deliverables, SrfIdo\n  and SrfSubIdo included, now return the query result, an empty list\n  when there are no rows, instead of null. Their 398 call sites were\n  reviewed: none reads null as \"not found\" or takes the first element\n  after a null check.\n- ProjectInnovationAction no longer loads srfIdos / idoList: no view,\n  script or caller of the action reads them.\n- The tool categories lookup uses the resolved phase instead of\n  getPhaseID(), which is null when the URL carries no phaseID.\n- DeliverableShfrmSubActionManagerImpl checks the lookup result before\n  get(0); the delete chain also stops calling delete with a null id.\n- DeliverableAction.getActualClusterParticipantID() reuses the guarded\n  lookup, so saving a deliverable without a cluster participant no\n  longer logs an IndexOutOfBoundsException.\n\nREST catalog endpoints (/srf-idos, /srf-sub-idos, geographic scopes,\ninnovation types, cross-cutting scores, flagships, global units) now\nanswer [] instead of an empty body when the table is empty.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS, 2405 + 1047 files) and Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD\non the 51 changed files.","tree":{"sha":"44ab3773e59fd12b306db439a0b82a0189e7d0cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/44ab3773e59fd12b306db439a0b82a0189e7d0cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGQ4YmJmMmFjNjYyMjY0YjE2ZTUyOGVkN2Y1M2NmN2M1YmUwODk2N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280","sha":"e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280"}],"sha":"d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/d8bbf2ac662264b16e528ed7f53cf7c5be08967b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:58:44Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:01:42Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"♻️ refactor(parameters): Remove the unused all-years expected deliverable specificity\n\nIS_EXPECTED_DELIVERABLE_REPORT_All_YEARS_VISIBLE named a parameter that was\nnever created: no migration seeds it and no Global Unit stores it.\nBaseAction.isExpectedDeliverablesReportAllYearsVisible() therefore always\nreturned false, and nothing called it. It was added in 2020 for the\nexpected deliverables summary, but boardSummaries.ftl resolved that case\nwith crpCCAFS instead and never read the flag.\n\n- Remove the constant from both APConstants copies (marlo-data and\n  marlo-web).\n- Remove the BaseAction method.\n\nThe All Years option of the expected deliverables summary is unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"fff02fbff8bfb95d1fcf335a4ff015d14fbbbb7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/fff02fbff8bfb95d1fcf335a4ff015d14fbbbb7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGU0ZmEyYzE3YmE3MDQ3YTFkYjg3NTM4NmYwOTIxNWI2MzY4NDYyODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377","sha":"99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377"}],"sha":"e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/e4fa2c17ba7047a1db875386f09215b636846280"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:00:32Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:00:32Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(crp indicators): Stop the page failing on the legacy ?html builtin\n\nmessages-crpIndicators.ftl escaped the editor''s name with ?html. With the\nHTML auto-escaping that Struts 6 turns on, FreeMarker refuses ?html when\nit parses the template, so every visit to {crp}/crpIndicators broke\nhalfway through the form, logged a 500 and tried to send an exception\nemail. Auto-escaping already escapes the value, as in the sibling\nmessages templates.\n\nVerified on the local server: the page renders completely for AICCRA and\nAICCRA III, and the log shows no error for those requests.","tree":{"sha":"3ae07e17df6ce19b91d384b9563654d037825382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/3ae07e17df6ce19b91d384b9563654d037825382"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDk5YmY5YjM0MmMwZTExYWZlY2RhM2NjY2IwZTExMjIwZTA1MTkzNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3","sha":"8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3"}],"sha":"99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/99bf9b342c0e11afecda3cccb0e11220e0519377"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:44:30Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:44:30Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(phases): Keep the tab of another Global Unit working with its own phase\n\nValidPhaseInterceptor compared every phaseID with the session Global\nUnit. Autosave, section validation and uploads are flat URLs that never\nswitch the session, so a tab still open on another unit got 404 on each\nof them (\"Auto save error\", a section stuck loading) once another tab\nmoved the session.\n\nA phaseID is now accepted when the phase exists, belongs to the Global\nUnit named in the URL (if any), and belongs to the session unit or to one\nthe user is an active member of. Mixed URLs, unknown phases and phases of\nunits the user does not belong to are still answered 404. The URL prefix\nis compared as text with the phase''s acronym and never sent to a query.\n\nVerified on the local server: the old tab''s autosave, section validation\nand file upload succeed; mixed, unknown and non-member phases answer 404\non pages, Super Admin, AJAX, uploads and writes, without ending the\nsession; 25 screens load with no 404 or 500; anonymous pages are\nunchanged. Tests: 333, 0 failures; removing either new rule fails the 5\ncases that cover it. Checkstyle at zero delta.","tree":{"sha":"53ba1d473a7631712765dbc543ce0dc5982f56da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/53ba1d473a7631712765dbc543ce0dc5982f56da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDhkZjE4OTA5MzdjNzhkMjVmNTI3NDdkZDVmY2I1ODg2NTlhZDE5ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d","sha":"1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d"}],"sha":"8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/8df1890937c78d25f52747dd5fcb588659ad19e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:20:06Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:20:06Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(phases): Stop a phaseID of another Global Unit from logging the user out\n\nA request whose phaseID belonged to another Global Unit than the session''s\ncleared the session: RequireUserInterceptor runs before the Global Unit\nswitch, getActualPhase() returned null for a phase it could not find among\nthe session unit''s phases, and a null phase is read as \"not logged\". A\nsecond tab, a bookmark or an email link was enough to sign the user out.\n\n- getActualPhase() falls back to the current phase when the requested\n  phaseID is not one of the session unit''s phases, as it already did for a\n  value that does not parse, so the request reaches the Global Unit switch.\n- ValidPhaseInterceptor answers 404 when the phaseID does not belong to the\n  session Global Unit, so no action can read or write another unit''s phase.\n  It runs after validSessionCrp (or requireUser) in the 30 stacks that check\n  the user, in jsonStack and json-planning, before the explicit defaultStack\n  of the JSON upload actions, and in marloDefaultStack, now the default of\n  marlo-default for the actions that declare no interceptors. The JSON\n  packages get a global 404 result. Anonymous sessions carry no Global Unit\n  and are never checked.\n\nLogin, Cognito and the two public summaries keep their stacks. All 73 AJAX\ncalls that send phaseID send the session or page phase; Super Admin\nreplication uses selectedPhaseID.\n\nTests: ValidPhaseInterceptorTest (11 cases) and ValidPhaseStackCoverageTest,\nwhich fails if a stack checking the user or the Global Unit, a package\ndefault stack or an explicit defaultStack loses validPhase. Both fail when\nthe protection is removed. Full suite: 329 tests, 0 failures.\n\nVerified on the local server: a cross-unit link switches and keeps the\nsession; a foreign or unknown phaseID answers 404 on pages, Super Admin and\nAJAX, and writes (unsubmitProject, submit, partnerSave) are rejected before\nrunning; anonymous public pages are unchanged; 25 screens load with no 404\nor 500. Clean rebuild (2405 + 1047 files), Checkstyle at zero delta.","tree":{"sha":"ea42ddd2a60cf5efc207caae3c51c485008d0447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/ea42ddd2a60cf5efc207caae3c51c485008d0447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDFiNThiMTAwYjlkNDM5YjBlY2M4MzgzZDIwZWQ2OTQ2ZWRkY2Y1NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","sha":"2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b"}],"sha":"1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1b58b100b9d439b0ecc8383d20ed6946eddcf56d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:39:00Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:39:00Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"Merge branch ''staging''","tree":{"sha":"0db32ec9e53fdb6890ccdc43c07cd4462707fc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/0db32ec9e53fdb6890ccdc43c07cd4462707fc19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGEyMGZhZTljZDZlYmZiMjIyNzdhOGQ1ZTdlZDFhN2EyYzk1MzFhMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325","sha":"1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","sha":"2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b"}],"sha":"a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/a20fae9cd6ebfb22277a8d5e7ed1a7a2c9531a1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(summaries): Stop the budget per partners report failing on zero budgets\n\nTwo percentage formulas in BudgetPerPartners.prpt divided by\n[sumBudgets] unguarded. When a partner''s budgets are all zero, as in\nevery row of AWPB 2026, Pentaho raised \"Arithmetic Error\" (503) and the\ndownload returned an HTTP 500. They now use the IF([x]=0;0.00;...)\nguard the other percentage formulas in the report already use.\n\nOnly subreport/datadefinition.xml changed inside the archive; the\npatched report loads in Pentaho and the guard returns 0.00 for 0/0.","tree":{"sha":"0db32ec9e53fdb6890ccdc43c07cd4462707fc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/0db32ec9e53fdb6890ccdc43c07cd4462707fc19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDI2NDJiN2U1Mzg5NjIxNGJmMWI0NWJkMTI2OGQ4MWQzYTYwMDYxMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98","sha":"aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98"}],"sha":"2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/2642b7e53896214bf1b45bd1268d81d3a600611b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:36:24Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(institutions): Map is_active and hide inactive institutions in search\n\nInstitution.isActive() returned a hardcoded true and is_active was not\nmapped, so the partner search offered deactivated institutions (7320\nafter the A2-2510 remap, Mediae, Stellenbosch, ...). findAll() already\nfiltered them with a raw is_active=1 in its HQL.\n\n- Map is_active read-only (insert/update false, field access) and make\n  isActive() return it; null reads as active.\n- Filter i.active = true in searchInstitution().\n- BudgetPerPartnersSummaryAction keeps reporting budgets of deactivated\n  institutions, as it did while isActive() was constant.\n\nAll 20 Java callers were listed by the compiler: 19 filter findAll(),\nwhich is already active-only. Verified with a clean recompile (2405 +\n1046 files), Checkstyle at zero delta and a read-only Hibernate run\nagainst a production copy (SELECTs only, no UPDATE on flush). The\nINSERT/UPDATE/DELETE SQL Hibernate generates for Institution is\nunchanged, and a save on a throwaway copy left is_active untouched.\nTested on the local server: no inactive institution in the search\nendpoint or the partner picker; partners, funding sources, budget by\npartners and managing partners load unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"17a71a9311291d566896bde08cbeeb28df4827b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/17a71a9311291d566896bde08cbeeb28df4827b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/aed93b4cec857bf0cf9af2ffc1cca60cdb43ec98","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKGFlZDkzYjRjZWM4NTdiZjBjZjlhZjJmZmMxY2NhNjBjZGI0M2VjOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/c7508f6f4477d647797005ad0dcb901c3d00c97e","sha":"c7508