tps://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDFjYzBkMmRmNGQ0MGIyNGEzOWI1YmUzNTNmYzBkYjE3MWNiZjgzMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c","sha":"15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32","sha":"349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32"}],"sha":"1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/1cc0d2df4d40b24a39b5be353fc0db171cbf8325"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:45:29Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:45:29Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(institutions): Remap AICCRA references from institution 7320 to 46\n\nInstitution 7320 (''CGIAR ALLIANCE'') is a duplicate Alliance record deleted in\nCLARISA. AICCRA (45) and AICCRA III (47) still referenced it everywhere. The\nmigration moves their active references to 46, relocates the 285 partner\noffices from 7320''s Italy office to 46''s headquarters in Palmira, and then\nmarks 7320 inactive. Every change is recorded in\ninstitution_remap_7320_46_aiccra for rollback.\n\nEvery write is guarded: institution 7320 with acronym ''CGIAR ALLIANCE'',\ninstitution 46 with a headquarters office, and global units 45 ''AICCRA'' /\n47 ''AICCRA_III''. Deactivation also requires that no active reference to 7320\nremains in any program. Only columns created by migrations are read.\n\nTested on throwaway copies: an empty schema, partial data without global\nunits, without 46, or with 7320 used outside AICCRA (0 writes, no errors),\nand a full aiccradb2 copy (17,638 remaps + 285 offices; a second run changes\nnothing; rollback is exact).","tree":{"sha":"0e732dd3c254356a0ef7f7ff1c99643004239137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/0e732dd3c254356a0ef7f7ff1c99643004239137"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDM0OWM3ZjlhYjZjZDY4ZmEyZjIzNDU5OGM2ZmYzZjBhMTVmMWJjMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e","sha":"4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e"}],"sha":"349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/349c7f9ab6cd68fa2f234598c6ff3f0a15f1bc32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:39:01Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:39:01Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"Merge branch ''staging''","tree":{"sha":"e5a2e4bb6815429a9348778c214555b54998c727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/e5a2e4bb6815429a9348778c214555b54998c727"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDE1YzFkY2UxODZiYTE1MzFiZWU2ZGQ4NDE1ODAzN2YzOWIyYjYzNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/59505d85a90c3673b3ed20ca1da5d28424a93f78","sha":"59505d85a90c3673b3ed20ca1da5d28424a93f78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/59505d85a90c3673b3ed20ca1da5d28424a93f78"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e","sha":"4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e"}],"sha":"15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/15c1dce186ba1531bee6dd84158037f39b2b635c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:27:33Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:27:33Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(institutions): Remap AICCRA references from institution 49 to 46\n\nInstitution 49 (Alliance of Bioversity and CIAT - Headquarter in CLARISA)\nhas an empty name and acronym in MARLO and was deactivated on 2025-07-02,\nso AICCRA screens, the Reporting Summary and the v2 REST payloads render\na nameless institution wherever its data still points at it. This\nmigration moves AICCRA''s references to institution 46 (Alliance ...\nRegional Hub, CIAT). Scope validated with Cristian Gamboa: only 49 for now;\n7320 and 4086 stay out.\n\n- Records every touched row in institution_remap_49_46_aiccra with its\n  previous institution_id, is_active and active_since, as audit trail and\n  rollback path.\n- deliverable_affiliations: 226 remapped, 53 deactivated where the\n  deliverable+phase already has an active affiliation to 46.\n- funding_source_institutions: 181 remapped. project_partners: 6 remapped.\n- liaison_institutions row 358 is left alone on purpose.\n- Every write is guarded: institution 49 must still have an empty name,\n  global unit 45 must exist and be AICCRA, and institution 46 must exist.\n  When any guard fails, every statement affects 0 rows without an error,\n  so no environment''s startup is blocked.\n\nVerified on throwaway copies of an AICCRA production copy, with real\nforeign keys: expected counts (279/181/6, then 53/226/181/6), a second\nrun changes nothing, rows outside the scope are byte-identical, the\nrollback restores all 466 rows exactly, and the guard scenarios (49 named,\nno global unit 45, 45 being another program, no institution 46) run\nwithout errors and touch 0 rows. Flyway 4.0.1 parses the file into the\nexpected 8 statements.","tree":{"sha":"e5a2e4bb6815429a9348778c214555b54998c727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/e5a2e4bb6815429a9348778c214555b54998c727"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/4a530804a45e7aeb87056031e52454d9490c867e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","