jitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/8eb54b733d2254a5aef5b881dcf6590ea105bcdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:43Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:43Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"[SPEC:docs/specs/changes/retire-covid19-impact-section] ♻️ refactor(project impacts): Retire the COVID-19 impact section\n\nThe section had been unreachable since 2022: only CCAFS ever enabled it, with\nthe year range 2020-2021, so isYearToShowSectionCovid19() returned false for\nevery phase after that. AICCRA never enabled it at all.\n\nRemoves the screen, the Pentaho report and their Struts routes; the validator,\nthe completeness cases and the BaseAction year-range gate; the DAOs, managers,\nmodels and Hibernate mappings; and the three specificity keys, two permissions\nand their role grants, via a migration.\n\nproject_impacts and project_impacts_categories are kept, rows and all (DA-004):\n9 impact rows and 5 categories, all from 2020, with answers of 0-17 characters.\nsection_statuses.project_impact_id is left in place and simply unmapped - it is\nnon-null on 0 rows across all five local copies, so nothing is lost.\n\nVerified: clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS, 2416 + 1219\nfiles), Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD, and the closing sweep returning\nonly the spec folder. On the local stack, projects/aiccra/impacts.do and\nprojects/aiccra/impactCovid19Summary.do both return 404, against a live control\nthat returns the login page and an unknown action that returns 404.","tree":{"sha":"46ddc5fa390d5cb6c37818e83aee4637484e444f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/46ddc5fa390d5cb6c37818e83aee4637484e444f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/8eb54b733d2254a5aef5b881dcf6590ea105bcdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/8eb54b733d2254a5aef5b881dcf6590ea105bcdb","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDhlYjU0YjczM2QyMjU0YTVhZWY1Yjg4MWRjZjY1OTBlYTEwNWJjZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/dc16189ea6530e5bdd7ffb9b127bff2e3f749a3e","sha":"dc16189ea6530e5bdd7ffb9b127bff2e3f749a3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/dc16189ea6530e5bdd7ffb9b127bff2e3f749a3e"}],"sha":"8eb54b733d2254a5aef5b881dcf6590ea105bcdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/8eb54b733d2254a5aef5b881dcf6590ea105bcdb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co