heir label as text, so AICCRA listed CSA (3) before KS (1) and\nPD (2), and PDO (0) last.\n\nThe components now follow the same rule as the Cluster Description\nchecklist: PDO first, then the numbered components in numeric order,\nthen the rest by label. The number is read from the label the option\nshows, since AICCRA keeps it in the name (\"KS - 1. Knowledge...\") and\nAICCRA 3 in the acronym (\"Component 1 - ...\"). The grouping by source\nand the order of the managing partners and regional managers do not\nchange.\n\nThe component helpers now take a label so both lists share them, and\nbecome private; the tests go through the comparators.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD\nSUCCESS, 2416 + 1046 files), Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD, the\nJava hygiene check with no findings, and the test suite with -am (296\nrun, 0 failures).","tree":{"sha":"648de0d028e2b9c2ef11270f01a5c190b13c34c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/648de0d028e2b9c2ef11270f01a5c190b13c34c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/bc1db2492b0133ec0cf1592274ad5a7082bbebbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/