/api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/618dc3925a607e1012d7259d729ee83bd4ed8b17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:50:07Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:50:07Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"♻️ refactor(parameters): Remove the unused login header text parameter\n\ncrp_login_header_text customised the label of the non-production banner\nthrough BaseAction.getCustomTextHeader(). header.ftl stopped calling that\ngetter in 94f16b6b7d (2025-03-13) and now prints \"Testing Environment\"\ndirectly, which is also the only value the parameter ever held in any\ndatabase, so the banner does not change.\n\n- Drop the customTextHeader field, its getter and setter from BaseAction\n- Drop CRP_LOGIN_HEADER_TEXT from both APConstants\n- Migration deletes its custom_parameters and parameters rows by key. DML\n  only, no assumed ids, idempotent; run twice on a throwaway copy of the\n  aiccradb2 tables, removing 3 parameters and 3 values and nothing else\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS,\n2416 + 1046 files), Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD, and a clean\nJava hygiene check.","tree":{"sha":"bbf1924c068fb55d04aae0596d58af5d93db2be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/bbf1924c068fb55d04aae0596d58af5d93db2be9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/618dc3925a607e1012d7259d729ee83bd4ed8b17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"comm