ps://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/32daad156f536399fd935c6cfaeaa1c8d926bd11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:32:35Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:32:35Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(email log): Apply the support-team specificity to the email retry\n\nsendRetry checked crp_enable_email_notification with the global unit of\nthe row but not crp_email_support_team, so a retry from an environment\nthat sends only to the support team reached the real recipients stored\non the row, which in a database copied from production are real people.\nIt now applies the same restriction as send(), with the global unit of\nthe row; a row without one goes only to the support team, as send() does\nwithout a CRP. In a test environment the TO used to be the BCC\nunconditionally, so a row without BCC failed on every retry; it is now\nbuilt as send() builds it.\n\nThe re-send texts of System Admin -> Emails are shorter.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS),\nthe full marlo-web suite (283 tests, 0 failures, 5 new in\nSendMailSRetryTest, 3 of which fail against the previous SendMailS) and\nCheckstyle at zero delta against HEAD.","tree":{"sha":"6d5cc68a5bef1872e9b5f29e1b9d5803e1da0418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/6d5cc68a5bef1872e9b5f29e1b9d5803e1da0418"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/32daad156f536399fd935c6cfaeaa1c8d926bd11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/32daad156f536399fd935c6cfaeaa1c8d926bd11","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDMyZGFhZDE1NmY1MzYzOTlmZDkzNWM2Y2ZhZWFhMWM4ZDkyNmJkMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1","sha":"5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1"}],"sha":"32daad156f536399fd935c6cfaeaa1c8d926bd11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/32daad156f536399fd935c6cfaeaa1c8d926bd11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:15:45Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:15:45Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"✨ feat(email log): Show sent emails with tabs, filters and their section\n\nSystem Admin -> Emails listed only the emails not sent, and to do so\nloaded every row of email_logs with its message and attachment (tens of\nmegabytes) on each visit. The page now has a Not sent and a Sent tab,\nfilters by global unit, section, date range and subject or recipient,\nand reads the table a page at a time from emailLogs.do without the\nmessage. One detail popup loads a single email from emailLogDetail.do and\nshows its stored HTML in a sandboxed frame. The re-send works on exactly\nthe rows the filters select, or on one email from its popup, and one\nemail that fails no longer stops the batch. Both new endpoints require\nsuper admin.\n\nThe Section column reads source_action: \"Admin > Manage users\" for\n/crp/admin/manageUsers (the crp prefix is left out), \"Background job\"\nfor a send outside any request, which SendMailS now records as\n\"background\", and \"Not recorded\" for the rows logged before the column.\n\nRequest values are validated: ids too long for a long, years outside a\nDATETIME, unknown order columns and a missing type are ignored instead of\nthrowing, and the search text is lower-cased with Locale.ROOT.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS),\nthe full marlo-web suite (278 tests, 0 failures, 6 in the new\nEmailLogsActionTest), Checkstyle at zero delta against HEAD, the DAO\nqueries against a throwaway copy of email_logs (counts, paging, combined\nfilters and every order match plain SQL), and the page in the local\nserver: both tabs, the filters, the popup and invalid request values.","tree":{"sha":"ebb6dd9ac5dffc293a38afe39015ae73136b62ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/ebb6dd9ac5dffc293a38afe39015ae73136b62ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDViYjc4NjAyN2U2ZDE2Y2ZjMjJmMWJmMzk3M2YzNjRiYWYyYTBlYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71","sha":"85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71"}],"sha":"5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/5bb786027e6d16cfc22f1bf3973f364baf2a0eb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/commits/85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:15:45Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:15:45Z","email":"k.tanaka@cgiar.org","name":"Kenji Tanaka"},"message":"🐛 fix(email log): Never log a failed send without an error as delivered\n\nThreadSendMail.sendWithRetries answers null for a sent message and the\nerror of the last attempt otherwise. A MessagingException with no message\nand no cause made that error null too, so the email was logged as\ndelivered and the backup server was never tried. The error is now the\nmessage of the cause or of the exception, or its class name when neither\nhas one.\n\nVerified with a clean recompile of marlo-data + marlo-web (BUILD SUCCESS)\nand the full marlo-web suite (278 tests, 0 failures, 1 new in\nThreadSendMailTest).","tree":{"sha":"2f4bb8584d8cb8a2b42cb73a3320ecf129446db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/trees/2f4bb8584d8cb8a2b42cb73a3320ecf129446db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CCAFS/MARLO/git/commits/85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17478511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kenjitm","id":17478511,"login":"kenjitm","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDc4NTEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenjitm","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/85f4d1b9fa0eb19c97eaa6b8737d56569e0aec71","node_id":"C_kwDOA329DNoAKDg1ZjRkMWI5ZmEwZWIxOWM5N2VhYTZiODczN2Q1NjU2OWUwYWVjNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CCAFS/MARLO/commit/a304236b3596709416c0fc7a967e223c1