direct.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/pull/79\">#79</a>)</p>\n<p>Reported by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/waydeshi\"><code>@​waydeshi</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/issues/76\">#76</a>.\nA fix was also proposed by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aniebiet\"><code>@​aniebiet</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/pull/78\">#78</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">source-map-js''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>1.2.2</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Fix crash when executing in browser with CSP script-src that don''t\npermit unsafe-eval (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/pull/29\">#29</a>)\n<a href=\"https://github.com/xfournet\"><code>@​xfournet</code></a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix denial of service from malicious indexed source maps\n(CVE-2026-93749) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/pull/79\">#79</a>)</p>\n<p>Reported by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/waydeshi\"><code>@​waydeshi</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/issues/76\">#76</a>.\nA fix was also proposed by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/aniebiet\"><code>@​aniebiet</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/pull/78\">#78</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/commit/0a1d334fd1e55a47df97fcd60a7915d46df3b08a\"><code>0a1d334</code></a>\n1.2.2</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/commit/4c6fa26d77419bd8e48ec92844866cce7d9ae739\"><code>4c6fa26</code></a>\nUpdate changelog</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/7rulnik/source-map-js/commit/cf7658058ceeaa8619d5ae0ec90be6905209d016\"><code>cf76580</code></a>\nFix denial of service fr