":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:10:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump dompurify from 3.4.13 to 3.4.16 (#19983)\n\nBumps [dompurify](https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify) from 3.4.13 to\n3.4.16.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/releases\">dompurify''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>DOMPurify 3.4.16</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed a problem with <code>IN_PLACE</code> node removal when working\nwith hooks, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/manus-pi\"><code>@​manus-pi</code></a></li>\n<li>Fixed a problem with <code>IN_PLACE</code> sanitization and raw-text\nroots, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/h-t-m\"><code>@​h-t-m</code></a></li>\n<li>Fixed a problem with ESM default exports landing in CommonJS\ndeclarations, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ssi02014\"><code>@​ssi02014</code></a></li>\n<li>Migrated from <code>rollup</code> to <code>rolldown</code> because\nperformance, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ssi02014\"><code>@​ssi02014</code></a></li>\n<li>Bumped several dependencies where possible</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>DOMPurify 3.4.15</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Added better clobbering hardening when XML content is involved,\nthanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gnyselcuk\"><code>@​gnyselcuk</code></a></li>\n<li>Added several smaller hardening and edge-case improvements, thanks\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/leechristensen\"><code>@​leechristensen</code></a></li>\n<li>Bumped several dependencies where possible</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>DOMPurify 3.4.14</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue with possible bypasses when risky tags are\nallow-listed, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/AlirezaRouhbakhsh\"><code>@​AlirezaRouhbakhsh</code></a></li>\n<li>Fixed a couple of edge cases with mixed document contexts, thanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/fishjojo1\"><code>@​fishjojo1</code></a></li>\n<li>Added the SVG <code>pointer-events</code> and\n<code>vector-effect</code> presentation attributes to the allow-list,\nthanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Jaybhade\"><code>@​Jaybhade</code></a></li>\n<li>Conducted another refactoring run, removed dead branches and\nduplicated logic, flattened attribute validation</li>\n<li>Updated the documentation in several spots, README, wiki, etc.,\nthanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Akokonunes\"><code>@​Akokonunes</code></a></li>\n<li>Updated several development dependencies and CI workflow\nactions</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/commit/b9b9d80f7e401771c2ccaef5f45def7eec8f27d7\"><code>b9b9d80</code></a>\nrelease: 3.4.16 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/issues/1636\">#1636</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/commit/1d7460c4f8a27be825c11b1c9d346d79db32c1e5\"><code>1d7460c</code></a>\nrelease: 3.4.15 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/issues/1609\">#1609</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/commit/4e6fe24173f1a85eafacd95e3c82966e29d34d49\"><code>4e6fe24</code></a>\nrelease: 3.4.14 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/issues/1587\">#1587</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify/compare/3.4.13...3.4.16\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=dompurify&package-manager=npm_and_yarn&previous-version=3.4.13&new-version=3.4.16)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don''t\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fe4e39c2309185c994c1e615c353b846a7f1f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/2fe4e39c2309185c994c1e615c353b846a7f1f2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/d31cf5e831e0e68b5168fada425301f4096695f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fe4e39c2309185c994c1e615c353b846a7f1f2c\nparent 94c2ba8b5c382844dd2935be92227e98a8cb1c57\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791310233 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791310233 +0100\n\nBump dompurify from 3.4.13 to 3.4.16 (#19983)\n\nBumps [dompurify](https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify) from 3.4.13 to\n3.4.16.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced fr