ter":{"date":"2026-09-19T10:09:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove `CLAUDE.md` in favor of `AGENTS.md` (#19774)\n\n## References\n\nNo issue. Repo housekeeping: as of [Claude Code\nv2.1.277](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.277),\nClaude Code reads `AGENTS.md` directly in a project with no `CLAUDE.md`,\nso the import shim is redundant.\n\n## Code changes\n\nDeletes the root `CLAUDE.md`, which contained only a heading and\n`@AGENTS.md`. `AGENTS.md` is unchanged and nothing else in the repo\nreferences the file. Keeping a single instruction file avoids the two\ndrifting apart.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Claude Code (Claude Fable 5.1)","tree":{"sha":"94b85c9684b4ee005cb79a7d165d1fe7a011149f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/94b85c9684b4ee005cb79a7d165d1fe7a011149f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/09bb93e76f03e9f8d74172f69f837df7e7f3f5e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 94b85c9684b4ee005cb79a7d165d1fe7a011149f\nparent 5ad633d6747371452c2f5fe465d18a70b8f3195d\nauthor Jarren <sanjose.jarren@gmail.com> 1789812576 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789812576 +0100\n\nRemove `CLAUDE.md` in favor of `AGENTS.md` (#19774)\n\n## References\n\nNo issue. Repo housekeeping: as of [Claude Code\nv2.1.277](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.277),\nClaude Code reads `AGENTS.md` directly in a project with no `CLAUDE.md`,\nso the import shim is redundant.\n\n## Code changes\n\nDeletes the root `CLAUDE.md`, which contained only a heading and\n`@AGENTS.md`. `AGENTS.md` is unchanged and nothing else in the repo\nreferences the file. Keeping a single instruction file avoids the two\ndrifting apart.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Claude Code (Claude Fable 5.1)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrl9gCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjCsQAKO8S2CX8YAy3yN3PRTTT4mp\nSXktXarZ7p3qQf7jsaWebHX20rO3uHNS//Km7rXDcoKHVijXXN/1f5Eu4uV7UZg8\n5LkU22GqaZLQS2wk1BOpeQNZeUFHGlDrvK4lhzs8nno5fLQ8kT98EKdIxo6qulJo\normMgS5diMYZpQLlDCLLzWcO/79fcyOb1wUHo2xqHGKEN/PuWLdr5aOf4iScYcT2\n5zkS4DvfaXN0N4aEUgCak4nHApxmrlWeAuMWpyr3dXJFRjoLb+U5JVEy2JtBFr+b\nRWzUa6lLK1QcaeRNQwCDDGOvcfGR4NztsgC5mxBuLdeaRvWhyqCN5KoXvFTIUWWJ\n1BNmjbtq7YECVUlir4fZFfrpa+obmZTPB6kBwlU/DrKzsdco/N7I5WLim7005lJF\ngGa2tBQfXmnvPEPUp+LctMr/WOROtXGl0Pk0d4siOgvIFJ4+eRTx4UQ48aS6k3nL\nVJzGTdGqhg2Z36cxHMeMwi9eSwxdCF41co7TMjv0XgZOZAFcoWb6ieRnHPclIKC3\ndXIZK82ETnMDUln0fofgXRqEYVE+fEJcYwPod8mwu/EE2rxoNtwrxoI8okfc/so2\nauMayswSgpuBatu3B+lrHl3rpw5hM/gAjjG+rl96++vUkdYn/Nugtm5jmef1FgBo\nvehRrMYCploVuCpKsjfW\n=IEZ0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T10:09:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user