ate":"2026-09-16T10:36:23Z","email":"jsumitha012@gmail.com","name":"Sumitha J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:36:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rename \"Revert\" button to \"Reload from Disk\" in file conflict dialog (#19191)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19173\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Renamed the **\"Revert\"** button in the file conflict dialog to\n**\"Reload from Disk\"**.\n- This makes the button label accurately describe its behavior and\naligns it with the existing **\"Reload from Disk\"** menu action.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nUsers will now see **\"Reload from Disk\"** instead of **\"Revert\"** in the\nfile conflict dialog when a file has been modified on disk.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sumitha007 <jsumitha012@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nicolas Brichet <32258950+brichet@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5509f48965e0e03905c41b85f58d67f18ba2bcf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/5509f48965e0e03905c41b85f58d67f18ba2bcf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/5ad633d6747371452c2f5fe465d18a70b8f3195d","verification":{"payload":"tree 5509f48965e0e03905c41b85f58d67f18ba2bcf8\nparent 47511ecbcbaf1277d30890545663d789a9a1bf51\nauthor Sumitha J <jsumitha012@gmail.com> 1789554983 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789554983 +0200\n\nRename \"Revert\" button to \"Reload from Disk\" in file conflict dialog (#19191)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19173\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Renamed the **\"Revert\"** button in the file conflict dialog to\n**\"Reload from Disk\"**.\n- This makes the button label accurately describe its behavior and\naligns it with the existing **\"Reload from Disk\"** menu action.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nUsers will now see **\"Reload from Disk\"** instead of **\"Revert\"** in the\nfile conflict dialog when a file has been modified on disk.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sumitha007 <jsumitha012@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Nicolas Brichet <32258950+brichet@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqnEnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkAMQAHEDp07efpwmlN5ImOkLpPfS\n8op1+7GZXZS7Reur+nypOPTh2U4fVrvrRY7UE7N8oEu7X35k14WC2O02NX2wTgJ5\nelPLd34Op/DXCMfa0rTSCWQT9V5Gi3yF2R7KLO+3k3Gh0wRs0WkBqPOjd5cOz/A9\nMelQ3LgxdThQTo+0tNHAJOb8dcdfQc1X96ap5ZF8HX1fLy8e8FQlYCYSIvF3QS7L\nFoVKCujIwEhUVIHmggeqBjzY3TLUxR3voyVTsxxN1b6XHmwpgYwnztcJ7w5ZL17A\n3p2OGotrzVjeZDn86PWpRTUMEWA11FTbS9dlvWGLNnlu3QIJ1i9sGjgvWGc+WlkL\nVKTtSJKzF0Wc535DtjB8xVndb3rgzzUgiLewZts/yfo6pwOqciO2GM1VrWHU/Q0o\nGfbbPh/sgSylDSAD5J9Ly2/W5MS2qsnsLKgxz9yiUA29twR8htBXtAfEAzrB46+b\nVa2XVCR9DSFyepAc8JZus7+1pctzkM9/ZGIqCu3Il4GPKpFS2ftvr4DbAM8axMQ/\nfycqHbAQxUhofNTyuyoe3LCQJIi+tp7S+nmu4geIG1DB+aSA9en727m+uExaCDdL\nc32Ny/3MkQhGhiVMMp7l8kxmY1LZbmvje9bUhT3mmAZpgtfa9dYrwgcdCR228GP8\nSllliTMxfXiKOCQ7Q+zs\n=jpq+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T10:36:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_ty