, passes a `created`\nrange to the GitHub Actions API, locally rejects runs outside that\nwindow, and logs the selected run IDs/dates for easier debugging.\n\nThe workflow now exposes the window length as a manual `days` input,\npasses it to the analyzer, and includes the requested day count in the\ntracking issue comment. This should prevent stale runs from silently\nproducing an old report window.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nnone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.4","tree":{"sha":"0362ecb01d77990e23b9a6e68693efc6bcdedf76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/0362ecb01d77990e23b9a6e68693efc6bcdedf76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/8a048aa1b7e221a01719aedf0c152dfcfef66b49","verification":{"payload":"tree 0362ecb01d77990e23b9a6e68693efc6bcdedf76\nparent 764aa8acbfd24d8bf35932bb51c3490b03fefbd9\nauthor ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com> 1789511179 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789511179 +0100\n\nUse explicit Galata report window (#19757)\n\n<!--\nThanks for contributing to JupyterLab!\nPlease fill out the following items to submit a pull request.\nSee the contributing guidelines for more information:\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\n-->\n\n## References\n\nRef:\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/19153#issuecomment-5646623573\n\n## Code changes\n\nThis updates the Galata flakiness report to analyze workflow runs from\nan explicit created-at window instead of relying only on the latest run\ncount. The analyzer now accepts a `--days` option, passes a `created`\nrange to the GitHub Actions API, locally rejects runs outside that\nwindow, and logs the selected run IDs/dates for easier debugging.\n\nThe workflow now exposes the window length as a manual `days` input,\npasses it to the analyzer, and includes the requested day count in the\ntracking issue comment. This should prevent stale runs from silently\nproducing an old report window.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nnone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.4","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqcYLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwx0QAFCCI48aQT8Zzi5qUIHQ9M69\n9N9ludoHJ4r/Tht9jJRXVhiq8rijwIDqK82Pc1+kMaoYGH5Pah6LwZnN1u/tATGW\n8mSib+Qi5icFaU/PlCcc5GyW2hzfnowQukhKUeL6qKt1rA1uL5nBltbCfIHOj743\nFfCO01ECjtYO/pJZo1FOkBn9BsvuoLvphg5AYIAujBRnUj/dXGOwLq0474gsD97f\n3Xly1PGtt4INfzPBP8JRNODCeH6viSteT58TzwgToXzPq/Scgc/vpI4W15DLQG4n\n4UrTuYHaawvFnFXv3aSzO5OVQKTaaMWJY2HxA9y4ESYgoYjqur/76ahN3tnWMRCl\nuQLSc0BzEzQykTMiRAxxX0e50Po9kdWpbFREcJ6xQPOCRODJ6NSxBdbFaxFPZWr1\nz9HhcXCgLPgA/vtEhubM3pnuL9No694/bexzbER6jcVpJ+/u5/N9loDgHMk/PIPW\nvxqXn1JTL1CFpucvwDhyNBoJ3lfFwoWQdAmGQCTX9f31cE0i/WxFw5ds39RnrM8e\nCqEzympkDXzzFysbnbFRI6EPzzbKrMxEtDWE2CTSNff90H6s9uI4wVkPVWw2OB3A\nWvegTUOnH4Mmbk1V/a/y4wDsaVDQP9mme5a0TgKgebYTGEvkJpNh3JDGfCRQiKrl\nqD/HiGT5e0GrZ6mA+Unr\n=DOFD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-15T22:26:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0