,"message":"CI: align Yarn cache configuration (#19737)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19731\n\n## Code changes\n\nSet `YARN_ENABLE_GLOBAL_CACHE=1` at the `linuxjs` job level in\n`.github/workflows/linuxjs-tests.yml`.\n\nThe cache directory is discovered during the shared `base-setup` action,\nbefore `ci_install.sh` and `ci_script.sh` run. Those scripts enable\nYarn''s\nglobal cache only for later steps, so the cache action previously\ntargeted\n`.yarn/cache` while Yarn used the global cache directory. This caused\nthe\ncache step to report a path validation error and skip saving the cache.\n\nDefining the variable at job scope makes cache discovery and dependency\ninstallation use the same Yarn configuration.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI coding assistant\n\nCo-authored-by: openclaw <openclaw@openclawdeMac-mini.local>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9a4d0c9667216208aa3562feccfc6887652c67a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/f9a4d0c9667216208aa3562feccfc6887652c67a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/f8b88c8551cf1e02155b3d26a99d21dab9103205","verification":{"payload":"tree f9a4d0c9667216208aa3562feccfc6887652c67a\nparent 4fc6361af9ee599c64f4228b7de5f15c164a8b92\nauthor zihjiang <zihjiang@gmail.com> 1789388096 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789388096 +0100\n\nCI: align Yarn cache configuration (#19737)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19731\n\n## Code changes\n\nSet `YARN_ENABLE_GLOBAL_CACHE=1` at the `linuxjs` job level in\n`.github/workflows/linuxjs-tests.yml`.\n\nThe cache directory is discovered during the shared `base-setup` action,\nbefore `ci_install.sh` and `ci_script.sh` run. Those scripts enable\nYarn''s\nglobal cache only for later steps, so the cache action previously\ntargeted\n`.yarn/cache` while Yarn used the global cache directory. This caused\nthe\ncache step to report a path validation error and skip saving the cache.\n\nDefining the variable at job scope makes cache discovery and dependency\ninstallation use the same Yarn configuration.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI coding assistant\n\nCo-authored-by: openclaw <openclaw@openclawdeMac-mini.local>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqp+VACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnIEQAHBx20zQwwcjYTUxlF3DGsAk\ndJU1kKJfqGqXK9bmJU8G3P1v9c2L1u2F6MP42m8MyW/VkagOJkLl4T7IaFGm0eNT\n+2Kne4fxafoS7XMww+fc4EGtgJxXItOh00YQRz9swNBV/ZkqIY7bjng8Z+utODBJ\novZSqDnkZ/PpbeJ0egbDVt+WQW//k5zHnOEr/4E4uC85zuJ+Q74zXjKXFFWCnRiD\nQtkyeNK3fEUuvBZqQ26SL5sZAC+SFvypTwXCJLWgrZ8myaoRUhhwwqlMETz+4GXp\nkzV7U2HIOqcl+mZntUvJgeyP6p0IYaLRMcIK3wu1gda3OR2oquFILAxxxP4snIGb\nUAeVq0wnAptx8WLCKsJNx5as8QYNQUyuiJhPPkh5WQ0snMF5qYmZp0EAeYcO1HEi\nmG6sK3Z7HAuJ7ttw014LTGeiLP0GyrGvo8Eay98kFzftLXxt3OYmftSReaXG4pEh\nZm5f9h3q/0sgr5fgJrlZ17M8cT0TSdsuV+5mWOHFiazfJLA3HeNTOfA6EzO5xPxo\nOX0Ssk+Wc1fOZQHchVdpuKSNM3tDXV5/185XQqJf7wksmuBk9YTJb96r8Hvudx5P\nSzvIHARGmYr008BxiPgpDvtoctkHtfGKx+yoGh5j3/75Xpu9L/32GpDJUXFa7ifF\njPT3q1plIgLefODut0aM\n=O1Py\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T12:14:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/