i.github.com/users/krassowski","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/f41e1caaba0adbf1317c3fc390e28796be3d2f60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:27:43Z","email":"5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Michał Krassowski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T08:27:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cache and throttle path resolution to avoid requests storm (#19726)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19721\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Add a cache behind `resolvePath` calls\n\n## User-facing changes\n\n- Resolved URLs show up faster\n- Patterns which do not map to an URL do not get spurious retries within\n1 minute\n- Limit number of `resolvePath` requests send at any given time to 4 \n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **Yes**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **Yes**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Opus 5, Fable 5.1","tree":{"sha":"debb6d9e494a41a96dec1dab5d8610317c116ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/debb6d9e494a41a96dec1dab5d8610317c116ec3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/f41e1caaba0adbf1317c3fc390e28796be3d2f60","verification":{"payload":"tree debb6d9e494a41a96dec1dab5d8610317c116ec3\nparent cd7f6133a5809c83ebbede50673b06aa2fd0c311\nauthor Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com> 1789374463 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789374463 +0530\n\nCache and throttle path resolution to avoid requests storm (#19726)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19721\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Add a cache behind `resolvePath` calls\n\n## User-facing changes\n\n- Resolved URLs show up faster\n- Patterns which do not map to an URL do not get spurious retries within\n1 minute\n- Limit number of `