mata/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomatotomata","id":170848582,"login":"tomatotomata","node_id":"U_kgDOCi7xRg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomatotomata","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/3903cf54e9b1f9dc65283fa38878e263d470538c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:17:02Z","email":"Ahmadalgaidy@hotmail.com","name":"tomatotomata"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:17:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Preserve kernelspec metadata when spec is unavailable (#19247)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #17303\n\nThere are no other pull requests addressing this issue that I am aware\nof.\n\n## Code changes\n\nWhen a kernel is removed while a notebook is open, the live kernel spec\ncan become unavailable. The notebook panel previously overwrote\n`kernelspec.display_name` and `kernelspec.language` with `undefined`,\nleaving invalid notebook metadata and preventing the notebook from being\nreopened.\n\nThe change preserves each existing metadata value when the live spec is\nunavailable, and falls back to the kernel name only when no previous\ndisplay name exists. A focused regression test covers the\nunavailable-spec path.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNotebook metadata remains valid when its kernel spec disappears. There\nare no visual changes.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated with AI\nassistance.\n- **NO**: The human author has not yet independently run the\nrepository''s full test workflow, so this PR remains draft.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n## Validation\n\n- `prettier --check packages/notebook/src/panel.ts\npackages/notebook/test/panel.spec.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- The full repository test workflow still needs to be run in a\ncompatible JupyterLab development environment.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a160744ccf130f5dce228e1e7dc4199f659b1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/1a160744ccf130f5dce228e1e7dc4199f659b1e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/3903cf54e9b1f9dc65283fa38878e263d470538c","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a160744ccf130f5dce228e1e7dc4199f659b1e2\nparent 4d07601fe800fb0e8a122a8e706e7359cfa68ada\nauthor tomatotomata <Ahmadalgaidy@hotmail.com> 1789143422 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789143422 +0100\n\nPreserve kernelspec metadata when spec is unavailable (#19247)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #17303\n\nThere are no other pull requests addressing this issue that I am aware\nof.\n\n## Code changes\n\nWhen a kernel is removed while a notebook is open, the live kernel spec\ncan become unavailable. The notebook panel previously overwrote\n`kernelspec.display_name` and `kernelspec.language` with `undefined`,\nleaving invalid notebook metadata and preventing the notebook from being\nreopened.\n\nThe change preserves each existing metadata value when the live spec is\nunavailable, and falls back to the kernel name only when no previous\ndisplay name exists. A focused regression test covers the\nunavailable-spec path.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNotebook metadata remains valid when its kernel spec disappears. There\nare no visual changes.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated with AI\nassistance.\n- **NO**: The human author has not yet independently run the\nrepository''s full test workflow, so this PR remains draft.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n## Validation\n\n- `prettier --check packages/notebook/src/panel.ts\npackages/notebook/test/panel.spec.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n- The full repository test workflow still needs to be run in a\ncompatible JupyterLab development environment.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpCl+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT6QQAIvRpvvQik2m21x4w4TvLo9M\nmkWhUrytB5Y2yNNyu95WpTLEE9e3gtdsYoQE4w+bSnVZaBfQ+iStOXJN8niWFIJN\n8TP1JBLc0ShFWpif3xHbq5Xp7S3SV3JiucL/Ql3WUx6BqpsBp56AxoGXavQzGVOL\nRmVzbR6Efdy7dhuRCx6WRYxQlKEOnrMfOto/k0X1EJnqkMqBVZ6QEoLESU2kKQQC\n/jBiODMtHbRPoOIIrt/F85+XqaffQICIvo+lMYGP6nOjR9/tXUiKGfmSFgOUx6Es\nWxyxlY071MBnM0bUZf3YssjQDijfSepFPLyvwjFZ8IXA06SfM/HXjplcxOMIvrbl\nUlzRxDB1xwLOhrCfooEfQG94JfYcRlravmrYESVmu29Hxlzchh9DtmvpQKPzgDv9\nHGH2jXwZzOJHMtwVUIs4SwU/s8jYiLiVSotJ+2rLoClMgo3P6iqA7NQZ3tlMt5tt\nrD0eBQXW4OmMyeURYVQdqwFnQcDxnGqgGS0JCFlDNREps1iyt3bUi5WU7CLuzeec\nJsRp9oxdZbUqyRhbWdXJE/h03IMm4FayMUx5r6HXw0lFmK7W/dG3pcJ6ZC4XtYPM\nPBUmvqQR+KB3cQhwjXRhUdUMyjocSbFnYFjyY5f0WEXzdyZP3Xog/5oUMWMjLLnQ\nzam/bUXSP/NW4XdDd+lO\n=mjdu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T16:17:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api