.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/cda2fce73bb2d72bcad81e756031eac766d5e5da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/3c5af3b91877cc04f67fef60fa5a0fac7179bf1d","verification":{"payload":"tree cda2fce73bb2d72bcad81e756031eac766d5e5da\nparent c9277f586523f97ec65756bcdc2ade53adbf25e6\nauthor Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com> 1789130901 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789130901 +0200\n\nFix respecting `commsOverSubshells` option in `connectTo()` (#19734)\n\n## References\n\n- Follow-up to:\n  - https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/19725\n  - https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/17363\n\n## Code changes\n\nEffectively:\n\n```diff\n-  commsOverSubshells: this._commsOverSubshells,\n+  commsOverSubshells: options.commsOverSubshells ?? this._commsOverSubshells,\n```\n\n\\+ docs + tests.\n\nThe signature was already accepting the `commsOverSubshells` and\ndiscarding it was not documented. I think this was a mistake that\nslipped thought but pinging @martinRenou (author of the original code)\nfor review.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **Yes**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **Yes**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Fable 5.1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo/iVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjF0QAIeKa69/GIH6W2MxVI8i5a/I\nmz23CFnAgguwpxhcG0ttB1XqwguMNHk0yjoArPmh8MWTet62kxnVaztXTi45R7GX\nKIf7+Xre+Ck/Nz0heNkzEmL9b7oTdTWLcD0zhOteA6C/iHJbxrOItzUIVwxhU08A\ncCqzGkgrscOfymFGgiEZViAZnpfM4fE9Kf+fitBGG9zuhjZpyVEBYTbdFxy784DI\nl4zEZ0soun8qDRvYUjWtlMGAN1eKRYswjI4oXotwhA69Mel4NvA5ZftAacfWYkly\nX7QxcnAE/AWdT5Y92dYYWwhPLks9rMLknpgDOzl2MnLiRqaDuA2Z1f3Q9L21oIYr\nKo6j0U0h5zYtKG8REAh/qk1mAggluCrDGE+W3eQw0OOYvwxpENToJu7QQd6Cg2ON\nVk5fLevzmy0aW4Jc9gf6+IVH