\n\n## References\n\n- Fixes https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/17955 - we now\ndebounce inline history provider completions; other tests were made\nrobust to kernel slowness as part of the earlier work on squashing the\nflakiness and now they still pass but just run slower\n- To consider separately:\nhttps://github.com/ipython/ipython/issues/15388\n- Closes #18168 \n\n## Code changes\n\nLargely a follow-up to ipykernel 7 switch:\n- Adds 100ms debounce default for inline history provider because v7 is\nslower\n- Adds some tests for debouncing along the way\n- Improves robustness of \"Kernel status bar shows correct status when\nswitching notebooks\" test\n- Drop pin for `ipykernel<7` for docs tests\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nWhen using ipykernel v7 the kernel should not get inundated with history\nrequests\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **Yes**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **Yes**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Opus 5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: galata-snapshots-bot <263663552+galata-snapshots-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"529f6f41a269b090c06f1e8ac7afb702768c0a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/529f6f41a269b090c06f1e8ac7afb702768c0a47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/bf8d11fe21ed78f1f4c4a23851f3e538c22731bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 529f6f41a269b090c06f1e8ac7afb702768c0a47\nparent badad6eb5c7654403acf70843b21f18b5a5b8445\nauthor Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com> 1789041446 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789041446 +0100\n\nMake inline history provider debounce (fix flaky tests), use ipykernel 7 for docs tests too (#19716)\n\n## References\n\n- Fixes https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/issues/17955 - we now\ndebounce inline history provider completions; other tests were made\nrobust to kernel slowness as part of the earlier work on squashing the\nflakiness and now they still pass but just run slower\n- To consider separately:\nhttps://github.com/ipython/ipython/issues/15388\n- Closes #18168 \n\n## Code changes\n\nLargely a follow-up to ipykernel 7 switch:\n- Adds 100ms debounce default for inline history provider because v7 is\nslower\n- Adds some tests for debouncing along the way\n- Improves robustness of \"Kernel status bar shows correct status when\nswitching notebooks\" test\n- Drop pin for `ipykernel<7` for docs tests\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nWhen using ipykernel v7 the kernel should not get inundated with history\nrequests\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **Yes**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **Yes**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Opus 5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: galata-snapshots-bot <263663552+galata-snapshots-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqopsmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhKMQAFZNPpLtSAv0/nJwgijRH8M7\nODM1V0KEqSy/0z2eT6Nwiuo4n46GvdkAnQmWwstnKfWyLNJvv737ljNWAXuememA\nV65eXHXGXTlvqwovMPobAsggQcgTa2ZNH5MQQb74MSIXCJJcdyZX2JP24U/Q+3M+\nnjVdWGoje9rnb86faNQo7pRA4T6kq9VIr/VNtpn08cq4qRQBX9Gvwf9uxIn4ofbo\nPzLC1395X+GAcAPSbJtuBVnRKbQGNEfMfdiO4kvhrC/9IzX5fb94+hcl9Ogvq4t7\nQ95jUSmLHiP9K0CFGcFlk2JoMODsijX83MFnf/7CCWOpECUrsZEGz6/pe9maXwmS\nd1D79gtKDGtI4m8T1qSggiHXaIgfd5gzXJsSfm3lEu662C03AoBtQiEmqFnW6T8p\nUhCoLzW741LDnp083wz2Vo5Mk4ozvx4lOtgVyNazxasrYsdO2K9fNEDBSjmrDjJS\n8j4x4xMnTKHHEi/2qApyvnk+FFZBRx5fa4qUBfx8VmthcfJ0MGkig7EKIGEwmSi5\nVlS59uLIV+RionzvY6YfTkBAcU5NuVPmUXyPMLliDScEj05IVW0pU5iG+u36A3oT\n/xiH/hvxnBvf/b3ky