orkflow.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f4e8130aa6971b24721a41d111517d6c40e8169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/0f4e8130aa6971b24721a41d111517d6c40e8169"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/9312e29b7bbc95ef905b96afe00c93361943f2f6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f4e8130aa6971b24721a41d111517d6c40e8169\nparent 8f4050aba7f6716aaa748c4fe79c9c1dedfe2669\nauthor whn <142425816+Whning0513@users.noreply.github.com> 1787936366 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787936366 +0100\n\nAdd a search provider for Markdown Viewer (#19222)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19214\n\n## Code changes\n\nThis PR registers the existing generic DOM search provider for Markdown\nViewer widgets, so the rendered Markdown view can participate in\nJupyterLab''s document search workflow.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nMarkdown Viewer widgets can now participate in JupyterLab''s document\nsearch workflow.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkb5uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZCMQAA+QB6XWdOkfHCM8CaR1xryM\nidDHX2qZjBROu+O6YqroR00g5/pD6IU7tRkxCGVehnZy2OlD6CVja5G12bQbTTJy\nhWSGJsICvruEF++l3az9l8U4nzjrn8XuRsaL1ps33dYTLSBw82n+83qYxqgoXOlq\naQZJTqrPfEwbScRoodS2u7jE+LBIk7+s5I7CF2x6UyZ2ejNPtPLSDBz8j0tv7ExH\nlWcIpmAWDzQkCeMi3O