61943f2f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/9312e29b7bbc95ef905b96afe00c93361943f2f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309400591?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fly1d","id":309400591,"login":"fly1d","node_id":"U_kgDOEnEUDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fly1d","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/8f4050aba7f6716aaa748c4fe79c9c1dedfe2669/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:59:02Z","email":"zhanghui121383@gmail.com","name":"fly1d"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:59:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show context actions for all images, not only SVGs (#19618)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19610.\n\nThe security changes in #19184 introduced the SVG-specific class and the\ncontext-menu entries. This pull request corrects the selector scope of\nthose entries; it does not alter the security handling or command\nimplementations.\n\nRelated image-viewer PRs #18237 and #18811 focus on zoom behavior and do\nnot change this selector.\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Change all eight image-viewer context-menu selectors from\n`.jp-ImageViewer.jp-mod-svg` to `.jp-ImageViewer`.\n- Add a Galata regression assertion that opens a PNG and checks that all\neight image actions are present.\n\nThe common selector matches the class applied to every `ImageViewer`,\nthe existing keyboard shortcut selectors, and the format-independent\ncommand implementations.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nZoom, reset, rotate, flip, and invert actions are now available from an\nimage context menu for supported raster and text-backed image formats,\ninstead of only for SVG images. Command behavior and keyboard shortcuts\nare unchanged.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has not yet completed the required review of\nthis PR; it remains a draft until that review is complete.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex (GPT-5).\n\nOpenAI Codex assisted with the implementation and verification. Human\nreview remains required before this PR is marked ready.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/imageviewer test --runInBand` (12 passed)\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/imageviewer-extension build`\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/galata build:galata`\n- `jlpm test test/jupyterlab/contextmenu.test.ts --project jupyterlab\n--grep \"Open image context menu\"` (1 passed)\n- `pre-commit run --files\npackages/imageviewer-extension/schema/plugin.json\ngalata/test/jupyterlab/contextmenu.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nCo-authored-by: fly1d <309400591+fly1d@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bdc0c0f704d57da4d4ff10e17f72ca351e82f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/7bdc0c0f704d57da4d4ff10e17f72ca351e82f7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/8f4050aba7f6716aaa748c4fe79c9c1dedfe2669","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bdc0c0f704d57da4d4ff10e17f72ca351e82f7e\nparent f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9\nauthor fly1d <zhanghui121383@gmail.com> 1787738342 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787738342 +0100\n\nShow context actions for all images, not only SVGs (#19618)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19610.\n\nThe security changes in #19184 introduced the SVG-specific class and the\ncontext-menu entries. This pull request corrects the selector scope of\nthose entries; it does not alter the security handling or command\nimplementations.\n\nRelated image-viewer PRs #18237 and #18811 focus on zoom behavior and do\nnot change this selector.\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Change all eight image-viewer context-menu selectors from\n`.jp-ImageViewer.jp-mod-svg` to `.jp-ImageViewer`.\n- Add a Galata regression assertion that opens a PNG and checks that all\neight image actions are present.\n\nThe common selector matches the class applied to every `ImageViewer`,\nthe existing keyboard shortcut selectors, and the format-independent\ncommand implementations.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nZoom, reset, rotate, flip, and invert actions are now available from an\nimage context menu for supported raster and text-backed image formats,\ninstead of only for SVG images. Command behavior and keyboard shortcuts\nare unchanged.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **NO**: The human author has not yet completed the required review of\nthis PR; it remains a draft until that review is complete.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex (GPT-5).\n\nOpenAI Codex assisted with the implementation and verification. Human\nreview remains required before this PR is marked ready.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/imageviewer test --runInBand` (12 passed)\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/imageviewer-extension build`\n- `jlpm workspace @jupyterlab/galata build:galata`\n- `jlpm test test/jupyterlab/contextmenu.test.ts --project jupyterlab\n--grep \"Open image context menu\"` (1 passed)\n- `pre-commit run --files\npackages/imageviewer-extension/schema/plugin.json\ngalata/test/jupyterlab/contextmenu.test.ts`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n