e79c9c1dedfe2669","node_id":"C_kwDOA5k_I9oAKDhmNDA1MGFiYTdmNjcxNmFhYTc0OGM0ZmU3OWM5YzFkZWRmZTI2Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commit/f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9","sha":"f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9"}],"sha":"8f4050aba7f6716aaa748c4fe79c9c1dedfe2669","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/8f4050aba7f6716aaa748c4fe79c9c1dedfe2669"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127468609?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Darshan808","id":127468609,"login":"Darshan808","node_id":"U_kgDOB5kEQQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Darshan808","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:43:17Z","email":"pranishpoudel10@gmail.com","name":"Darshan Poudel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:43:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Make singleton the default for core library packages (#19251)\n\n## References\n- https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyter-chat/issues/471\n- https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyter-builder/issues/154\n\n### Problem\n\n`singletonPackages` in `dev_mode/package.json` was populated by a narrow\nheuristic: only packages with a `src/tokens.ts` file were auto-marked as\nsingletons (arrived in\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/8703). This under-covered\ntwo real cases:\n\n- **Token identity outside `tokens.ts`** —\n`@jupyterlab/property-inspector` declares its token in `src/token.ts`\n(singular), and `@jupyterlab/running` declares its tokens inline in\n`src/index.tsx`. Both were missed purely due to file location.\n\n- **Class identity via `instanceof`** — `@jupyterlab/docregistry`,\n`@jupyterlab/cells`, and `@jupyterlab/csvviewer` export classes\n(`DocumentWidget`, `CodeCell`, `CSVViewer) that maybe used in\n`instanceof` checks by other extensions, but have no token at all, so\nthe heuristic never considered them.\n\nMost library packages need to be singletons, and the ones that don''t are\nthe actual exception.\n\n### Change\n\nFlip the default: every library package (i.e. not a `*-extension`\npackage) is now a singleton unless explicitly opted out via a new\n`NOT_SINGLETON` list. Currently that list only contains following:\n\n- `@jupyterlab/core-meta` — not an importable JS module\n- `@jupyterlab/nbconvert-css` — stylesheet-only\n- `@jupyterlab/metapackage` — aggregation shell, re-exports others\n\nThis also sidesteps the Module Federation v2 issue that started this\nthread: `strictVersion` is only honored by MF2''s runtime for singletons.\nPackages that previously fell through as non-singleton (and were\ntherefore forced into strict version matching regardless of config) now\nget MF2''s lenient-by-default behavior automatically, with no dependency\non the [upstream\nbug](https://github.com/module-federation/core/issues/4651) being fixed.\n\n### AI usage\n\n- **NO**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jeremy Tuloup <jeremy.tuloup@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d17c4f3d1b41478bd0a2ad1a69b70fd3934bb3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/1d17c4f3d1b41478bd0a2ad1a69b70fd3934bb3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/f31f962ac80dcd6554018e8362b5f84015324ec9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d17c4f3d1b41478bd0a2ad1a69b70fd3934bb3a\nparent 06dfe441e3b42e94ad169aef91e74c5217c0f88d\nauthor Darshan Poudel <pranishpoudel10@gmail.com> 1787672597 +0545\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787672597 +0100\n\nMake singleton the default for core library packages (#19251)\n\n## References\n- https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyter-chat/issues/471\n- https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyter-builder/issues/154\n\n### Problem\n\n`singletonPackages` in `dev_mode/package.json` was populated by a narrow\nheuristic: only packages with a `src/tokens.ts` file were auto-marked as\nsingletons (arrived in\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/8703). This under-covered\ntwo real cases:\n\n- **Token identity outside `tokens.ts`** —\n`@jupyterlab/property-inspector` declares its token in `src/token.ts`\n(singular), and `@jupyterlab/running` declares its tokens inline in\n`src/index.tsx`. Both were missed purely due to file location.\n\n- **Class identity via `instanceof`** — `@jupyterlab/docregistry`,\n`@jupyterlab/cells`, and `@jupyterlab/csvviewer` export classes\n(`DocumentWidget`, `CodeCell`, `CSVViewer) that maybe used in\n`instanceof` checks by other extensions, but have no token at all, so\nthe heuristic never considered them.\n\nMost library packages need to be singletons, and the ones that don''t are\nthe actual exception.\n\n### Change\n\nFlip the default: every library package (i.e. not a `*-extension`\npackage) is now a singleton unless explicitly opted out via a new\n`NOT_SINGLETON` list. Currently that list only contains following:\n\n- `@jupyterlab/core-meta` — not an importable JS module\n- `@jupyterlab/nbconvert-css` — stylesheet-only\n- `@jupyterlab/metapackage` — aggregation shell, re-exports others\n\nThis also sidesteps the Module Federation v2 issue that started this\nthread: `strictVersion` is only honored by MF2''s runtime for singletons.\nPackages that previously fell through as non-singleton (and were\ntherefore forced into strict version matching regardless of config) now\nget MF2''s lenient-by-default behavior automatically, with no dependency\non the [upstream\nbug](https://github.com/module-federation/core/issues/4651) being fixed.\n\n### AI usage\n\n- **NO**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jeremy Tuloup <jeremy.tuloup@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjbgVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL/EQAIB1X1SkPfZKX+UQT1eg/G9n\n42Fai/WZIMAwtt7vbv23FWDrsBx6Q86LHc6dtsfFyjBgUh+ZeOBreuAS/SfbCHe6\niRmDJhIHcygDu0Wnq0R9M9uf2YjvtNRSmvn5g/a+pwpuP9JdPvw2912+OYhSgXPo\nvcgr0cSg+SrHzV6Vvj0O5cbtTor0OQKu66TlDPYde+x71h9qovdhy+eB/oHVno0V\ntm8F1cxKoBoLrbwYtJjsHk1jIXko/fY4CDO3bgVRYOh6RwxnKOAbsi9WQJg1w9b0\neGkPyUs74DiSUntZiDFmBIHEgh5jfuJWun3krxoi4UTCi0/XClTpkHNxWAGwoovV\nwJ7UrwMLeSscZAlFcVmnPay9yb1cecSylmkqDzbyHX6KVgI/ZpByG8hixZ9PC3op\nX5QJZR4THwCGSR+Or9avUGFaGeX3tH73fKsCaCwveLqrNZTv9PMT+PluPJCJvyAM\n3b4XfPTr+n/17ogQM1tGihkO1+PJyclQltAEpfeHKZptgN/hbK0/9MMAGr17d3xJ\nizcq/EBmwk6UCDMcQtt+GnsHAeNXcBAB/hjSoeaahnImpdPW87avTfQSIMvB8+Ur\nk4DEWy0QznPew9eoPJlT/MrE0lkLUDyBjztBFz3GUGS+sQ6qrRX/DCXuqwQBrPi+\nFIRJhrZmowoBcPD84YpD\n=Ix4o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T15:43:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followi