,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MUFFANUJ","id":151390316,"login":"MUFFANUJ","node_id":"U_kgDOCQYIbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MUFFANUJ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/dd2e34f1b0c884568429d76f77c4817db2b22687/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:56:44Z","email":"anujsinghhero292@gmail.com","name":"ANUJ KUMAR SINGH"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:56:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improve Python typing coverage for JupyterLab server modules (#19557)\n\n## References\nCloses #19057 \n\n## Code changes\n\nThis PR removes the temporary mypy overrides for `browser_check`,\nextension manager modules, announcements handlers, and labapp by adding\nprecise annotations and from __future__ import annotations where needed.\nIt tightens typing around PyPI metadata parsing, proxy handling,\nextension listing options, async update checks, and server/app access\nwithout introducing Any. The changes were validated with mypy, ruff,\nformatting checks, focused announcement/extension tests, and proxy\nimport smoke tests.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.5","tree":{"sha":"6882c70a04f57e827c37390c827b4b156051f1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/6882c70a04f57e827c37390c827b4b156051f1a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/dd2e34f1b0c884568429d76f77c4817db2b22687","verification":{"payload":"tree 6882c70a04f57e827c37390c827b4b156051f1a0\nparent 6ef5a17ad831be80c3e63911b77fa9f8acfcbf50\nauthor ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com> 1787651804 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787651804 +0100\n\nImprove Python typing coverage for JupyterLab server modules (#19557)\n\n## References\nCloses #19057 \n\n## Code changes\n\nThis PR removes the temporary mypy overrides for `browser_check`,\nextension manager modules, announcements handlers, and labapp by adding\nprecise annotations and from __future__ import annotations where needed.\nIt tightens typing around PyPI metadata parsing, proxy handling,\nextension listing options, async update checks, and server/app access\nwithout introducing Any. The changes were validated with mypy, ruff,\nformatting checks, focused announcement/extension tests, and proxy\nimport smoke tests.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.5","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjWbcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6/QQAAaP4SJ5f11I/2nuQULR27Gy\nwzEDtS6Xz2HnkpO2PvtXsaMpBLJkFws1xmDUK3CBEprIh0XoG23Q8GP1tM6Cw7X/\nZueMe+dgsr6awlUgCuna/yxLl2Qm5HYpbm0/UaNhYAJr/gl43DQp8zWqED3f5BsC\ndBLscNd7ZfMdozjm2AhMPetF9Zv1HMdVLpr8SQp+UM/WsM8jsEtkvdQgH4BCrOLo\nQ8SqAsWGV9p/GNJ1awxV95WiLi0odmZU78euv8hUl8OAcsi9swZYKEv4ymTpJ2KQ\nIB8F2bhVCkJUKtJSsSqRjC21F5tLVpNQFRYLKcrfzeg+ZzMqFI3C0mr+WYRAmpzA\noFauac/M1lxL2Tgi7M0Rxv4mIk9fTAAWHM1JnLA4qznIRo4IqB48gpu1JbWFv6WT\n3k/mo9TIMPOvlwR8HC71oL5un9Rjbxbm1JZHZBdJdM0pPAsaYdzLKRCYb27Q3FPK\na