mouse handler now ignores browser selections anchored inside\ncell editors when deciding whether Shift-click should extend cell\nselection, while preserving the existing behavior that selected output\ntext blocks cell selection.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nYes. It fixes a visible notebook interaction bug: Shift-click range\nselection works again after selecting editor text.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b1a186c273ea13f8d964eb1445075716aada92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/7b1a186c273ea13f8d964eb1445075716aada92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/1b9f5c301e9fa9f43d57a15f892ef2505087e3aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 7b1a186c273ea13f8d964eb1445075716aada92c\nparent 25e7caea8554be4fb0e12d27ab9694d07d2b35a7\nauthor ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com> 1786382145 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786382145 +0100\n\nFix Shift-click cell selection after editor text selection (#19243)\n\n## References\n\nCloses #19242 \n\n## Code changes\n\nFixes notebook multi-cell selection after selecting text in a code\neditor. The mouse handler now ignores browser selections anchored inside\ncell editors when deciding whether Shift-click should extend cell\nselection, while preserving the existing behavior that selected output\ntext blocks cell selection.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nYes. It fixes a visible notebook interaction bug: Shift-click range\nselection works again after selecting editor text.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqegdBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqcEQAE6vRZFdV8b/SlUfiKz3V48I\no+Pr7cmU5nryD/J6WL04ty2ACI1x6mNSW0+2QOspBiZeVQmGJpVa/IVGOMHdcXwd\ndAmBK/GlIKffrp9/N/D17o+6mEMZPXZAgvrydkXUfel02pGgO3MVCutGVEv1XzwV\nqmMKrJ6FOPxZEp50hA9v89lgc4sFie5Zkj2qg33O+qVO6LqOk8ZefpZskyAYFUF1\nYgxkzaHRlDkP6sON8qv6JF4zRepGeGNrODaWeD81pZiJHiu8jEMG/NKBkRFiab5L\n/MLq5NWSAbYBlAwYO0tDh7R4kPebIwdygX7eY3MRrAYe97eO5OmaV8RAo7GgVX4T\nwhOTCNsJws7Zm4npS9kL1msZAabjbsVwaAlQ/oBQMGqUv/SyeJGiD/f/5n6ZE0eG\nmJchYy7tCDZhIfoDHW5QcEGs6wiKigLlzXOfdtTV1zotn9pyvegGF2ikLZhekO6V\nTyo08XGWooEoGqo9Cab56Z7oUV6haj+BshUpN9QqTUds5LNEfbD7C5E/BJZf8gU7\n3KqJV+bkLvpCIjNYwWflQ7sW96JRu92gbvorT+Vr2EpJ7On6jrCmtU83lMkJR+/K\nT8KN3GPXg8XUYz0Km1HZMo4XxfGT+QgeK8V2q+RCrJFr9NLj1vaD0SIYOttT80Gg\nPqWS7gzLdZIdyITiowxL\n=YuFC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-10T17:16:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":