l":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix active cell prompt and source blink in notebook tools & prevent a memory leak (#19168)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #18460\n\n## Code changes\n\nUpdate the notebook Common Tools active-cell widget so the input prompt\nis filled and shown synchronously while source highlighting remains\ndebounced. This prevents empty prompt frames when switching cells and\nremoves the Galata workaround.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nPrompt and code does not blink when switching cells.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\n none\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.5, Opus 5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"952a2dc788d2f0d8984d6ce924cd20bd170882db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/952a2dc788d2f0d8984d6ce924cd20bd170882db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/25e7caea8554be4fb0e12d27ab9694d07d2b35a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 952a2dc788d2f0d8984d6ce924cd20bd170882db\nparent 75de712795f955bee5175aa3a579589979a96315\nauthor ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com> 1786363858 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786363858 +0100\n\nFix active cell prompt and source blink in notebook tools & prevent a memory leak (#19168)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #18460\n\n## Code changes\n\nUpdate the notebook Common Tools active-cell widget so the input prompt\nis filled and shown synchronously while source highlighting remains\ndebounced. This prevents empty prompt frames when switching cells and\nremoves the Galata workaround.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nPrompt and code does not blink when switching cells.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\n none\n\n## AI usage\n\n