abled when text is selected inside the active viewer and uses\nJupyterLab''s clipboard utility. The command is placed at the top of the\nmenu, consistent with the other viewer copy actions.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nMarkdown Viewer context menus now show `Copy` at the top when selected\ntext can be copied.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"019eaa9e0fe07699777009374d988a72946bf94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/019eaa9e0fe07699777009374d988a72946bf94e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/08b3325c4ad3a0c817e56d883612b2b167e7404c","verification":{"payload":"tree 019eaa9e0fe07699777009374d988a72946bf94e\nparent 10495e8e976f073fc765ddd5ef517d5a51c594ab\nauthor whn <142425816+Whning0513@users.noreply.github.com> 1786201933 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786201933 +0100\n\nAdd Copy to the Markdown Viewer context menu (#19221)\n\n## References\n\nFixes #19213\n\n## Code changes\n\nThis PR adds a `Copy` command to Markdown Viewer context menus. It is\nenabled when text is selected inside the active viewer and uses\nJupyterLab''s clipboard utility. The command is placed at the top of the\nmenu, consistent with the other viewer copy actions.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nMarkdown Viewer context menus now show `Copy` at the top when selected\ntext can be copied.\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone.\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode.\n- AI tools and models used: OpenAI Codex\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski