ved from `pyproject.toml`.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: ChatGPT 5.4 mini\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michał Krassowski <5832902+krassowski@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f62d2b67224a20f97266294677ecd5fbd071af1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/0f62d2b67224a20f97266294677ecd5fbd071af1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/c92f5efa1285d4e091f8a73a6a661439ca347670","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f62d2b67224a20f97266294677ecd5fbd071af1\nparent 4e152ab5a8375d9673aa3ff3d68361d20b831fc6\nauthor ANUJ KUMAR SINGH <anujsinghhero292@gmail.com> 1786096518 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786096518 +0100\n\nFix issues exposed by `mypy` in build & error handlers, extension upgrade & debug logger (#19231)\n\n<!--\nThanks for contributing to JupyterLab!\nPlease fill out the following items to submit a pull request.\nSee the contributing guidelines for more information:\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\n-->\n\n## References\n\nPart of #19057 \n\n## Code changes\n\nFollow-up to [PR\n#19198](https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/19198). This\ntightens typing in selected Python modules by fixing concrete `mypy`\nissues in debug logging, extension upgrade path handling, and\nbuild/error handlers, allowing several module-level `mypy` overrides to\nbe removed from `pyproject.toml`.\n\n## User-facing changes\n\nNone\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n## AI usage\n\n- **YES**: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- **YES**: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this\ncode (keep this PR \"draft\" until the an