l_url":"https://github.com/IsabelParedes","id":23283243,"login":"IsabelParedes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgzMjQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IsabelParedes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/commits/7f0e690680a763d3c3db5dc0231803b0ba0e1e12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:58:31Z","email":"isabel.paredes@quantstack.net","name":"Isabel Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T08:58:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improve keyboard navigation in settings editor > keyboard shortcuts (#19159)\n\n<!--\nThanks for contributing to JupyterLab!\nPlease fill out the following items to submit a pull request.\nSee the contributing guidelines for more information:\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\n-->\n\n## References\n\n<!-- Note issue numbers this pull request addresses (should be at least\none, see contributing guidelines above). -->\n\n<!-- Note any other pull requests that address this issue and how this\npull request is different. -->\n\n- *Partially* fixes #15546\n- This PR does **not** address the sorting buttons in the column titles\nnor the tool for adding shortcuts.\n\n<img width=\"1186\" height=\"123\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fdb329b-bae3-4e57-91fa-ba64462337ef\"\n/>\n\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Make the buttons in the keyboard shortcuts table tabbable so that they\ncan be navigated with a keyboard.\n- ~~Pressing `Esc` in the Shortcuts input box will move the focus ring\nto the submit button.~~\n- 2000ms timer added to capture key strokes. This timer is reset with\nsubsequent keystrokes to give users sufficient time to input chords.\nAfter the 2s have elapsed, the user can press `Esc` to cancel the action\nor `Tab` to navigate to the next element.\n- Remove Cancel and Overwrite button from the conflict row and the\ndisabled Submit button in the Shortcut cell. The Overwrite button now\nreplaces the Submit button. Cancelling the action can still be\naccomplished with a mouse by clicking outside the shortcuts cell or by\nnavigating away with `Tab` when using only the keyboard.\n\n<!-- Describe the code changes and how they address the issue. -->\n\n## User-facing changes\n\n- Improved button styling.\n- There was a mix of text buttons and icon buttons, opted for icon\nbuttons only since they look cleaner and take up less space, with the\nexception of the Overwrite button since there aren''t any icons that\ncould clearly represent this action.\n- There was also a mix of `<a>`, `<button>` and `<jp-button>`, opted for\nnative `<button>`. I tried sticking with `<jp-button>` at first, but the\nfocus ring lands in the internal `.control` element which makes styling\na bit more difficult.\n- Resized used icons to 16x16 px without scaling. Increased stroke width\nof info icon to improve visibility.\n\n<!-- Describe any visual or user interaction changes and how they\naddress the issue. -->\n\n<!-- For visual changes, include before and after screenshots or\nGIF/mp4/other video demo here. -->\n\n| Before          | After             |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Untabbable <img width=\"359\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89567057-7f86-4320-b0ef-1abdcbcfff23\"\n/> | <img width=\"361\" height=\"182\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bbe4ddf-d57d-45c1-b2bd-2f426d20cb12\"\n/> |\n| Untabbable <img width=\"374\" height=\"72\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10deb65f-a40b-4d0d-a899-3d54a05047cd\"\n/> | Highlights entire shortcut <img width=\"332\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a8dc923-c920-4cec-829e-9396711d63cf\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"220\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0aa8e3db-c33c-4ec8-a3b5-8e61e9971bdc\"\n/> | <img width=\"220\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/040c64f6-a51e-4959-97ad-9c94f4ff19f5\"\n/> |\n| Untabbable Reset <br> <img width=\"158\" height=\"79\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d64e1f2a-cff7-4d93-ae25-01ae77e772a1\"\n/> | <img width=\"176\" height=\"56\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f7ea66e-9972-4699-b159-6ef17859bfeb\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"269\" height=\"56\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e04ce562-5e9f-455d-8487-2c0449831ef6\"\n/> | <img width=\"295\" height=\"64\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19d60c3b-066c-49b5-8f0c-3ea9333a8742\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"270\" height=\"55\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bd1a9cb-ccb2-451c-8bf6-80e8d684c361\"\n/> | <img width=\"265\" height=\"54\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bed42003-6887-4d0c-b2d5-13583a7561f9\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"814\" height=\"122\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2836fc3e-9a05-4a6d-ad25-9511221095ca\"\n/> | <img width=\"813\" height=\"119\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0eb62f71-42cd-485e-99e8-b87e8e4e841a\"\n/> |\n\n<img width=\"1120\" height=\"952\" alt=\"keybindings\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/937f58e4-22c5-4ba7-87cd-9af7ddccf350\"\n/>\n\n\n<img width=\"1120\" height=\"810\" alt=\"keybindings2\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e4dbb99-0152-4acd-8975-e1b2e0d8e485\"\n/>\n\n\n## Backwards-incompatible changes\n\nNone\n\n<!-- Describe any backwards-incompatible changes to JupyterLab public\nAPIs. -->\n\n## AI usage\n\n- YES: Some or all of the content of this PR was generated by AI.\n- YES: The human author has carefully reviewed this PR and run this code\n(keep this PR \"draft\" until the answer is YES)\n- AI tools and models used: Cursor\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: galata-snapshots-bot <263663552+galata-snapshots-bot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b63493fa465f5db91deaf07a0937b38068097f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/trees/b63493fa465f5db91deaf07a0937b38068097f95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/git/commits/7f0e690680a763d3c3db5dc0231803b0ba0e1e12","verification":{"payload":"tree b63493fa465f5db91deaf07a0937b38068097f95\nparent f6f8beec986d5b20e29bab8825a62111515025c2\nauthor Isabel Paredes <isabel.paredes@quantstack.net> 1785833911 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785833911 +0100\n\nImprove keyboard navigation in settings editor > keyboard shortcuts (#19159)\n\n<!--\nThanks for contributing to JupyterLab!\nPlease fill out the following items to submit a pull request.\nSee the contributing guidelines for more information:\nhttps://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\n-->\n\n## References\n\n<!-- Note issue numbers this pull request addresses (should be at least\none, see contributing guidelines above). -->\n\n<!-- Note any other pull requests that address this issue and how this\npull request is different. -->\n\n- *Partially* fixes #15546\n- This PR does **not** address the sorting buttons in the column titles\nnor the tool for adding shortcuts.\n\n<img width=\"1186\" height=\"123\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fdb329b-bae3-4e57-91fa-ba64462337ef\"\n/>\n\n\n## Code changes\n\n- Make the buttons in the keyboard shortcuts table tabbable so that they\ncan be navigated with a keyboard.\n- ~~Pressing `Esc` in the Shortcuts input box will move the focus ring\nto the submit button.~~\n- 2000ms timer added to capture key strokes. This timer is reset with\nsubsequent keystrokes to give users sufficient time to input chords.\nAfter the 2s have elapsed, the user can press `Esc` to cancel the action\nor `Tab` to navigate to the next element.\n- Remove Cancel and Overwrite button from the conflict row and the\ndisabled Submit button in the Shortcut cell. The Overwrite button now\nreplaces the Submit button. Cancelling the action can still be\naccomplished with a mouse by clicking outside the shortcuts cell or by\nnavigating away with `Tab` when using only the keyboard.\n\n<!-- Describe the code changes and how they address the issue. -->\n\n## User-facing changes\n\n- Improved button styling.\n- There was a mix of text buttons and icon buttons, opted for icon\nbuttons only since they look cleaner and take up less space, with the\nexception of the Overwrite button since there aren''t any icons that\ncould clearly represent this action.\n- There was also a mix of `<a>`, `<button>` and `<jp-button>`, opted for\nnative `<button>`. I tried sticking with `<jp-button>` at first, but the\nfocus ring lands in the internal `.control` element which makes styling\na bit more difficult.\n- Resized used icons to 16x16 px without scaling. Increased stroke width\nof info icon to improve visibility.\n\n<!-- Describe any visual or user interaction changes and how they\naddress the issue. -->\n\n<!-- For visual changes, include before and after screenshots or\nGIF/mp4/other video demo here. -->\n\n| Before          | After             |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Untabbable <img width=\"359\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89567057-7f86-4320-b0ef-1abdcbcfff23\"\n/> | <img width=\"361\" height=\"182\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bbe4ddf-d57d-45c1-b2bd-2f426d20cb12\"\n/> |\n| Untabbable <img width=\"374\" height=\"72\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10deb65f-a40b-4d0d-a899-3d54a05047cd\"\n/> | Highlights entire shortcut <img width=\"332\" height=\"70\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a8dc923-c920-4cec-829e-9396711d63cf\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"220\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0aa8e3db-c33c-4ec8-a3b5-8e61e9971bdc\"\n/> | <img width=\"220\" height=\"127\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/040c64f6-a51e-4959-97ad-9c94f4ff19f5\"\n/> |\n| Untabbable Reset <br> <img width=\"158\" height=\"79\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d64e1f2a-cff7-4d93-ae25-01ae77e772a1\"\n/> | <img width=\"176\" height=\"56\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f7ea66e-9972-4699-b159-6ef17859bfeb\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"269\" height=\"56\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e04ce562-5e9f-455d-8487-2c0449831ef6\"\n/> | <img width=\"295\" height=\"64\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19d60c3b-066c-49b5-8f0c-3ea9333a8742\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"270\" height=\"55\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bd1a9cb-ccb2-451c-8bf6-80e8d684c361\"\n/> | <img width=\"265\" height=\"54\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bed42003-6887-4d0c-b2d5-13583a7561f9\"\n/> |\n| <img width=\"814\" height=\"122\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2836fc3e-9a05-4a6d-ad25-9511221095ca\"\n/> | <img width=\"813\" height=\"119\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0eb62f71-42cd-485e-99e8-b87e8e4e841a\"\n/> |\n\n<img width=\"1120\" height=\"952\" alt=\"keybindings\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/937f58e4-22c5-4ba7-87cd-9af7ddccf350\"\n/>\n\n\n<img width=\"1120\"