alIdentName is the local ident hash\n(localIdentHashSalt + output.uniqueName + relative resource path + local\nname), not the compilation hash. Replace the misleading SSR tip and warn\nthat output.uniqueName and context must match between web and node builds.\n\nRefs https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/22332\n\n* docs(css): note that every localIdentName placeholder must resolve identically across builds","tree":{"sha":"fcf7f7ac2c7afb4a66f0be8586b398584ff3f813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/fcf7f7ac2c7afb4a66f0be8586b398584ff3f813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/4d057dcfaf7e6d072fe5b0f9fe2da44d4a76ac85","verification":{"payload":"tree fcf7f7ac2c7afb4a66f0be8586b398584ff3f813\nparent 9b1af71f6f2b0bf772fc06d009147f430395f3bf\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1790634723 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790634723 +0300\n\ndocs(css): clarify that [fullhash] in localIdentName is SSR-safe (#8421)\n\n* docs(css): clarify that [fullhash] in localIdentName is SSR-safe\n\n[fullhash]/[hash] in CSS Modules localIdentName is the local ident hash\n(localIdentHashSalt + output.uniqueName + relative resource path + local\nname), not the compilation hash. Replace the misleading SSR tip and warn\nthat output.uniqueName and context must match between web and node builds.\n\nRefs https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/22332\n\n* docs(css): note that every localIdentName placeholder must resolve identically across builds","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquurjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArhAQAIyoKjU+Igijcvp/EM6VhAno\njAOg8BkF5qaJrONPTv9thSazUsvpfzEydK/pMKGvu5VcCS4r0RtNvhdIvMkqZgIB\neB3xJfY+DZA5PJvcDYGjpwMEx0Tx27XsIZT2WA4QiijJHnVGsSHhlp8jh6m+HZOt\n8xw/JNICfUuBCmm+cErHqfVYcLU0DTjQrjCeZ3FtxP9XB+bjGr5Aeq9LdqT5qsy8\nEHOPtibOH2z7IB4Vg9fF3ZXLrstLbRzDMLkZH1qsUYFr+zklpuT6Fd6v70HHsKbA\nSc+PX1jq5Q8kH9gpT1wNs/pRaFj40Fwqn5gwG/G8