er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bjohansebas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/1691a53511c0962484748d749e5a56d1dfabc3cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:20:49Z","email":"bjohansebas@gmail.com","name":"Sebastian Beltran"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:20:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"blog: webpack 5.111 (#8388)\n\n* blog: webpack 5.110\n\n* blog: cover more merged changes in the 5.111 post\n\nAdds the release items merged after the post was drafted: output.module\nunder futureDefaults and for module library types, ESM star reexports of\nexternals, the smaller chunk-loading runtime and released compilation\ndata, parse-time bailouts surviving the cache, attribute minification by\nvalue, the CSS Modules @value fix, spec namespaces for synthesized\nmodules, and resolve.fileSystem.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: alexander-akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad5883c61267d8d228f37b6bd481b487918c07c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/ad5883c61267d8d228f37b6bd481b487918c07c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/1691a53511c0962484748d749e5a56d1dfabc3cf","verification":{"payload":"tree ad5883c61267d8d228f37b6bd481b487918c07c2\nparent a81cee320aea2cb3e7ea8015cde90528ec4fecf5\nauthor Sebastian Beltran <bjohansebas@gmail.com> 1789366849 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789366849 +0300\n\nblog: webpack 5.111 (#8388)\n\n* blog: webpack 5.110\n\n* blog: cover more merged changes in the 5.111 post\n\nAdds the release items merged after the post was drafted: output.module\nunder futureDefaults and for module library types, ESM star reexports of\nexternals, the smaller chunk-loading runtime and released compilation\ndat