m","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:06:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(contribute): add the codebase overview from #1824 (#8407)\n\nIssue #1824 asked for two things in 2018: a contributing section in the docs\nand a codebase overview. The section has existed for years; the overview was\nnever written, so nothing on the site tells a would-be contributor how\nwebpack''s own source is laid out, and the site never linked to CONTRIBUTING.md\nor TESTING_DOCS.md at all.\n\nAdds a page mapping the five objects a build runs through, the three phases,\nwhat each lib/ directory holds, and how to find the code behind an option, a\nhook, a runtime symbol or an error. It links out to CONTRIBUTING.md and\nTESTING_DOCS.md for process and tests rather than restating them, which is what\nthe issue thread asked for.","tree":{"sha":"ee9db8af2b1f0356205c397c3a97cb5db1c225b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/ee9db8af2b1f0356205c397c3a97cb5db1c225b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/a81cee320aea2cb3e7ea8015cde90528ec4fecf5","verification":{"payload":"tree ee9db8af2b1f0356205c397c3a97cb5db1c225b2\nparent 1707f183f88b4531ddc98d4c697ba487791b36cb\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789330006 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789330006 +0300\n\ndocs(contribute): add the codebase overview from #1824 (#8407)\n\nIssue #1824 asked for two things in 2018: a contributing section in the docs\nand a codebase overview. The section has existed for years; the overview was\nnever written, so nothing on the site tells a would-be contributor how\nwebpack''s own source is laid out, and the site never linked to CONTRIBUTING.md\nor TESTING_DOCS.md at all.\n\nAdds a page mapping the five objects a build runs through, the three phases,\nwhat each lib/ directory holds, and how to find the code behind an option, a\nhook, a runtime symbol or an error. It links out to CONTRIBUTING.md and\nTESTING_DOCS.md for process and tests rather than restating them, which is what\nthe issue thread asked for.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpwJWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyPUQAAT2YaXC3owrhKDsx2+CUg3r\n5KdYi3I5QpwiAWLfuxUBnpye1CbG9u5rj7uThl77HxXvVPZZBZTP19XyuZfZYdrx\nzD9jqPMIb9eAti4LaxrPNFm/Tk5dRf0AFoNxc3+aXA44oaiSFMQ9c9t7gmGHqguL\nBtBQ+Uwc2r5+Xi03Me/r/Z4klfSGocy+ljrIPYIXAXxH2hU97lpRAhu6is5Ywz4/\n0oC3tGOXkPj8Jt7BZ5Kt0QeVQfIJ1xmiOfqjj8Z6bKRVWnwNzp15soUNWHH5xyaH\nLOYF7JTYjakU/5m1wc0MSPyw4qtEUHfpwQER6bRTGF5PZec4m2eItLlhrA8ReDAW\noFhRYCwxK6Dytt+lMYg6/2hsrbdgpFsZv9q35Waqin1usl1+Y1FbNfWAPi0g635k\nzxbXmLSNbM3j2fyDxinWBKgFjrZ9yc9GwmL1lQtQ9U8A8U4sutwNE78gbVgTjSrk\nTNN7TqUWfj4mRmv6c3h8a2SxeBXpt9HLK9hBI9qW7ejZ82z2xtnJM4pHE6QIjnDp\nXxl6WhnBmXvIHEOVqKVuUDNMhT2ohA2+tOTZQxZ0j4POPPWRWEUnmT6YMt+hW46u\n+xmkWM6O0W2bIpLwGF0JWH3AzVdJI1qRhcPH4IiAJmt8UVB8oJJlSYpihYiAkTZ+\nU6Vb8YXknxGe7PjswtRX\n=gUay\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T20:06:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use