24:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: build blog teasers from prose only, and earn the ellipsis (#8406)\n\nThree of the ten blog teasers on /blog/ are the post''s MDX preamble rather than\nits text: the 5.108, 5.109 and 5.110 previews all read ''import banner from\n\"../../assets/blog/webpack-5-110.png\"; <img src={banner} alt=...''. The teaser\nkept every line that was not a heading, so imports, exports and JSX all counted\nas prose.\n\nAlso takes the ellipsis fix from #8201: the ''...'' was appended whether or not\nanything had been cut, which gives blog/index.mdx a four-dot teaser because its\ntext already ends in a period.\n\nTests cover both, plus the empty-body case that used to yield a bare ''...''.","tree":{"sha":"5f1c1dc4603d650a9a3e56a5f6d552a2c264d91f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/5f1c1dc4603d650a9a3e56a5f6d552a2c264d91f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/1707f183f88b4531ddc98d4c697ba487791b36cb","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f1c1dc4603d650a9a3e56a5f6d552a2c264d91f\nparent ab7106e3e673e81668517dabe9338b79073d854e\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789327443 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789327443 +0300\n\nfix: build blog teasers from prose only, and earn the ellipsis (#8406)\n\nThree of the ten blog teasers on /blog/ are the post''s MDX preamble rather than\nits text: the 5.108, 5.109 and 5.110 previews all read ''import banner from\n\"../../assets/blog/webpack-5-110.png\"; <img src={banner} alt=...''. The teaser\nkept every line that was not a heading, so imports, exports and JSX all counted\nas prose.\n\nAlso takes the ellipsis fix from #8201: the ''...'' was appended whether or not\nanything had been cut, which gives blog/index.mdx a four-dot teaser because its\ntext already ends in a period.\n\nTests cover both, plus the empty-body case that used to yield a bare ''...''.","reason":"va