 them at\nuneven depth: ''self'' and ''umd2'' had no section at all, ''module'' pointed at a\n2021 progress thread instead of showing its output, ''modern-module'' had one\nsentence, and ''global'' showed a globalThis assignment that no default target\nemits.\n\nAdds a table summarizing every type in one line, the two missing sections, real\ninput/output for the module types, and the three assignments ''global'' actually\nemits per target. Every example was read off a build rather than written by\nhand.","tree":{"sha":"e2d8e6ff4d1ad57fc178b4dc42e9587c06691e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/e2d8e6ff4d1ad57fc178b4dc42e9587c06691e47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/ab7106e3e673e81668517dabe9338b79073d854e","verification":{"payload":"tree e2d8e6ff4d1ad57fc178b4dc42e9587c06691e47\nparent 0ba16baf78ac26561f84fe04e4dcf0d843ac139e\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789321878 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789321878 +0300\n\ndocs(config): say what each output.library.type generates (#8405)\n\nThe type list named nineteen values and the sections below explained them at\nuneven depth: ''self'' and ''umd2'' had no section at all, ''module'' pointed at a\n2021 progress thread instead of showing its output, ''modern-module'' had one\nsentence, and ''global'' showed a globalThis assignment that no default target\nemits.\n\nAdds a table summarizing every type in one line, the two missing sections, real\ninput/output for the module types, and the three assignments ''global'' actually\nemits per target. Every example was read off a build rather than written by\nhand.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpuKWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALX0QADrxACynFlbg4Da9uoiHLG9c\nXz4F+xfsVM8ai2Cbzfxh1USOmLG5uGGrwsVxYM8DF2Dqw8bRXfSafR697dcKSVGx\nbcOKT69d1hMm9jlipn4o6ZMx590ir7BaVj8lqKumqNf+ht5BuRCzoyL4r09GWLyD\n+SA4mN8iGUgrUQtLUmhD8TA9Grt