_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/8b852707117dc15d6d85e750cfa08147e154c745/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:13:29Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:13:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: build modern and legacy bundles from one source with layers (#8401)\n\nAdds the differential-serving recipe the shimming guide was missing: an entry\nper layer so webpack walks the graph twice and issuerLayer picks the babel\ntargets and polyfills for each copy, plus the array-of-configurations form for\nwhen the modern build has to be emitted as real ECMAScript modules.\n\nAlso documents the polyfill entry array on the entry page, with what importing\nall of core-js/stable actually costs, and links both to the shimming guide.","tree":{"sha":"bdaf2eaa0cc6f319c6106126d2ff6ef6ed645318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/bdaf2eaa0cc6f319c6106126d2ff6ef6ed645318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/8b852707117dc15d6d85e750cfa08147e154c745","verification":{"payload":"tree bdaf2eaa0cc6f319c6106126d2ff6ef6ed645318\nparent 3b1dc1ac1f5e01b029bba8a817742b08e8227064\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789316009 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789316009 +0300\n\ndocs: build modern and legacy bundles from one source with layers (#8401)\n\nAdds the differential-serving recipe the shimming guide was missing: an entry\nper layer so webpack walks the graph twice and issuerLayer picks the babel\ntargets and polyfills for each copy, plus the array-of-configurations form for\nwhen the modern build has to be emitted as real ECMAScript modules.\n\nAlso documents the polyfill entry array on the entry page, with what importing\nall of core-js/stable actually costs, and links both to the shimming gu