urrentRequest, previousRequest, remainingRequest,\nresourceFragment, getDependencies, getContextDependencies,\ngetMissingDependencies and getLogger, none of which had an entry on the\nLoader Interface page. Also rename the pitch method''s second parameter in the\nexamples to previousRequest, which is the name webpack passes it under.","tree":{"sha":"aefe16ae1be5cbeb8c7851a8815dcd13b4a2ba8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/aefe16ae1be5cbeb8c7851a8815dcd13b4a2ba8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/3b1dc1ac1f5e01b029bba8a817742b08e8227064","verification":{"payload":"tree aefe16ae1be5cbeb8c7851a8815dcd13b4a2ba8b\nparent d689f00b161c36692727c861fb553e648ea09506\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789315935 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789315935 +0300\n\ndocs(api): document the loader context request accessors and dependency getters (#8400)\n\nThe loader context exposes currentRequest, previousRequest, remainingRequest,\nresourceFragment, getDependencies, getContextDependencies,\ngetMissingDependencies and getLogger, none of which had an entry on the\nLoader Interface page. Also rename the pitch method''s second parameter in the\nexamples to previousRequest, which is the name webpack passes it under.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpstfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiBAQAGOHmYWp76gRcQLrrbBJGhog\ni2SoKHQwgdR3WIAJiTw2AIoxAShI607YQu9dhLQkXzGtk1djozyA8bM01OCCLARl\nFl3orl8/jMA8iOhaUXd68c7WfU9UuaA132xZ/xiBwL6iWBddZvI6+1LPHVzSUJYr\nH43l70bW6zNgj2fJG/ll4LzsEFb8eiSveaQaafKVZ4uiAg2nCzmEDxiZ58uzZN3e\nuIacPUj0gCyy7cEeLSRivcKPMYFM/yXSLZgXfZGwJSOrX6YS5/52NCvCPGIkzAoS\nZCsP4MQcXjuSis5b4e2qZWRLpYg7Nw4qJ1+7HxkWGq2b2ChvOqEngO9RTjqIb0A1\nQZU+AKkRdE+MdEQCNOQqVTukLSeHbD+wC0hUEVgVIZc//rYLZDeDTqQQ46Kyo2yG\nrgtS/pypnEgHyPQCg8aNnJ9YVwEs6aopFZOYXCpjo7qJYQJwFFomuz5SeREzEYvF\nOLafnqlz1mQPNEYCiRkf965CdAt3pDrL2INBG3Ri4g7mElahljS+1lzqf4C5g