","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/fe472d1d4120b1054310b8396518eeed9dcdfcd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:41:13Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:41:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(api): document addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule (#8398)\n\n* docs(api): document addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule\n\nThe runtime requirement hooks documented in #8397 reach for both methods,\nbut neither had an entry anywhere on the site, so the examples pointed at\nAPI a reader could not look up.\n\n* docs(api): link the runtime requirement hooks to the methods they call\n\nThe hooks page named addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule as plain\ntext because neither had an entry to point at; this PR adds them, so the\nmentions become links.","tree":{"sha":"1c487db98da142c11650b8bc490504483da6b36e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/1c487db98da142c11650b8bc490504483da6b36e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/fe472d1d4120b1054310b8396518eeed9dcdfcd5","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c487db98da142c11650b8bc490504483da6b36e\nparent df943cb4be8d535e0309184b0643ae420aa0083a\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789310473 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789310473 +0300\n\ndocs(api): document addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule (#8398)\n\n* docs(api): document addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule\n\nThe runtime requirement hooks documented in #8397 reach for both methods,\nbut neither had an entry anywhere on the site, so the examples pointed at\nAPI a reader could not look up.\n\n* docs(api): link the runtime requirement hooks to the methods they call\n\nThe hooks page named addRuntimeModule and addLazyRuntimeModule 