nt the runtime requirement hook maps and addEntry (#8397)\n\nComparing the hooks Compilation.js defines against the page left four with\nno entry: runtimeRequirementInModule, runtimeRequirementInChunk,\nruntimeRequirementInTree and addEntry. The three HookMaps are how a plugin\nattaches a runtime module, and additionalTreeRuntimeRequirements — the hook\nreached for alongside them — was already documented, so the page showed one\nhalf of a pair.","tree":{"sha":"65f6523c1b1c1f2c29b9843ce93e61153ea2ed37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/65f6523c1b1c1f2c29b9843ce93e61153ea2ed37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/df943cb4be8d535e0309184b0643ae420aa0083a","verification":{"payload":"tree 65f6523c1b1c1f2c29b9843ce93e61153ea2ed37\nparent e47e2339588f2d2a24b58f3ef67d8a78112b014d\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789308514 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789308514 +0300\n\ndocs(api): document the runtime requirement hook maps and addEntry (#8397)\n\nComparing the hooks Compilation.js defines against the page left four with\nno entry: runtimeRequirementInModule, runtimeRequirementInChunk,\nruntimeRequirementInTree and addEntry. The three HookMaps are how a plugin\nattaches a runtime module, and additionalTreeRuntimeRequirements — the hook\nreached for alongside them — was already documented, so the page showed one\nhalf of a pair.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpq5iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAghIQAJ+R/9AdYgDLOv5v/FmEbkN0\nIrWONDWeBgSYGvWIXHG3Y+Us5EfJzoxcUhPTssnh2HHVYYuWC8zW0PhRWjV1e9PB\nhRmM5t6AXoGhHxVmBWQDvqP2KBSH/2zy6rgGgAiM8ZRuj5E1yH5I8TBfyWdiQou0\nWJyaqL/gCuzNre1LRtQomfAEa/38NNVjcUQDILK4TtNQpNxFSc5gtavR5wAPwGS0\nkNmHioFwT+EnfIo0rpfQeNaBU6wcAPkdNmct67r9JbPzL2MdBJQ47XqMB+/d1bwb\nmlt9YT6Mo+fVgywTCqcOHhM5NkqevHnO5+RbP+Q0b58gV3Nyu4WFQzAEoIxBTkMA\nTz7q7UtjUotR2Biyb6s/gOzC/E3AOGZ0R2JYGBkmjkyg32GhTCDsjD3CT7OdLbyN\nh1K