ed_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/78a0cf35ef564ed7542e7092042e6ce839e8ee66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:45:21Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:45:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: document specNamespaceObject, resolve.resolver and resolve.fileSystem (#8395)\n\nA second pass over schemas/WebpackOptions.json, asking whether each option\nis documented rather than merely mentioned, left three real gaps once the\nfalse positives were checked by hand.\n\nmodule.parser.javascript.specNamespaceObject is new in 5.111.0 and was\nundocumented. resolve.resolver and resolve.fileSystem are the last two\nResolveOptions with no entry; webpack overwrites the latter with the\ncompiler''s input filesystem, so the section says so rather than implying\nit is configurable.","tree":{"sha":"b42d95a09f5a697fc31fe53d649c703eb5ae9a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/b42d95a09f5a697fc31fe53d649c703eb5ae9a4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/78a0cf35ef564ed7542e7092042e6ce839e8ee66","verification":{"payload":"tree b42d95a09f5a697fc31fe53d649c703eb5ae9a4b\nparent 8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789307121 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789307121 +0300\n\ndocs: document specNamespaceObject, resolve.resolver and resolve.fileSystem (#8395)\n\nA second pass over schemas/WebpackOptions.json, asking whether each option\nis documented rather than merely mentioned, left three real gaps once the\nfalse positives were checked by hand.\n\nmodule.parser.javascript.specNamespaceObject is new in 5.111.0 and was\nundocumented. resolve.resolver and resolve.fileSystem are the last two\nResolveOptions with no entry; webpack overwrites the latter with the\ncompiler''s input filesystem, so the section says so rather than implying\nit is configurable.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpqjxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAItYQACsVXxWsdIc68g3GJwP9BmM3\nUiafwJU2gZ1ApEaHbbC5zTuW9vq67AIow8RSw8CCmMEDXUHZV6OhDC5WEeIyrH16\nVr+aIS0ANgzZW1T2qOZeSYxpmr0Fda/ejPB8VcE/ddfCBs0ALDmRs6nyb/Qe/vDt\nGkcPcsmJMSi5tHBoBCzyzllmiBvmI0WTcBcm5wrOfo9YbifulDYBxJKUPp8ug8nG\noExua7LXK4ycKmxcQwuZ1ba8IEWxXI7ELW9EWsEjpM3E3tUE/Cs4nIqXC37omC2X\n2UyPmqC3TIvqaasInG7ahUAGDxtmdN0jivnrwB23zVqR8q1wCMCH+TNViPwVnNSO\nNqUZDsavvfN7mDkFL7KXjypC71f0wrLLXK19bOf4wcEpo67RcEl4w7zwG4+49RDH\neLREvyPcYiQmuL8J49t3n+lT7RWTisCskR58cH4tM16s/PKLfvuRjuPTHa56HOeE\nTxFarmC1f7gWO1FLrFKRg9D/HtdmmuhIXA7yVS+aTAh18nvo8VJ2FrVkfJ1Bd0S9\nHiL/UAyj57G7FetgGIF5FChkWCdZYretscOBpPdl2Kty+UZ+iPWjn0564fnvNsiK\nJAkX+YiduvbyR6IWLL9osnsEbeCCJ0hE6lI98Dhgiho/ORZfwI+n2CIEubue7eXw\nmVzOydV4wADCuEMICHQE\n=XUZI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T13:45:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack.js.org/commit/78a0cf35ef564ed7542e7092042e6ce839e8ee66","node_id":"C_kwDOA7BOndoAKDc4YTBjZjM1ZWY1NjRlZDc1NDJlNzA5MjA0MmU2Y2U4MzllOGVlNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack.js.org/commit/8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e","sha":"8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e"}],"sha":"78a0cf35ef564ed7542e7092042e6ce839e8ee66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/78a0cf35ef564ed7542e7092042e6ce839e8ee66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4567934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexander-akait","id":4567934,"login":"alexander-akait","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Njc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:01:20Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T12:01:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(module): document the rest of module.parser.javascript (#8394)\n\nAn audit of schemas/WebpackOptions.json against the configuration pages found\n26 of the 49 JavascriptParserOptions had no documentation, and that the\nModule Contexts section taught the deprecated spelling of twelve of them.\n\nModule Contexts now shows the options where they actually live, under\nmodule.parser.javascript, and says that setting them on module directly is\ndeprecated and where each moved.\n\nAdds typescript, deferImport and sourceImport, which default from the\nmatching experiments, and a table for the syntax toggles. The table states\neach default rather than implying one: requireJs and system are off until\nset to true, and requireInclude warns that it is deprecated unless set\nexplicitly - read from AMDPlugin, CommonJsPlugin, SystemPlugin,\nRequireJsStuffPlugin, RequireIncludePlugin and defaults.js.","tree":{"sha":"94def275923c7fb21d8765595df0bce04d63abfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/94def275923c7fb21d8765595df0bce04d63abfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/8b6d420ad7a99916be90537af15bf096b6f2d25e","verification":{"payload":"tree 94def275923c7fb21d8765595df0bce04d63abfc\nparent 32690b92897ba8154dd6c60fb212148e439e7b39\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789300880 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789300880 +0300\n\ndocs(module): document the rest of module.parser.javascript (#8394)\n\nAn audit of schemas/WebpackOptions.json against the configuration pages found\n26 of the 49 JavascriptParserOptions had no documentation, and that the\nModule Contexts section taught the deprecated spelling of twelve of them.\n\nModule Contexts now shows the options where they actually live, under\nmodule.parser.javascript, and says that setting them on module directly is\ndeprecated and where each moved.\n\nAdds typescript, deferImport and sourceImport, which default from the\nmatching experiments, and a table for the syntax toggles. The table states\neach default rather than implying one: requireJs and system are off until\nset to true, and requireInclude warns that it is deprecated unless set\nexplicitly - read from AMDPlugin, CommonJsPlugin, SystemPlugin,\nRequireJsStuffPlugin, RequireIncludePlugin and defaults.js.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqppCQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi4AQADC7VIlwcHqLl6H/cfy+3XMd\nzlImbiZSlkcHsvL2cqvwIsYH94b76IxJyciHUMPHiDvwdbr+6EwZgFe9zbHC9GJF\njMwS2+eDv61H4Bd6a5HbGUyn9LFLJf+ACENz772wdK5qsnT18yhKlMTWkxBoGRJ1\nei23hiFkzyrZIC2t+BSHCe5Hzw3+iTypONFTXsO2QuUpVC9OrtfeNU2P3d5Yv1oP\nsZAuLn2pPlaNUNFyjWwmCHUkmPemOr32PScp2w8L17OVktSfWPJ65Ir11vmkzTQS\ndzNTdfTtuj8we6ICGq5kc/nDx8KaWZLt/pqflGFFPDWKUHdJ2i7c0ENZwKZsQKuX\nV/ViorzZZ1lwyfCBBowKyf3lgKNKCkYp0E6DrcEpPBJZzJCTzSHDudhp2DWEvbq1\nIGiSr/XdwudUkMjB5Ec5pXQq+RiEMOcGeXm8JVzItc5D4y1PI6m7AJ0c9Koj0Qca\nraPGRHQQGYM+jnJ8nV+BvxbP6kC6jS8a05IJoUx9Ls80q8Um6s88OJvuZTgBBJoz\nudwzZaag2Z1x9rkAX+y+09qFK/yIEN+WnSSLhxTMa+uQMskvc7ZrsBzrwKqRFnin\nABkZRImviZRK6N3dc9qneAxJZG2ma7lYkMDzovttgdHQi/jLLyA+dnle9dJMQpLI\nqROyfJpm/Qe8g8sVnm7z\n=+o6b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T12:01:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu