false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexander-akait","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/32690b92897ba8154dd6c60fb212148e439e7b39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T11:03:18Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T11:03:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add a build lifecycle overview to Under The Hood (#8393)\n\nCloses #2223. The page described what a build is made of - modules, chunks,\nassets - but never the order they are produced in, which is what plugin\nauthors and config readers were asking for.\n\nAdds the phase pipeline from compiler creation through run, compile, make,\nseal, emit and done, with the hooks that mark each phase, plus a short note\non what make and seal actually do and a table pointing common tasks at the\nhook that serves them. Every hook name and its position is taken from\nCompiler.run/compile and Compilation.seal rather than from memory.\n\nLinks it from the plugins concept page, where a plugin author lands first.","tree":{"sha":"3cbf799824318a48b9efec5b55e99bd3c139663b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/3cbf799824318a48b9efec5b55e99bd3c139663b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/32690b92897ba8154dd6c60fb212148e439e7b39","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cbf799824318a48b9efec5b55e99bd3c139663b\nparent cb6ea6724d1896adb9f6db3c289c465f0db2498c\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789297398 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789297398 +0300\n\ndocs: add a build lifecycle overview to Under The Hood (#8393)\n\nCloses #2223. The page described what a build is made of - modules, chunks,\nassets - but never the order they are produced in, which is what plugin\nauthors and config readers were asking for.\n\nAdds the phase pipeline from compiler creation through run, compile, make,\nseal, emit and done, with the hooks that mark each phase, plus a short note\non what make and seal actually do and a table pointing common tasks at the\nhook that serves them. Every hook name and its position is taken from\nCompiler.run/compile and Compilation.seal rather than from memory.\n\nLinks it from the plugins concept page, where a plugin author lands first.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpoL2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVYMQAH+11WR1x8a8W8dvPsa4ls3v\nqBFcHohUeVDpScB5Wri5YFjKHU4FyCdaCFpgph5Z7eFBMNAzPuRMlt6NnPgbgkET\nHXEn4PrLH8SM8l3rRpjlQ4Dc7MG2D1pr444UIRkfg/mzgJWYOBq+uhW3vec+15Ld\nXwIV14nT7xEbchxvm2fSOB6JNfhgb4MlFqiVSpNYUMx7DYXkydGtFE+1IzTJxbJP\nF/ougtqQQ80ykjavG/eykrumIsdjB064KRjv8t/m47425GyLSiLv0929C0ROnubQ\nicJpXb7m5t3KtTOqBxygO0DvwxCvRNbgEqs0HT6oPRhKKaatDyzIMJDOL6ZdSYP5\nO3TYg/3a0sfAAzEo08XtHI5KeIxU+PSy14gHRYApzTymOJGicI8jvUzDfhFFthXy\nJ8aoyRTskvnd/lL0Q+t2yya8O1wUHfL1NG4cr9IdAYdWfCsV0+vrrc+14YmTulio\nI/V8qnOxZJtS0EGSCV+2Lbe0r9liTzctn3Ilb0UW7mqviiQIwyHvP/fPl+UbCrJb\nLqoXxYKKhkLoTOaGSW8hUlQs/C89TQJpHC/vc1BIJDoqgmZ82Cp71kGqPEpPbtPg\nZDrffkeWtiS3B7GQkZU2JIwLCAhCSrzhBiKsAuLLMI5T/eAcuyScn/CwTCs5YRH3\nd5yG4bNmOlk5EB733HC0\n=/IGn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T11:03:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5