lesheet and search.cy.js rely on are unchanged too: the\ninput id is still built as docsearch-input by autocomplete-core''s\ngetAutocompleteElementId, and all six .DocSearch-* hooks the site overrides\nare still in @docsearch/css.\n\nThe entry payload shrinks: vendor.js 766422 -> 560608 raw and 208944 ->\n170637 gzip, against +18012 raw / +2495 gzip of DocSearch stylesheet, for\n301857 -> 263594 gzip over the entrypoint''s js and css.","tree":{"sha":"e9236fef22e0ad2bb91a87f06879c3ce5ff43e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/e9236fef22e0ad2bb91a87f06879c3ce5ff43e3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/41d557bbc3140016fda74105adf97c64a57c757a","verification":{"payload":"tree e9236fef22e0ad2bb91a87f06879c3ce5ff43e3d\nparent 2630f1b0ac2d169b84dd19a93777d3420c6e3bc8\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789236078 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789236078 +0300\n\nchore(deps): update @docsearch/react to 5 (#8389)\n\nv5 replaces the indexName prop with an indices array; every other prop the\nNavigation component passes survives unchanged. The button, modal and input\nselectors the stylesheet and search.cy.js rely on are unchanged too: the\ninput id is still built as docsearch-input by autocomplete-core''s\ngetAutocompleteElementId, and all six .DocSearch-* hooks the site overrides\nare still in @docsearch/css.\n\nThe entry payload shrinks: vendor.js 766422 -> 560608 raw and 208944 ->\n170637 gzip, against +18012 raw / +2495 gzip of DocSearch stylesheet, for\n301857 -> 263594 gzip over the entrypoint''s js and css.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpZNvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmVgQAByHrklKRmeJmlBOG53JbxW0\nkTcIp0pMg7PbDEg21/y/ZrnAyckBS4md+t+gJ3UdyEq0oZ/Yap0dc/MOCOI9Qvy5\nEpSAJA8mAiIoclJ0hd/prBs23Kob3mow9mpCZCzL2+JrQv6W9xf+RqDQ8i0aJ7D4\nKy1ZQ3ApTRVsRCp7d4QAAJXJ4CJP4f9XwRxQ1o7ZDgeKX89uzWhayyNj7geRqnjj\nH0YrMHfQDHZOnIF