ents.","tree":{"sha":"9e343b1057fa3aa0ea6950c5fb129d386bb8abdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/9e343b1057fa3aa0ea6950c5fb129d386bb8abdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/a8190322ef54b848748be9c782eec874b0c12dba","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e343b1057fa3aa0ea6950c5fb129d386bb8abdd\nparent abc9db113953fed4cc1df2ded00575104b3332a5\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789114090 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789114090 +0300\n\ndocs: document the API surface that had no docs at all (#8368)\n\nAn audit of webpack''s schemas, hook definitions, APIPlugin and loader\ncontext against every heading on the site found options, hooks and module\nvariables that are reachable but undocumented. Adds the missing Compiler,\nCompilation and JavascriptParser hooks, optimization.minimizeOptions, five\nRule conditions, four javascript parser options, six module variables,\nthis.addBuildDependency, the CacheFacade and the module/chunk graph APIs\nwith their deprecation replacements.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo7bqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1S4QAIc3UqVR3utuNNu+4gbNaI/R\nSc1di3oVbuwtg5A625VfquBLKHEaFzX8fNtlFnR4fmLVUPi4UOqE53pc1q8r4Jcd\nO8OCUh63Hfuzp+8Ipsr5yvsMUikJbP4YFUhsMfhtoBw45eseyJiYy266Pqa7dykW\n4me75nnH/h15NUYbOhmJwCpV74yD8MqS+V7nX4J+4QdgGPvlDJZC1lp/LbbN/DrC\nQB7ZfmyU7U3mEf4O/fO6lWjAPy/etvpG1cHlWn+GvGHTIijTeAARfREka665VOWa\nE69lznZunldrOBt5gutG+QQUB7LrPQhRA5r1rkyGdPdQljflpe8fgmyvACv9KpsR\nVZPKAZFbVYTJSyMSsevhkiTkULsxUp9PDe8UcJXQtwuQwF27gGwE6kTfpCdxubNU\nDqUcdlMgnEbCq47OS6apz+S8wirmuX7P7fnnqQociUY2EyMk/5/DgN46DN3Z8njY\nnZCGTb3umI0Xrsbv02lv1O835jxSxZGEgTwoCWx/giHb94J0pTkOD47ybIQEhH8M\nCASi6tNM/+4krJnQ/6YfKj8YMKHN1k4N25PSM+6+xkKJs/07ZN9GHxeWxyyGiRLZ\ngu637mMR33K9QA7pdxR0K5aU6HZ+jSMSM89hBhiBjx/taldPWndrdOzgQEkZNOWy\nOWEXFY2T7wHtPZf1Z+JW\n=af0q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11