m/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/commits/136a48e74dfedad8c9da7a2ee6a2e2929aa5179d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:56:31Z","email":"4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexander Akait"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T06:56:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: answer long-standing questions about inaccurate or missing reference docs (#8367)\n\n* docs(configuration): explain chunk loading global, snapshot paths and mode defaults\n\nAnswer the questions the open documentation issues ask: what\noutput.chunkLoadingGlobal is and when to set it, which info properties a\ndevtoolModuleFilenameTemplate function receives, how snapshot.managedPaths\ndiffers from immutablePaths, which module type reads Rule.parser.parse,\nwhich defaults each mode picks, what the deterministic id plugins accept\nand what resolve starts from.\n\n* docs(api): document dynamic import expressions, eager mode and rootContext\n\nA fully dynamic import() builds an empty context rather than being\nimpossible, webpackChunkName does nothing in eager mode, and\nthis.rootContext was described by its history instead of its meaning.\n\n* docs(plugins): correct eval source map filters and expand federation sharing\n\nEvalSourceMapDevToolPlugin matches modules, not assets, and emits no map\nfiles. Also define initial and async chunks for splitChunks.chunks, and\nsay what shareKey, shareScope and a unique name are for.\n\n* docs(plugins): explain what PrefetchPlugin does and what it is not\n\nIt shortens the build''s critical path and is unrelated to the browser\nresource hint people reach for it expecting.","tree":{"sha":"f9a287421840d81b95c0fb9e1051bd5e35623e7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/trees/f9a287421840d81b95c0fb9e1051bd5e35623e7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack.js.org/git/commits/136a48e74dfedad8c9da7a2ee6a2e2929aa5179d","verification":{"payload":"tree f9a287421840d81b95c0fb9e1051bd5e35623e7a\nparent 84e66687a238722c38bca776c0819b836dfcbf8f\nauthor Alexander Akait <4567934+alexander-akait@users.noreply.github.com> 1789109791 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789109791 +0300\n\ndocs: answer long-standing questions about inaccurate or missing reference docs (#8367)\n\n* docs(configuration): explain chunk loading global, snapshot paths and mode defaults\n\nAnswer the questions the open documentation issues ask: what\noutput.chunkLoadingGlobal is and when to set it, which info properties a\ndevtoolModuleFilenameTemplate function receives, how snapshot.managedPaths\ndiffers from immutablePaths, which module type reads Rule.parser.parse,\nwhich defaults each mode picks, what the deterministic id plugins accept\nand what resolve starts from.\n\n* docs(api): document dynamic import expressions, eager mode and rootContext\n\nA fully dynamic import() builds an empty context rather than being\nimpossible, webpackChunkName does nothing in eager mode, and\nthis.rootContext was described by its history instead of its meaning.\n\n* docs(plugins): correct eval source map filters and expand federation sharing\n\nEvalSourceMapDevToolPlugin matches modules, not assets, and emits no map\nfiles. Also define initial and async chunks for splitChunks.chunks, and\nsay what shareKey, shareScope and a unique name are for.\n\n* docs(plugins): explain what PrefetchPlugin does and what it is not\n\nIt shortens the build''s critical path and is unrelated to the browser\nresource hint people reach for it expecting.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo6YfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHKEQACfAehSCIT0fmUn8I44w3D98\nrbWfNOfr05XuVn7+3LHkr3anQERcMn10o+x28WSOlG4n6eF6T8hrdnOyftICGxPY\nPJjzRXn2PYqRs6tnCH2EmJdRc1CWMn6CKeukib6qdG7Q2beyrIamjYBeFSRlyIIt\nQItlmbcn5PxT9idZtS0b3ZE7GcqsNLTWrN+WRARYW9sxl7oSNl5UyNQJlHY3cG+O\nqCiPLxEWUqoS713T8IRoLqDitvtCOTI24oU0doBfi5UDSnxHXbCu+5LO+OWH3J8l\nWA2xjmZgdmPfwA0eyKKIV0HERArbhin0rs9inTaUl