i.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.lgtv/commits/cec347d3c3b1fecd61e1c030c3475bdc9efd4797/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:21:36Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:24:04Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"fix: complete and clean up the admin translations\n\nAll of this comes out of admin/i18n and admin/jsonConfig.json:\n\n- The \"help\" attributes of timeout and reconnect carry the literal text\n  \"Min. 5000ms\", and jsonConfig runs with \"i18n\": true, so it is looked up as\n  a key. It existed in none of the eleven files, so the dialog showed the raw\n  string (repository checker W5612). It is a key now, translated everywhere.\n- Six labels - ip, mac, power, timeout, reconnect, healthInterval - and\n  help_tip were still the English sentences in es, fr, it, nl and pt (W5606).\n  All translated. The German help_tip had a stray <br /> in the middle of a\n  sentence that no other language has.\n- Five keys left over from the adapter template (Auto, Manual, My select,\n  \"on save adapter restarts...\", \"template adapter settings\") were carried in\n  all eleven files while jsonConfig references none of them. Removed - that is\n  where most of the deleted lines in this diff come from, five keys times\n  eleven files.\n\nAlso corrects \"IP adress\"/\"MAC adress\" in the English source strings.\n\nen.json and jsonConfig.json now match exactly: no key the dialog asks for is\nmissing, and no key is left unused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 