13:16:30Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"fix: accept pointer movements with a zero on one axis\n\nstates.drag and states.scroll gated the command behind `if (dx && dy)`.\nparseInt(''0'') is 0 and therefore falsy, so every movement along a single axis\nwas dropped without a log line - including \"0,5\", plain vertical scrolling,\nwhich is the most common case of all. Only diagonal movements got through.\n\nThe check now tests for a finite number instead, which also covers the NaN\ncase the truthiness check happened to catch on the way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94a91ed0527a0479430521d8277df5344723f237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.lgtv/git/trees/94a91ed0527a0479430521d8277df5344723f237"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.lgtv/git/commits/5cb23039db7d37e5a53cae6008f66e8bd47ec4f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_typ