ITECTURE OVERHAUL:\n- Migrated from legacy structure to Clean Architecture\n- Implemented Domain-Driven Design with proper layer separation\n- Added Dependency Injection via React Context API\n\n📦 DOMAIN LAYER:\n- Created User and Repository entities with business rules\n- Implemented UserRepositoryInterface with error handling\n- Added validation, formatting, and computed properties\n\n🔧 APPLICATION LAYER:\n- Developed GetUserUseCase and GetUserRepositoriesUseCase\n- Implemented comprehensive caching and analytics logic\n- Added advanced error handling and logging\n\n🔌 INFRASTRUCTURE LAYER:\n- Built robust HttpClient with retry logic and interceptors\n- Created GitHubUserRepository implementing domain interface\n- Added in-memory cache with TTL support\n\n🎨 PRESENTATION LAYER:\n- Developed reusable components following React 19 best practices\n- Created custom useUser hook encapsulating business logic\n- Implemented comprehensive error boundaries and loading states\n\n✨ NEW FEATURES:\n- Real-time analytics with language distribution and activity metrics\n- Advanced repository filtering and sorting capabilities\n- Theme switching with localStorage persistence\n- Contextual notifications system\n- Health check and debug information\n\n🚀 PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENTS:\n- Automatic code splitting and bundle optimization\n- Intelligent caching with cache invalidation\n- Memoized calculations and debounced inputs\n- Optimized webpack configuration for React 19\n\n📱 UI/UX ENHANCEMENTS:\n- Modern responsive design with Bootstrap 5\n- Enhanced search with history and suggestions\n- Professional card layouts for repositories\n- Real-time status indicators (cache, online/offline)\n- Comprehensive empty and error states\n\n🧪 ENGINEERING EXCELLENCE:\n- TypeScript-ready with proper JSDoc documentation\n- Comprehensive error handling with domain-specific errors\n- Modular component architecture for maintainability\n- Following SOLID principles and clean code practices\n\nBuild success