criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/700a4ac304e94f834793c0dc49479c17b58b81ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:25:09Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:25:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-1082 supply isGuardable (#1744)\n\nSupply `isGuardable(route)`, a function that returns `true` if the given\nroute may be protected by a navigation-guard to allow the user the\nopportunity to avoid navigating away from work-in-progress such as a\ndirty form or ongoing upload, or `false` if the navigation is\nobligatory, such as redirecting to `/logout` upon session termination.\n\nRefs STCOR-1082","tree":{"sha":"9f64891166c832eea9c324f6c3bbae7185c23747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/9f64891166c832eea9c324f6c3bbae7185c23747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/700a4ac304e94f834793c0dc49479c17b58b81ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f64891166c832eea9c324f6c3bbae7185c23747\nparent bac7b7578fd3f86a2c80ea02330c7a9b154a614e\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1782764709 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782764709 -0400\n\nSTCOR-1082 supply isGuardable (#1744)\n\nSupply `isGuardable(route)`, a function that returns `true` if the given\nroute may be protected by a navigation-guard to allow the user the\nopportunity to avoid navigating away from work-in-progress such as a\ndirty form or ongoing upload, or `false` if the navigation is\nobligatory, such as redirecting to `/logout` upon session termination.\n\nRefs STCOR-1082","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQtSlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU1IQAB1BU0AXeYiPEt4SQm3lLZx4\nW0561QyeopgbGWfJYH9yxb382Ln+TRYV/e265za7hplokLS5Ez9uXIenbPjE8uNf\nDdIig7xpXO8bbz4afPt29vTTMj0+xoxridAy