,"name":"John Coburn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T19:11:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-1054 - Add an additional exception case for rotation  (#1713)\n\n## [STCOR-1054](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1054)\n\nThis PR adds a new `shouldRotate` case with /users-keycloak/ response of\n404.\nThe non-typical (subj?) response from this module - and lack of our\nnecessary handling (refresh!!) - can end up being the [Bubba\nWallace](https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/04/26/cup-series-big-one-strikes-talladega-spring-bubba-wallace-involved/)\n- of a slew of potential abrupt logout cases. This can occur any time a\npage is refreshed (any action causing refresh) or when a new tab is\nopened.\n\nThe placement of the logic here is definitely up for discussion, but the\ncase itself is fairly straightforward - and a similar patch could likely\nbe applied to *ahem - that OTHER rtr implementation...","tree":{"sha":"34f81c74d5708ad218f066d08db0e1abc119f55c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/34f81c74d5708ad218f066d08db0e1abc119f55c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/571e0c9c0ec0c1640284826a58f2982d31d2f3bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 34f81c74d5708ad218f066d08db0e1abc119f55c\nparent 8e5d07b5669114f3e8cf65bae00a119481fabfed\nauthor John Coburn <jcoburn@ebsco.com> 1777403484 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777403484 -0500\n\nSTCOR-1054 - Add an additional exception case for rotation  (#1713)\n\n## [STCOR-1054](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1054)\n\nThis PR adds a new `shouldRotate` case with /users-keycloak/ response of\n404.\nThe non-typical (subj?) response from this module - and lack of our\nnecessary handling (refresh!!) - can end up being the [Bubba\nWallace](https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/04/26/cup-series-big-one-strikes-talladega-spring-bubba-wallace-involved/)\n- of a slew of potential abrupt logout cases. This can occur any time a\npage is refreshed (any action causing refresh) or when a new tab is\nopened.\n\nThe placement of the logic here is definitely up for discussion, but the\ncase itself is fairly straightforward - and a similar patch could likely\nbe applied to *ahem - that OTHER rtr implementation...","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8QZcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu70QAIQzusTdRVUPDn2vOvNFpPE8\njB40OOdCIgTEBpRszlFPOC5IZS/MyyDXqD5W6X169NhPWUMRhCqZtjoiUiSs3mp5\nabu1ultslQdT7RVTpBu5o4GPijJO4bbVrrmzKPD9qpoP3+SvUArFBvmrW2IjvCHq\nWC/SjIibHiVyaJSBXGbVL6aOdoRAzVVTLY6Lq9T5bvw6PdL1bDZMkwyrcZtsRVrX\nbv+VJGlFGiDlspSMVqVsCH1dQlCp4fkI5e+yk3aacGbb9wHHxsanLBsrZXc9c7aE\nUVGPCQSlL5HDC5VSdptUVYaAyL/e+Vqt/zgqCmidpxET6xE7duMGvLFfkBMeun/T\n93N0rJa6dlK8Z0E/o6ZEEfYznD3wtoyuiKgjkAaa03a/q3qGSFa6Sc8CpMvpjw+C\nQtQL1tSMdiGn0rGstTO4mwOWysYcAYcgNX1AikQHncugcr1E5hErBAh/B8O8a0wO\nakFb2YyP9Lz9r9BiAvxfDYpk2HNndz8fJrYdqQ3tuGJ+mVVAsghmKw4ZxqAiQ/Rm\nPtdTxvYQVy8DZNtXP/fnluM74iZSALRcGQAFc19ML3hzxMUDvLF5F4GZnFdEErUV\nZ6ZJOK/cT2faRhPXkON1HUqZ+SfvAG8hAOtuhQlM/h/NyVrZk9MdHsEgyaUnvEqc\nJRs3TLAIGzfvuEKq868P\n=8cLu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-28T19:11:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{