ail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-1050 consolidate test logic into test files (#1711)\n\nRemove test-oriented conditionals to tests. The DOM-checking\nconditionals related to `navigator?.locks?.request` should only ever\nhave been present in tests/test-setup because that API has been standard\nin the browser for years. \"👋 jsdom\"? That positively screams \"this is\nfor a test!\" Where was your head in PR #1696, @zburke?\n\nRefs STCOR-1050","tree":{"sha":"af28d19442e57de9251e3f35f6be30fb7bb482c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/af28d19442e57de9251e3f35f6be30fb7bb482c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/8e5d07b5669114f3e8cf65bae00a119481fabfed","verification":{"payload":"tree af28d19442e57de9251e3f35f6be30fb7bb482c0\nparent 1e005ac7292202df6459e8ac4d05fa513c5cd1e7\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1777380780 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777380780 -0400\n\nSTCOR-1050 consolidate test logic into test files (#1711)\n\nRemove test-oriented conditionals to tests. The DOM-checking\nconditionals related to `navigator?.locks?.request` should only ever\nhave been present in tests/test-setup because that API has been standard\nin the browser for years. \"👋 jsdom\"? That positively screams \"this is\nfor a test!\" Where was your head in PR #1696, @zburke?\n\nRefs STCOR-1050","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8K2sCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASLUQADz2fsURuuBs00sBsH0I2Rfp\nCKV/ITsaUSEXMs95vJbe4u+lUvy9Br247ykFk/noQjbG7LH3r58lpwxvnHbjVAxD\ntnEo0EicHvLNIn7rr2abPbIIBBngHyJ+0zLRZAd7BEi4P0zTHC+mjvbpoDzh2wIc\nMATAKNOcnHP+rLu6aUoNdlYqGu5KFIsr6pg4jUI/oPWsf6/cc1s//881rBI4c2r5\nNFXlZwAyXqxw9LPr1iClcnkyeflVnOUaoP7BkmAvEZeIAJYbOFKSi0axYGjGt1Ls\nuMfYyQcucyZnxy+nHoVgreAsOe6pyVn1PofOu43Nw5ai3q1zFNqN6x+SLqvAVs8Y\n+E2d4OU5IkcsgB3CG3EJDZR4nFHBsscY6IXdtnxF8Brzk3+/pdswfQI+PklGQQSE\n2z06i4W3BG+ossLF0HY2ZeozTx5d0AdUpWZna8UpH4a48s1Bh5bqVkcI/RLfIXH5\nNiNs