mail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[STCOR-1039] Read Stripes Hub stripes-config data from localforage (#1695)\n\n- Fulfills\n[STCOR-1039](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1039).\n- Checks if config data is being supplied by `StripesHub` via\n`localforage`. If yes, then override values normally supplied by\n`stripes.config.js`. If no, then use `stripes.config.js`.","tree":{"sha":"0795265bda56509119533d291ee64a9aa95d6d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/0795265bda56509119533d291ee64a9aa95d6d13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/7fab46eebda2c717ca59e48c04a6f50793cec64f","verification":{"payload":"tree 0795265bda56509119533d291ee64a9aa95d6d13\nparent f90518f6e4890aef5ceffe18c996364d2b068f26\nauthor Ryan Berger <rberger@ebsco.com> 1770988646 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770988646 -0500\n\n[STCOR-1039] Read Stripes Hub stripes-config data from localforage (#1695)\n\n- Fulfills\n[STCOR-1039](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1039).\n- Checks if config data is being supplied by `StripesHub` via\n`localforage`. If yes, then override values normally supplied by\n`stripes.config.js`. If no, then use `stripes.config.js`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjyRmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqp8QAB6lNlInf57dluf1O/hOmORk\n49ZIlw0kpw7lQxN5F5WJfOiNNMT7uFT6dTDA4LJku1S6UpDDJsa4vNWJAnFKyt/q\nfL78CRUwlwDL3gm0mqxqLr/RX8sp4dKBCHDsy7pnU7ImFfH/sZvW44ssftfVf0Id\nQmq/AvGYOsBH6QTGPsF1JO3S7/tRTwHyWV2qTfjDliIlZiIvBnQMoM65cZHqySo4\nmavEnjt0iuDbzjPhA/q/0XVPBnHsaRFyoKHPp9uofmgx8FS3Bxzo93pb/ro5hbOP\ngJ8gLjGvXEqJcf3PimEYhNIhMfwUX5cyVrwCXZfMmaCGvzL85ZblJgqeBKrAEcN6\nTHlz/l9S/RX228wt08X7ek6hPeL7xsUZ5rpIS5yGFb+fNzzTkBwvLuU+ldzdorv1\nSMVmy49iJ+gWbQGjAPTrkcMHVIcLn2IpQJl1DgfWp2akV7qlV6ciC4X4ni+mq93p\nciIhj0y4iRJCoNbwqdzIltoaxqK1tR86IuKEZsc9Rl+b4Qi/YAOLle62zOyA2kYV\nvZOOd+siQkZBXjpFIjXs5b1NJtJs1kL+B6bXi1DcM15z3b+1PmIr+keZQd0xux7x\nQ2QKQth7bZD34F