iation/tenant, the set of navigation apps\nchanges, and their widths are recalculated, however, some apps are\nhidden, so the width is recalculated incorrectly. The solution is to\nbriefly display the apps and measure their widths.\n\n## Issues\n[STCOR-1010](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1010)\n\n## Screencasts\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/145f6613-8807-41b3-9a07-1910db4ea2d5","tree":{"sha":"67a4dd065a71a14db1f113cda04ffd65f068731d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/67a4dd065a71a14db1f113cda04ffd65f068731d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/06705fc2358de6325c3465555420af34fe9adba0","verification":{"payload":"tree 67a4dd065a71a14db1f113cda04ffd65f068731d\nparent 39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8\nauthor Dmytro-Melnyshyn <77053927+Dmytro-Melnyshyn@users.noreply.github.com> 1763640015 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763640015 +0200\n\nSTCOR-1010: `<ResizeContainer>` - clear cache and show all items before measuring changed items. (#1676)\n\n## Description\nWhen switching the active affiliation/tenant, the set of navigation apps\nchanges, and their widths are recalculated, however, some apps are\nhidden, so the width is recalculated incorrectly. The solution is to\nbriefly display the apps and measure their widths.\n\n## Issues\n[STCOR-1010](https://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STCOR-1010)\n\n## Screencasts\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/145f6613-8807-41b3-9a07-1910db4ea2d5","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpHwLPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcC8QAF2KCFRZu/aq8ENrOreyWwfh\nWHADKgPE4OgIm1Fh0nPH8+r7gmm71NNv3a+/nbHjQd3RPcNKADLDP4wY0Ib65oXm\nLbY+fm3FPu5HeMXhHBSQq0pkXJVGMSbM+cT0Fdy2Rw6UUizb4qCXhR76RAnsUmgI\nKHgqEZKr4BiBtJtGJm2yWXUdjI8gKOZPA25Z9g9dFescuCN89p+YrQTmYe5k2VlZ\nJ+Mf4/r4JmAgyL6LH1pYWIi+yjLRq9hKE9t701Co5PR9kQYgPWSfWI+Z7i8hnt7a\nBpkn3Ql1eQAJQGTLF1x04GZIal4vqRe75XPaiFyZvubD1gyF8fMXLOMUEYenr/Ei\nLD3sYEkWRknIfxj7gtAaWRDZPdPwgFul+sD/YaiWUlMHvHLn7yBGvf5r6KrAh8v3\nb+0kBTS/QI3puNaG9QzVV//Y2X6n/KlIXBVrgtsZX84l7YvAqkZV7CqyEHGJWQT2\nbKXo1QxCvHnC9TZAM8krgSwKiPB5Oi69y0aa9m+V2/F42GXHfue6QX4PdTszafl3\n97NHt2zzlv89/1ie+k4nDIC163XCreTWJB/j+uddC4JWYTFv9VevRussqydIsKlU\nT1cQdfAdjEkc6hpsyUveVoL99byt/EoMqlDGke21ZF7zecyQ7TjA8kuFivEvOsPn\ni8lMN7Rev39nM4O/sr9X\n=wUkG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-20T12:00:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/06705fc2358de6325c3465555420af34fe9adba0","node_id":"C_kwDOBEhK7NoAKDA2NzA1ZmMyMzU4ZGU2MzI1YzM0NjU1NTU0MjBhZjM0ZmU5YWRiYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8","sha":"39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8"}],"sha":"06705fc2358de6325c3465555420af34fe9adba0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/06705fc2358de6325c3465555420af34fe9adba0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77053927?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Dmytro-Melnyshyn","id":77053927,"login":"Dmytro-Melnyshyn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDUzOTI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dmytro-Melnyshyn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T13:53:52Z","email":"77053927+Dmytro-Melnyshyn@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dmytro-Melnyshyn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T13:53:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-976: Wait for `modules` to load to ensure proper initialization with URL query parameters (follow-up). (#1674)\n\n## Purpose\nURL query parameters (like `filters=active.active`) were not being\nproperly initialized in `resources.query` when the page is reloaded,\ncausing search filters to be lost.\n\n## Root cause\nWhen modules load before `okapiReady` completes, `shouldComponentUpdate`\nreturns false to prevent re-rendering. This blocks `componentDidUpdate`\nfrom running, so `updateQueryResourceStateKey()` is not called, but when\n`okapiReady` becomes true the `prevProps.modules` and `modules` are\nalready the same. Without the query resource state key being set,\n`addReducer` cannot determine which reducer should be initialized with\nURL parameters.\n\n## Approach\nWait for modules to load before rendering the app by checking\n`this.props.modules === modulesInitialState` in the render method. This\nensures that when stripes-connect calls `addReducer` during component\ninitialization, the Root component already knows the current module and\ncan properly initialize the query resource (`resources.query`) with URL\nparams from the page reload.\n\n## Screencasts\nThe bug:\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/979016ad-f0f6-4ec0-8fc7-75a95088a4e9","tree":{"sha":"0383a6bed114b5d9f6a132ccd9b802e41f4b4a10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/0383a6bed114b5d9f6a132ccd9b802e41f4b4a10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 0383a6bed114b5d9f6a132ccd9b802e41f4b4a10\nparent 7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb\nauthor Dmytro-Melnyshyn <77053927+Dmytro-Melnyshyn@users.noreply.github.com> 1763128432 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763128432 +0200\n\nSTCOR-976: Wait for `modules` to load to ensure proper initialization with URL query parameters (follow-up). (#1674)\n\n## Purpose\nURL query parameters (like `filters=active.active`) were not being\nproperly initialized in `resources.query` when the page is reloaded,\ncausing search filters to be lost.\n\n## Root cause\nWhen modules load before `okapiReady` completes, `shouldComponentUpdate`\nreturns false to prevent re-rendering. This blocks `componentDidUpdate`\nfrom running, so `updateQueryResourceStateKey()` is not called, but when\n`okapiReady` becomes true the `prevProps.modules` and `modules` are\nalready the same. Without the query resource state key being set,\n`addReducer` cannot determine which reducer should be initialized with\nURL parameters.\n\n## Approach\nWait for modules to load before rendering the app by checking\n`this.props.modules === modulesInitialState` in the render method. This\nensures that when stripes-connect calls `addReducer` during component\ninitialization, the Root component already knows the current module and\ncan properly initialize the query resource (`resources.query`) with URL\nparams from the page reload.\n\n## Screencasts\nThe bug:\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/979016ad-f0f6-4ec0-8fc7-75a95088a4e9","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpFzRwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvUYQAIF2tg8aLH0pjvHdpZyopFgZ\n1CyAsEl7jbDx7haC59YOmd/ZW6wlq1dt0bEPWPAZvEQm61nlg4tIG4s0F8fbDZIr\nNpRVrw9xisSwUNEkWh2btkZgAtPsPKmlztJ7+/7/EKSoi9AW/Bp6aIshaxbNxP5b\nsVwU3U/vNg2GBnkfjpII53yQVerf/MZGaRxWQdpFzgCMCLMNRyORqKLaHEshitC4\nXajWx0SNJOdpSpSOFB7wlqfhS9WOt0VUITD8B1nfTV7mSugLLMXARcsVHY53pNPv\nCS0zoUjWDwimRIyk5vBnExxSGPMEwkoIXTcT7KB31eww+OlMfA0Mz75ELKk3pDmk\nZpXH5NJH8r6Ninvq6UjgiNTY5PTe4ZpOOP8nTmhOtwG5P25D3ULsPpBaqBIzhyft\nM9zgcTaO8JrXdRvGbx6q2NCGQNI8QFzq+GrhZhBD7kHgDjIsgCnweu3fHY6ZhpLW\nGBV3Y8NXS8rTkeMCG7I5ymjl69SvI/OfIJ4vMPlYJ1n3Cx6AKWETqDDuK1DnIS0p\nGIc8Q97LBcOeKwB8AMYKmdZA93Wb6Ou4SOR1BXDDqE57TJ6vY1+pTR5Siex8UFpz\n5LlqSPnIFEV6+Y9mDD4tRY+hTPYWq/uLP4YKGcqwDMheCQRBW+eloPmkBXEC2xCv\nTVhAR7bDlrRQdLQl/yjI\n=nPfc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-14T13:53:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8","node_id":"C_kwDOBEhK7NoAKDM5NzI2ZTc2MzY0ODQ5OGE5NjQxZTU1OTgxMDJjNWEyZmIzZGIxZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb","sha":"7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb"}],"sha":"39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/39726e763648498a9641e5598102c5a2fb3db1e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zburke","id":199241,"login":"zburke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTI0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T15:18:36Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T15:18:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-635 provide Suspense boundaries around modules, plugins (#1669)\n\nProvide `<Suspense>` boundaries around modules and plugins, immediately\nabove where those components are mounted, in contrast to previous PRs\n(e.g. #1213, #1147) where the boundary was substantially above the\ncomponent itself, causing significant UI jank when larger parts of the\nUI loaded/unloaded while waiting for the suspended component.\n\n* https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-webpack/pull/168, which supplies\n  the `getModule()` function where _actual_ module-loading happens, is\n  necessary for this change to have any effect. Until that PR merges, this\n  is a nothing-burger, providing a Suspense-wrapper around synchronous\n  loading.\n\nNote: Refactoring `BadRequestScreen` and\n`ResetPasswordNotAvailableScreen` into `AuthenticatedError` is an\ninsignificant side-effect here. It just helped to clean up logic in\n`ModuleRoutes` as I was piecing together how all this works.\n\nRefs STCOR-635","tree":{"sha":"107408e51e6204617edf65b0ab7ec63fa7a06f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/107408e51e6204617edf65b0ab7ec63fa7a06f44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/7ee18e02da3b3525ed7db660537c3112349e38eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 107408e51e6204617edf65b0ab7ec63fa7a06f44\nparent 212db1b0d494c5aa3e2a9ba7019186ecc3301698\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1761146316 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761146316 -0400\n\nSTCOR-635 provide Suspense boundaries around modules, plugins (#1669)\n\nProvide `<Suspense>` boundaries around modules and plugins, immediately\nabove where those components are mounted, in contrast to previous PRs\n(e.g. #1213, #1147) where the boundary was substantially above the\ncomponent itself, causing significant UI jank when larger parts of the\nUI loaded/unloaded while waiting for the suspended component.\n\n* https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-webpack/pull/168, which supplies\n  the `getModule()` function where _actual_ module-loading happens, is\n  necessary for this change to have any effect. Until that PR merges, this\n  is a nothing-burger, providing a Suspense-wrapper around synchronous\n  loading.\n\nNote: Refactoring `BadRequestScreen` and\n`ResetPasswordNotAvailableScreen` into `AuthenticatedError` is an\ninsignificant side-effect here. It just helped to clean up logic in\n`ModuleRoutes` as I was piecing together how all this works.\n\nRefs STCOR-635","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo+PXMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu3oQAEn0Szd+A+Vf3DqNT6eg8ge+\nV92XFSy93wYtjLXScyvmJu1w9VHh3zTE16Dx0I/0sKNavpK43hs4N8trscMr6Nfn\np3opxaRabSIn3Nu2KzfIpvmLNUeu+CHvbwYPRMLpP5+Q4+P/ewAgEhwukCoSvZVw\noO55NT2vsnA1FjI2ikLhVTnK9gI9+f08Ae5tjDERH0mu9vmLHrBJzFSnPR9eMPq5\nAm168t5w2NVQkkajdlxsH4mzwes7BdWUE76Wf/z4Sf+IgUGZsSAuYbS5UgiTkhju\nkhzVgfjc3HgYZvEOAvzHXSRuGdTS567TzUhuN0L9duhXR4unbZQC5jlm8pFOg+ba\nMvLCfAay/ZXA6UmZUqHSHRnlfOK/YfL4bh/QNGZSD+Dle8v0I243W8AT5z1h407j\nq+Sb91N4Td/cvvC4ObQOtu0DcpkZAxjeJTXQ8Qk1mi5u1nhrOIOXtRNGVwsxLJiL\n68Nb1K3FFsJ80B5wClBiJcXQymxLPFKg7gthjP/SRTshM6ADegliC1MkGOTfQ115\natXfOZS+WVoE6LDtVdYOv5f6GzD2RTa4Ms3Bl9VW7KUrv86fxFseb20Bfpdfr7jg\nLTgOlrur7TOAjJCy3aRTW4QD9elnHn+D4hwqkk4T07FHOt+GLBz7sQiJ32nVRb3O\nozcTNvPjBAZf9bauPLpk\n=TJTa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-22T15:18:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi