,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/212db1b0d494c5aa3e2a9ba7019186ecc3301698/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T13:31:06Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T13:31:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-1004 loginServices: replace promises with async/await (#1666)\n\nConsistently use `async`/`await` in all `loginServices.js` code. This\nmakes things consistent and clear, hopefully avoiding the kinds of bugs\nwe''ve had to patch in #1014, #1102, #1629, #1659, ...\n\nRefs STCOR-1004","tree":{"sha":"5739a0b994a51d619fa2048aaa05458bc2f195d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/5739a0b994a51d619fa2048aaa05458bc2f195d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/212db1b0d494c5aa3e2a9ba7019186ecc3301698","verification":{"payload":"tree 5739a0b994a51d619fa2048aaa05458bc2f195d7\nparent 714559e0618b649dfcbbba17fd52e46c6af2f940\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1761139866 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761139866 -0400\n\nSTCOR-1004 loginServices: replace promises with async/await (#1666)\n\nConsistently use `async`/`await` in all `loginServices.js` code. This\nmakes things consistent and clear, hopefully avoiding the kinds of bugs\nwe''ve had to patch in #1014, #1102, #1629, #1659, ...\n\nRefs STCOR-1004","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo+NyaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAni4QAF1z7clQEKrw5YolHeW4w/Ku\nUDzcI6ffkrj6pspj0VgeBETFUJzFpWnrVYkTwIeMhZW5Im2GY/J2T96vM96zG88H\nTpWRqBXcsGFuLPOP/sT31A4zMhwKrNObNjoutx0oGDAguQnSttNkIsnQcR/p2qec\nkFHtsIo3/4hM98hHMIHBCX3sOibdNSdkUcdh39MiXht/5lh/HOf+jt1ZLTM+HybX\nirTN9Wk7m0o2HJs8za90thjNoypas/DPGHw8l/jrZlS6Yx3TSfJC9roT+4TRm37L\n9VE41yeCJY