https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/c30d9c1136ea73efc8585df475e85e967e333448","node_id":"C_kwDOBEhK7NoAKGMzMGQ5YzExMzZlYTczZWZjODU4NWRmNDc1ZTg1ZTk2N2UzMzM0NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f","sha":"14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f"}],"sha":"c30d9c1136ea73efc8585df475e85e967e333448","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/c30d9c1136ea73efc8585df475e85e967e333448"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zburke","id":199241,"login":"zburke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTI0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-03T21:54:37Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-03T21:54:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-986 handle OTP in StrictMode (#1652)\n\nEffects run twice in `<StrictMode>`, but OTP must only happen once; make\nit so.\n\nThis PR changes the way OIDCLanding handles OTP exchange, moving it from\nan effect (which will run x2 in development when `<StrictMode>` is\nturned on, which of course we want it to be), outside the component\nlifecycle so it only runs once no matter how many times the component is\nmounted/unmounted/remounted in development-mode.\n\nIt may bother you that there is both an event-handler and an effect to\nhandle the same thing, and that''s fair. The problem is, there is a race\ncondition between the OTP-exchange request and the component loading,\nand we want to initialize the session no matter who wins the race:\n\n* if the component loads before the request finishes, then storage will\n  be empty when the effect runs so nothing will happen then 😢 but the\n  event handler will catch the event emitted when the request finally\n  finishes 😍\n* if the request finishes before the component loads, then there won’t\n  be a handler to listen for the event so nothing will happen 😢 but the\n  effect runs when the component mounts and will find the data in storage\n  😍\n\nRefs STCOR-986","tree":{"sha":"ea08284ede0e1610cf413f4ba3f52556a33ecef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/ea08284ede0e1610cf413f4ba3f52556a33ecef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f","verification":{"payload":"tree ea08284ede0e1610cf413f4ba3f52556a33ecef1\nparent d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1756936477 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1756936477 -0400\n\nSTCOR-986 handle OTP in StrictMode (#1652)\n\nEffects run twice in `<StrictMode>`, but OTP must only happen once; make\nit so.\n\nThis PR changes the way OIDCLanding handles OTP exchange, moving it from\nan effect (which will run x2 in development when `<StrictMode>` is\nturned on, which of course we want it to be), outside the component\nlifecycle so it only runs once no matter how many times the component is\nmounted/unmounted/remounted in development-mode.\n\nIt may bother you that there is both an event-handler and an effect to\nhandle the same thing, and that''s fair. The problem is, there is a race\ncondition between the OTP-exchange request and the component loading,\nand we want to initialize the session no matter who wins the race:\n\n* if the component loads before the request finishes, then storage will\n  be empty when the effect runs so nothing will happen then 😢 but the\n  event handler will catch the event emitted when the request finally\n  finishes 😍\n* if the request finishes before the component loads, then there won’t\n  be a handler to listen for the event so nothing will happen 😢 but the\n  effect runs when the component mounts and will find the data in storage\n  😍\n\nRefs STCOR-986","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJouLkdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARvkQAHbFXeKyUa5CoWSxGDbtDIha\nDYJumJNSd7SO4GObmiEoCMI6sXMPU9f0WcT0hR7Wd7xPvp1yVjIEIkwGYDscIAYZ\nEJQIMiAXcwlxt6uRniQU9RPXCwt16L8bPbNO0/0HVUoUlpef1A67fMvRlzq2DYKf\nHrlEkV5QG2uMuaZMPDvK8EqONIXylx8cuX15ZCXJ+EqH0fmenskYWfBnsYmE7ZSV\ntXKcXr/s2Q6yX2YUBBEGpnfhDP0ImT5Dd4Xd9iIp05riceXxPlQUUcBmXx6Oc5uR\n/j+17mcB6jMYKQw01X1yXb2hSCSXWb/eaAMP4qBd3v09SdHVx9y0fsnlE7Y+eYxn\n3y17izkyEHEYPopFEv3l7RkHpXsX7ruF4TsfPoQymBbcjfUrGUVzQTCpzdPFa/XS\nR3VLd17A0IaN+UVi1sVU+oj3KmrVEW0av/H7Jq0T1xt+unKgXbf6NItZNK0BRUEY\n4qnXTXinlI+AoF+eW/ezyjJXmbaN6pHtQOw10NhspJ9K5cU1mip8t59kCVdIVGPR\nod96hQI5RPgsaNharP1iviivzpTDbCLOJ16ZMIsFnHBGjHjJ6lof4a9hRWfP7rJ5\nP2z46xA7C/0g02KVjHdJMmR38aVlalJwf8g0VcpGpnGQF5RTzhu96hFDcvIPtPlq\n147pXfA+QFmjy7P5pRSc\n=zzzX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-03T21:54:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f","node_id":"C_kwDOBEhK7NoAKDE0ODI4YzhjZTljZGM4ODA0OTVlZjgxZjYzNDY4OTc3OGRmZmNmN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/commit/d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e","sha":"d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e"}],"sha":"14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/14828c8ce9cdc880495ef81f634689778dffcf7f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zburke","id":199241,"login":"zburke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTI0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/commits/d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-03T20:44:53Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-03T20:44:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STCOR-985 correctly implement tenant-selection on init (#1649)\n\nDuring initialization, derive the tenant via one of the following\nsources, in order of preference:\n\n1. URL in the `tenant` and `client_id` search params\n2. stripes-config in the `config.tenantOptions` object\n3. stripes-config in the `okapi` object\n\nPrevious implementations ignored option-2, causing tenant to be\nundefined in Eureka-FOLIO builds where the (deprecated) `okapi` object\nhad been omitted from `stripes.config.js` and a session has not been\nstarted, e.g. because the user has not authenticated and is submitting\nthe \"Forgot password\" form.\n\nRefs STCOR-985","tree":{"sha":"2a37b870d7a8731b4545f063338ca5fda30a95f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/2a37b870d7a8731b4545f063338ca5fda30a95f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/d345ca543e7954b0701ad1538e764ad010d3cc8e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a37b870d7a8731b4545f063338ca5fda30a95f2\nparent 894d25aa807ae138e951f6d771d7bd61655afbe9\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1756932293 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1756932293 -0400\n\nSTCOR-985 correctly implement tenant-selection on init (#1649)\n\nDuring initialization, derive the tenant via one of the following\nsources, in order of preference:\n\n1. URL in the `tenant` and `client_id` search params\n2. stripes-config in the `config.tenantOptions` object\n3. stripes-config in the `okapi` object\n\nPrevious implementations ignored option-2, causing tenant to be\nundefined in Eureka-FOLIO builds where the (deprecated) `okapi` object\nhad been omitted from `stripes.config.js` and a session has not been\nstarted, e.g. because the user has not authenticated and is submitting\nthe \"Forgot password\" form.\n\nRefs STCOR-985","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJouKjFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM+oQAJJ7kvnlGSAgyl9d9n3wsSU5\nrWv6EUlXhi7zWDYsuWAFSJgaMhPYUK2hZytqcEfIzgbJMLKWJE7A9NSU07o+6la9\n6LW60GHnB0daKCZS9J/R5NufxV8zoxykIAE8CcYspj20ngUEY7E7MfRl5Ljk/pFK\nL/jhW63rccXGD12fkI8datboH7uuV9GbjD+BVaUUAGnKYkezXJswCa3WheeqWNzX\nWVe7pFRJhv/CWksImncUYO40GlO7j417LJBGUUnfvidZf1lcxfNQ/7B6qLKsyV4T\nlLv9ZwfDNp9iJtiI01WGaAoBEqxYQZaCyzGCkVpIVmiHfUk+UJMnIO8Gi/u2S8jJ\nGgp/RTNBUHx+xYvT8Q+j4VWVh40j7r0aPZ8/N9IP6Desm1aLwW/am9IzJgkH/pFo\n07Mi8Q7lNtIwAkcLCHNzaku70SfR5oqUFcwIp3b6dLMvIqVv9XXh87UTskU7XNwW\nMT30R6pF0GuccFKORBKw3qVEbACmFfzh7xJfHO6PwaipXVLaGco1e/1t7XbFRiHn\nj2ycfrLyWiECbuh+WrjG/Eq0rAP0XF0IdxUk5NotH2/lCOcSgxyaoFdOkMaquvkA\nm2Ou15eBIHUbBGa2+gMhX0+6Wr+lkaaMm22wzRiCWGokBkLWPbjub4QKzR+hNAeP\nKkCaSAzYI8gVGIRD2KmH\n=Lf0e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-09-03T20:44:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0N