n\n* remove `./utils`; its scripts haven''t been useful in ages\n* remove unused dependencies\n* `moment-timezone` is for parsing/displaying, but that''s all handled\nwithin stripes-components\n* `react-transform-catch-errors` was part of the initial commit\n`4a70be3201d485c32ec88daa34799dbbb3aa5d35` but must have been\ninactivated as the webpack and babel configs were centralized and we\nmigrated off `react-hot-loader`\n\nMaybe it seems harmless to leave this stuff around (maybe it''ll be\nuseful some day! don''t throw that out!) but given that stripes-core\ndoesn''t have a `build` step to strip away this kind of tooling from a\npublished release, keeping it doesn''t seem worth the risk.\n\nRefs STCOR-959","tree":{"sha":"f66092c059df2bc3ea8c1e4b05f47a56df33cec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/trees/f66092c059df2bc3ea8c1e4b05f47a56df33cec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-core/git/commits/bdc58cbbbdb10ecc681046dcd2a6e525dff43ca8","verification":{"payload":"tree f66092c059df2bc3ea8c1e4b05f47a56df33cec2\nparent 034984258e7e0bd7364de4f1f326b3836755a6cb\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1744138498 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744138498 -0400\n\nSTCOR-959 prune cruft (#1612)\n\n* remove `./utils`; its scripts haven''t been useful in ages\n* remove unused dependencies\n* `moment-timezone` is for parsing/displaying, but that''s all handled\nwithin stripes-components\n* `react-transform-catch-errors` was part of the initial commit\n`4a70be3201d485c32ec88daa34799dbbb3aa5d35` but must have been\ninactivated as the webpack and babel configs were centralized and we\nmigrated off `react-hot-loader`\n\nMaybe it seems harmless to leave this stuff around (maybe it''ll be\nuseful some day! don''t throw that out!) but given that stripes-core\ndoesn''t have a `build` step to strip away this kind of tooling from a\npublished release, keeping it doesn''t seem worth the risk.\n\nRefs STCOR-959","reason":"valid","s