r":{"date":"2026-10-05T04:04:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(erxes-api-shared): make the package loadable from Node ESM (#9550)\n\nThe hand-written exports map pointed the import condition at preconstruct''s\n.esm.js bundles, which are bundler-targeted: they import lodash by named\nexports and graphql/language as a directory, so a plain Node ESM consumer\nfailed on the first import. Let preconstruct generate the exports map\ninstead (module for bundlers, default -> CJS for Node), keeping the legacy\n./src entries as extra exports.\n\nCo-authored-by: Amartuvshin Surenjav <amaraa@Erxess-Mac-mini-5.local>","tree":{"sha":"835e4b4b99cf7af6ba8b938dba0b7c997efd83ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/trees/835e4b4b99cf7af6ba8b938dba0b7c997efd83ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/commits/c784d4d4133b2dd81fab89dc1c4d8a181e3a79d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 835e4b4b99cf7af6ba8b938dba0b7c997efd83ec\nparent 9444e07ced69e2a119414fe5571e3032059c742e\nauthor Amartuvshin Surenjav <65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com> 1791173063 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791173063 +0800\n\nfix(erxes-api-shared): make the package loadable from Node ESM (#9550)\n\nThe hand-written exports map pointed the import condition at preconstruct''s\n.esm.js bundles, which are bundler-targeted: they import lodash by named\nexports and graphql/language as a directory, so a plain Node ESM consumer\nfailed on the first import. Let preconstruct generate the exports map\ninstead (module for bundlers, default -> CJS for Node), keeping the legacy\n./src entries as extra exports.\n\nCo-authored-by: Amartuvshin Surenjav <amaraa@Erxess-Mac-mini-5.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwyHHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1KUQACJIVovqSHPcJlLRoG1do4sQ\ngmeV4rCtFwNkEnP1DnkB4B4QyPhs0sgE65cPbfE/28p145asbOuf9g+cREUQ4AUh\njiQBubkwDLdH5Vud9BsW1PrkccIVG4h0oewZPpXMkRDxUMmk7h+RpLU96By8Cb1A\n