olated erxes-ui cursor and page-info snippets.\ngraphql-tag-pluck drops interpolated text, so their generated types were\nmissing pageInfo; they now spell the fields out.\n\n* fix(payment): declare graphql-ws for the widget apollo link\n\n* fix(operation): align @apollo/client on one graphql-ws v6 peer variant","tree":{"sha":"050bc9267778ca3d072f9a62668ed1dd1d912bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/trees/050bc9267778ca3d072f9a62668ed1dd1d912bd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/commits/9444e07ced69e2a119414fe5571e3032059c742e","verification":{"payload":"tree 050bc9267778ca3d072f9a62668ed1dd1d912bd6\nparent d8842a1962fc17188c5eb21160a957215381ae2d\nauthor Aviddaram <130821636+darjss@users.noreply.github.com> 1791171202 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791171202 +0800\n\nfeat(operation): catch GraphQL drift in operation_ui at build time (#9489)\n\n* feat(operation): validate operation_ui GraphQL documents against the printed schema\n\noperation_api gets a schema:print target that builds the subgraph schema from\nits existing typeDefs and subscription fields and writes it to\ngenerated/schema.graphql, offline. operation_ui gets a codegen target\n(client-preset) that validates all 69 documents against it and generates\ntypes into src/gql. Both outputs are gitignored and build/serve depend on\ncodegen.\n\nFive list queries interpolated erxes-ui cursor and page-info snippets.\ngraphql-tag-pluck drops interpolated text, so their generated types were\nmissing pageInfo; they now spell the fields out.\n\n* fix(payment): declare graphql-ws for the widget apollo link\n\n* fix(operation): align @apollo/client on one graphql-ws v6 peer variant","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwxqCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANKMQADhiwlMDyctX9cuj6hfQ3UFN\n0rbJORVTToBvg8hhANZikjqZrqPkXWxsCVPEZtlubQD5mE8yNpTY5GLXJ6Zt3m9z\nmM1wO1H6xMhBGfZ7M/QimOHlFODUiCJgrR49hJB0tP+NhJ6AoNJF0RtqNNil65FF\ni2+hJXb9fAuhSKVtySoxkt5a40o