9ca6e1e8aab982206248eaf3c549f632aa","node_id":"C_kwDOBGDPsNoAKGQzYjk4MTljYTZlMWU4YWFiOTgyMjA2MjQ4ZWFmM2M1NDlmNjMyYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erxes/erxes/commit/c92ada9f1617af32b1424c65a0c152249b71d991","sha":"c92ada9f1617af32b1424c65a0c152249b71d991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/commits/c92ada9f1617af32b1424c65a0c152249b71d991"}],"sha":"d3b9819ca6e1e8aab982206248eaf3c549f632aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/commits/d3b9819ca6e1e8aab982206248eaf3c549f632aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104069564?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wlkr123","id":104069564,"login":"Wlkr123","node_id":"U_kgDOBjP5vA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wlkr123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/commits/c92ada9f1617af32b1424c65a0c152249b71d991/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:03:54Z","email":"104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuguldur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:03:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(properties): safe property edits, archive/restore, usage checks and layouts (#9548)\n\n* feat(properties): enhance property validation and layout management\n\n- Updated PropertyFormValidations to use ToggleGroup for validation selection.\n- Added layout editing capabilities in PropertyGroupLayoutSheet with drag-and-drop support.\n- Introduced PropertyLogicFieldSelect for improved field selection in logic conditions.\n- Enhanced field types to include deprecated options and updated related components.\n- Implemented group layout utilities to manage field arrangements in PropertyGroup.\n- Added new hooks and states for managing layout editing and field grouping.\n- Improved user experience by displaying appropriate messages and handling loading states.\n\n* feat: implement customer create field settings reset command\n\n- Add a new command to reset customer create field settings in MongoDB.\n- Update properties metadata to include visibility and requirement rules for customer fields.\n- Modify system field schema to remove default values for visibility and requirement flags.\n- Enhance GraphQL schemas and queries to support new field properties.\n- Update AddCustomerForm to dynamically validate fields based on new rules.\n- Introduce hooks for managing create field rules based on property settings.\n- Add constants for customer select options to standardize values across the application.\n\n* feat: add system fields layout management and customer form fields\n\n- Implemented SystemFieldsLayoutSheet component for managing system fields layout.\n- Created hooks for saving group layouts and system fields layout.\n- Developed useLayoutEditor hook for drag-and-drop layout editing.\n- Added CustomerFormFields component with various input fields for customer data.\n- Introduced CustomerSystemFields component to render customer fields based on layout.\n- Created customer field renderers for modular field rendering.\n- Established customer form schema using Zod for validation.\n- Added GraphQL queries for fetching system field rules and layouts.\n- Implemented hooks for managing system field rules and layouts.\n- Created GridRows component for rendering grid layouts.\n\n* feat(properties): enhance inline editing and save state management for fields\n\n* feat(properties): implement property usage records and archived properties management\n\n- Add PropertyUsageRecords component to display usage of property values.\n- Create PropertiesArchivedSection for managing archived fields and groups.\n- Refactor PropertiesColumns to handle field removal via archiving instead of deletion.\n- Update PropertiesCommandBar to support bulk archiving of selected fields.\n- Introduce useFieldValueUsage hook for fetching field usage data.\n- Implement usePropertyArchive hook for archiving and restoring properties.\n- Remove deprecated field and group removal hooks.\n- Add OptionLabel component for displaying field options with archived status.\n- Update various field components to utilize OptionLabel for consistent option display.\n- Introduce new GraphQL mutations and queries for archiving and restoring fields/groups.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 9b8b607 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/9548\n\n* refactor: change _root type from any to undefined in field and group mutations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a616c7ae9c8ad2924ca334e82691c8c40d8ef19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/trees/4a616c7ae9c8ad2924ca334e82691c8c40d8ef19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erxes/erxes/git/commits/c92ada9f1617af32b1424c65a0c152249b71d991","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a616c7ae9c8ad2924ca334e82691c8c40d8ef19\nparent 1db32772f9611cc29bbad81a7deec98dc51292db\nauthor Tuguldur <104069564+Wlkr123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791119034 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791119034 +0800\n\nfeat(properties): safe property edits, archive/restore, usage checks and layouts (#9548)\n\n* feat(properties): enhance property validation and layout management\n\n- Updated PropertyFormValidations to use ToggleGroup for validation selection.\n- Added layout editing capabilities in PropertyGroupLayoutSheet with drag-and-drop support.\n- Introduced PropertyLogicFieldSelect for improved field selection in logic conditions.\n- Enhanced field types to include deprecated options and updated related components.\n- Implemented group layout utilities to manage field arrangements in PropertyGroup.\n- Added new hooks and states for managing layout editing and field grouping.\n- Improved user experience by displaying appropriate messages and handling loading states.\n\n* feat: implement customer create field settings reset command\n\n- Add a new command to reset customer create field settings in MongoDB.\n- Update properties metadata to include visibility and requirement rules for customer fields.\n- Modify system field schema to remove default values for visibility and requirement flags.\n- Enhance GraphQL schemas and queries to support new field properties.\n- Update AddCustomerForm to dynamically validate fields based on new rules.\n- Introduce hooks for managing create field rules based on property settings.\n- Add constants for customer select options to standardize values across the application.\n\n* feat: add system fields layout management and customer form fields\n\n- Implemented SystemFieldsLayoutSheet component for managing system fields layout.\n- Created hooks for saving group layouts and system fields layout.\n- Developed useLayoutEditor hook for drag-and-drop layout editing.\n- Added CustomerFormFields component with various input fields for customer data.\n- Introduced CustomerSystemFields component to render customer fields based on layout.\n- Created customer field renderers for modular field rendering.\n- Established customer form schema using Zod for validation.\n- Added GraphQL queries for fetching system field rules and layouts.\n- Implemented hooks for managing system field rules and layouts.\n- Created GridRows component for rendering grid layouts.\n\n* feat(properties): enhance inline editing and save state management for fields\n\n* feat(properties): implement property usage records and archived properties management\n\n- Add PropertyUsageRecords component to display usage of property values.\n- Create PropertiesArchivedSection for managing archived fields and groups.\n- Refactor PropertiesColumns to handle field removal via archiving instead of deletion.\n- Update PropertiesCommandBar to support bulk archiving of selected fields.\n- Introduce useFieldValueUsage hook for fetching field usage data.\n- Implement usePropertyArchive hook for archiving and restoring properties.\n- Remove deprecated field and group removal hooks.\n- Add OptionLabel component for displaying field options with archived status.\n- Update various field components to utilize OptionLabel for consistent option display.\n- Introduce new GraphQL mutations and queries for archiving and restoring fields/groups.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 9b8b607 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/9548\n\n* refactor: change _root type from any to undefined in field and group mutations\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwk66CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdw4QAJHFk8P06tZbsJDfAt5QbqV2\nYgN57RJm+xwrWJXEKxCnTUJwIarMBOsnXL2JbHdzY2DxumjCovhg/fbgkWnpX7kG\nExnyqFKvDy/Q9v898AQHxdy5pq32cR0ApuaZaVemLmPPQiBFMKHrNWAYnHT0Agtj\nI69CKkWwg17NO7lPEjcgg3JHfK/V0ijG/McwLH9qvgOe6Hts9TjqvEzM0nm6CNN3\nCaQx4uMngEGQ3Dq50aLknvytrLiQdfu4riejm7tIFNg5yjsv2S5+PVEIZdq5ggo8\naAxCJwuJPQFC0GqDoch8/yUitsc7mXD2LihyK9/pwjzs2tF79KFod+pBrib/qiYq\nkSj5z/fst6dKd51+k71x7ivNl+JxG4se4FwDjNE+aWB8IDhn+mg+0rywpwbx2kHf\nZY7voWkGDx0Hp5FJ+RpR3tAURi2WRv0rVd0SvOqZt7xpQF29aj7klV5i847l9umz\n81