ubscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/single-spa/single-spa-angular/commit/b984dae72e075213f8da3df60f160d5fe1cd8137","node_id":"C_kwDOBGL2-toAKGI5ODRkYWU3MmUwNzUyMTNmOGRhM2RmNjBmMTYwZDVmZTFjZDgxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/single-spa/single-spa-angular/commit/b713ce619861aade1ee7d11d5e00ab67c3be5894","sha":"b713ce619861aade1ee7d11d5e00ab67c3be5894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/single-spa/single-spa-angular/commits/b713ce619861aade1ee7d11d5e00ab67c3be5894"}],"sha":"b984dae72e075213f8da3df60f160d5fe1cd8137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/single-spa/single-spa-angular/commits/b984dae72e075213f8da3df60f160d5fe1cd8137"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7337691?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arturovt","id":7337691,"login":"arturovt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMzc2OTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arturovt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/single-spa/single-spa-angular/commits/b713ce619861aade1ee7d11d5e00ab67c3be5894/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T05:39:25Z","email":"arthurandrosovich@gmail.com","name":"Artur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T05:39:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: support mounting multiple instances of the same parcel config (#573)\n\nPreviously, the options object returned by `singleSpaAngular()` stored\nlifecycle state (`bootstrappedRef`, `bootstrappedNgZone`,\n`routingEventListener`) as flat singleton properties. When the same\nparcel config was passed to `mountRootParcel()` more than once, all\ninstances shared this state, causing only one parcel to function\ncorrectly.\n\nFixes this by introducing a per-instance `instances` map on the options\nobject, keyed by `props.name || props.appName`. Each call to\n`bootstrap`, `mount`, and `unmount` now reads and writes its own\n`BootstrappedInstanceRef` entry, so multiple parcels using the same\nconfig are fully independent.\n\nThis mirrors the fix applied to single-spa-react in\nsingle-spa/single-spa-react#68 and follows the pattern originally\nsuggested in the issue.\n\nCloses #234","tree":{"sha":"51e909832c49096908b1cae0db33090dfdef1605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/single-spa/single-spa-angular/git/trees/51e909832c49096908b1cae0db33090dfdef1605"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/single-spa/single-spa-angular/git/commits/b713ce619861aade1ee7d11d5e00ab67c3be5894","verification":{"payload":"tree 51e909832c49096908b1cae0db33090dfdef1605\nparent f4735c3f7c13d1d22c0399c6253c1aa7d66d0819\nauthor Artur <arthurandrosovich@gmail.com> 1776317965 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776317965 +0000\n\nfix: support mounting multiple instances of the same parcel config (#573)\n\nPreviously, the options object returned by `singleSpaAngular()` stored\nlifecycle state (`bootstrappedRef`, `bootstrappedNgZone`,\n`routingEventListener`) as flat singleton properties. When the same\nparcel config was passed to `mountRootParcel()` more than once, all\ninstances shared this state, causing only one parcel to function\ncorrectly.\n\nFixes this by introducing a per-instance `instances` map on the options\nobject, keyed by `props.name || props.appName`. Each call to\n`bootstrap`, `mount`, and `unmount` now reads and writes its own\n`BootstrappedInstanceRef` entry, so multiple parcels using the same\nconfig are fully independent.\n\nThis mirrors the fix applied to single-spa-react in\nsingle-spa/single-spa-react#68 and follows the pattern originally\nsuggested in the issue.\n\nCloses #234","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4HYNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7i0QAJU4pBjWFm9Yu3piWXoiH7BM\ns8DJsQJAocPtYc/ZqQayzsH5mvhYcdWmR8CcFwi4Ugd4Jb3tiTqE+ebG/wt5uho9\nGJnXeXnrECjhMURYIQQ5LJwyIjA3Lsg5qNX6M32c/snV0gcSYN1OZz+x1oyfeGsH\nLU83c/uWzvvyqVLxJTlI8xCJMWcVeShXWWNz7IvH7RVRrfh7ZfP7WTp/Q7T76RGw\nk4kpVj+uie6RcfNTXDmjWStHlKI1DEhWW5M18auBQAQrmOxHrmzcSkB8eL2IZSvu\nGcBivOUEpCaihqKsWo9+WuDs/8WldiaSoGvyP+BH5613TI8GhQy+XlHWdWNcBLVD\nkT9R6cGBJ0U/i9Tug5XnKCUNTbP7hMoX4TfJB6nkKqkwp0YLypgs2RLTwprHYFIv\nesHhtGDk+rWiAOrjWex5LdIQbdAiF3WCBckGBm5lukdP9wl+UatXHkAFj5UG1Uld\nDXvJfO92TPMmeTn7I8Im+dwTKtxhviPTWJBHXGwlE/LlUv6qextmgm2LbqoTmz+Q\nOZ0q1B1JkQThI6+fRTdeaNrSz+MOH6t/s8RTYy4AZfmzwOGb+DoXLYJnjInCgCMG\n8Nq8Pe8OFpFZ2eiNAB1fgYzv4Dxx99TbAcj45XsL3+G7i3f9oPhdU/54bMcCHEvz\npvFUNPourcOkg3F8cVbp\n=IrjA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T05:39:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api